】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1579","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\npocketbell.kappa\/home\/top\nそして、ポケベルで再生にカーソルを合わせて、クリックする。\n操作\nWeb\n進む\n戻る\n閉じる\n再生\nオプション\nURL情報\nもっと…\nポケベルはさまざまな人々の\n「誰かと繋がりたい」という\n思いが沢山こもった製品として\n平成初期から中期にかけて\n流行した通話機能を有する機器\nであり、国会においてスマート\nフォンマナーの問題が挙げられ\n国民のスマートフォン利用を\n原則中止すると、我ら河童\nが生み出したこのポケベルが\n巨大な需要を生み出して…\nホーム\nポケベルって何？\n出来ること\n河童の技術力\nポケベル史\n政府公認とは？\nポケベルの魅力\n電話の歴史\nポケベルの性能\nポケベルの価格\n必要なもの\n固定電話は必須？\n通信機能について\n政府公認の安心国産ポケベル\n河童放送局\nゆかりんラジオ\nラジオネットを開く\nオプション\nラジオ\n音楽\n動画\nその他…\nPCで再生\nポケベルで再生\nその他の方法…\nゆかりんラジオの詳細","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1580スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C7A73014-82F2-432B-8A6E-A8CEB948FB5D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1580","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\npocketbell.kappa\/radio\/ゆかりんラジオ\/poketbell\nゆかりんラジオ\nすると、違うページが読み込まれる。\n僕は、再生ボタンを押すとモニターから離れる。\n操作\nWeb\n現在放送中：緊急記者会見\nポケベルで流しています…PCで聴く","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1581スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1E6758A8-A390-4AD1-88CC-F1626D1F4441","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1581","telop":"「えー、これから臨時記者会見を行います。まずはじめに、今日の明朝、スクープ報道がありました…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1582スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"27E92FB5-FFA7-4DAE-AAEE-A823B2E798BB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1582","telop":"「…そして、そのスクープは真実であり…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1583スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2F288148-6724-4A00-9443-42E829D5F023","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1583","telop":"「この国が大きく変わったことを皆様に申し上げます…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1584スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D522C487-FEFD-469E-9F9D-58988199D4BC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1584","telop":"「また、スクープにある通り、彼らのこれからの見通しが、立っておらず…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1585スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0AA99A34-3377-4B5A-BB54-B276C2A7E588","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1585","telop":"「どの様な行動をとるのか、先行きが不明な状態です…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1586スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EEF5D479-571C-49CC-81EC-2444A72A1245","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1586","telop":"「ですが…この会見放送をお聞きの皆さん…そしてPCで同時公開中の会見生放送を見ている皆さんに…安全にすごせるように…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1587スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AF5E4A7A-5D1C-48C6-AB8D-3749F9CF8C16","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1587","telop":"「これからの方針を定めた計画が、採択されたことを…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1588スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1DACD953-7EB0-44EE-A7C2-FCA5C4757233","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1588","telop":"「ご報告いたします…この方針は、我が国に平和と安全をもたらすための方針であり…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1589スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FCFD9019-1E8A-439E-A874-FC67686889CB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1589","telop":"「この方針は、我々が従来から掲げている公約に基づくものであり…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1590スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0630B67D-CCA3-468B-94A5-63211E1B0A44","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1590","telop":"「また…この方針の採択に関連して…私たちは…特殊な体制を築き上げ…常に備えることを…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1591スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2478A632-6940-467E-B2B2-C0C8E1A20B9A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1591","telop":"「ここに誓い…このラジオをお聞きの皆さんや生放送を見ている皆様が…安心安全に生活できる様に…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1592スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0E961AE0-4EA2-4A59-BE5F-9B36E94AD798","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1592","telop":"「我々は…心から誓い…私のこの会見をもってして…このことを申し上げます…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1593スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8E684A04-01AF-457F-A41E-1DE7F5E77BB8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1593","telop":"「そして私の会見をラジオでお聞きの皆さん、生放送をご視聴中の皆さんの安全を守り…また我々が掲げる公約を実現し…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1594スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2C74FDD4-1E35-4283-93FC-1B4EE8F1064D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1594","telop":"「皆様に安心と安全、そして平和がもたらされる様に…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1595スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3AFFD7A4-2567-4868-B270-2E36D127FE3E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1595","telop":"「揺れ動く社会全体を安定化させ、世界の見本となれる様に努めてまいります…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1596スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E0FB8D6A-6909-4762-8DDB-8DD9AB463D89","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1596","telop":"「そして、この放送をお聞きの皆様…生放送をご視聴中の皆様…そして私たちを応援してくださる方々が望まれる社会を…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1597スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9FF20FD1-479D-403B-984B-AAD7EECBB259","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1597","telop":"「形作ることをここに誓い…このたびの記者会見を終えます…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1598スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6754BDDB-6FD9-476F-A03F-15A2F6285354","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1598","telop":"彼女がそう発すると、CMになり、会見放送は終了した。僕は、その内容にとても驚き、気がつけば部屋を飛び出していた。\n※察しのいい人にはPCなどが見えます","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1599スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E87A6FAB-5D17-4A9A-9719-7AE867B09F4C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1599","telop":"一方、紫と文がいる会見室では…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1600スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"24201621-515B-4437-935F-60C503C3B3BD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1600","telop":"「はぁ…」私は、文しかいない、会見室での記者会見を終えて、思わずため息をつく。すると、彼女が話しかけてくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1601スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"19283ABB-C4CA-449A-A423-4E06408CB829","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1601","telop":"「大丈夫ですか？疲労が表情に現れてますよ。」\n私は目の前にいる彼女にそう声をかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1602スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"95D5D166-353F-49E4-A0D5-DEBD0AE9BC92","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1602","telop":"「大丈夫よ、文。なんたって私は、幻想郷の賢者なんだから…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1603スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A3C8AA4A-1578-4BF2-BB5D-7CA6A4470E0C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1603","telop":"「でも、いつも結ばれている髪が解けてますし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1604スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"23314089-5795-4B95-B88A-672E53087CF2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1604","telop":"「えっ？」私は、彼女にそう指摘されて、髪を触ると確かに解けていることに気がつく。「気づかなかったわ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1605スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E03C73D0-B392-4482-8392-298C490E9E28","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1605","telop":"「この後はゆっくり休んだほうがいいと思いますよ。今の状態で仕事をしたって、碌な成果は出ないと思いますし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1606スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C3010538-0086-4D13-A17F-EE211F9F5AD2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1606","telop":"「文、大丈夫よ。気にしないで…」\n私はそう言い、壇上から降りようとするとこけて倒れかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1607スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"14B21671-5205-4964-AFF3-940B43F68D78","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1607","telop":"私は、紫が倒れかけると、さっと彼女の体を支える。\n「しっかり休んだほうがいいですよ…そうじゃないと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1608スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"52DF29C9-80F2-4F91-9997-6F158A343395","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1608","telop":"「確かに、文の言うとおりね…。\n久々に休暇でも取ろうかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1609スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"21185EB1-99E1-44EA-A563-913FD6417437","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1609","telop":"「それがいいですよ。あとのことは私から\n藍達に伝えておきますから…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1610スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"23554B11-154F-4B81-ABE4-1ABD99739F3E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1610","telop":"「じゃあ、お願いするわ…」\n私はそう言うと、彼女と共にゆっくりと歩き出した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1611スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D48A3AD6-3EF9-407C-9DB0-C2FFEAD0BD7B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1611","telop":"その頃、操夢達は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1612スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"659BBE0C-5FB6-44D8-B1FA-33F5EA02A1FD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 1612","telop":"僕が、急いで降りてくると、そこには咲夜たちが皆驚いた様子でリビングにいた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1613スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"173DCBEF-99B1-4ED9-B3FA-E4575E0AE2C5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 1613","telop":"「もしかして、みんなさっきの放送を聞いたんですか？」\n僕がそう聴くと、皆そうだと答える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1614スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"DA808D5A-C2EC-48BF-9DF1-E4DEF22FE35D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1614","telop":"「それにしても、紫は大丈夫なのかしら…」\n私はそう口に出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1615スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"122B84A3-436A-4249-B9E7-463FC4F3B389","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1615","telop":"「きっと、紫は疲れているのよ。私は、生放送で見たけど、彼女の髪が結ばれてなかったし、コメント欄が荒らされているし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1616スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"FA7A34A4-B8A5-42E6-B0C0-04D86A38E8F2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1616","telop":"「インターネットっていうのは、あんなにも物騒なのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1617スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"D7207B7A-F206-40F6-B6D2-1738B91BF34E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1617","telop":"「私も生放送で見ましたけど、あれほどコメント欄が荒れて、きっとどっかの誰かさんは紫のことよく思ってなさそうで…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1618スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"04A6F3A1-9DF0-4B5D-B612-0D22706206BD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1618","telop":"「きっとネットなら匿名性が高いからそういうコメントする野蛮人が生まれるのだと思うわ…そんなことはないのに…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1619スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"8E1273EF-F352-4F44-A474-257285909E07","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1619","telop":"「なんか厄介わね…、そういう人たちを批判し始めれば、私たちも同類扱いされるし…、社会ってのは複雑なのかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1620スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"B0ED85AE-2954-4630-8449-6134F61372A7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1620","telop":"「なんだか…世の中って非情なんですね…」\n僕はふとそう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1621スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"81D7379C-ACB3-429F-A379-840507C95B3E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1621","telop":"「その通りね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1622スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"E877984D-5F3D-4685-B9BE-8F3839FEC99E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1622","telop":"「でも、もう過ぎたことにぐちぐち言っていても仕方ないじゃん…だから、みんなで気分転換にでも、外に出ようよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1623スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"61CCB826-C197-4781-9717-EF320751A10D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1623","telop":"「私も、フランと同じ、今日のお昼はみんなで外で食べない？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1624スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"5105F97F-B551-4841-A4CD-7FB57E3B5653","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1624","telop":"「確かにフランお嬢様の言う通りですね…ですが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1625スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"6A78C17C-334F-40C0-9B61-8790CFBDFFEA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1625","telop":"「外食はこの間、したんですから、操夢さんとパチュリーさん以外は私の買い出しを手伝ってもらいますからね…外食は無しですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1626スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"C87B69E1-FF90-40D3-84E0-AAEB148EC0EE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1626","telop":"「分かっているわよ咲夜…、ほらフランたちも咲夜と一緒に買い出しに出かけるわよ…、準備してきなさい…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1627スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"C9A473FB-1A81-4212-8805-9B361E04E7A1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1627","telop":"「分かったよ…お姉様。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1628スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"DFAD7693-D5D4-45D1-825B-44D3C82614CF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1628","telop":"フランがそう言うと、僕は、自分用の子機をもって、自分の部屋にささっと向かうのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1629スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3BF91679-5EB8-4A34-AD18-6D591283A485","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1629","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1630スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"AE112D98-10CD-4B9B-A8C7-422AADE1D75E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1630","telop":"僕は、自分の部屋に自分用の子機とポケベルと周辺機器を持ってきて、子機の設定を済ますと、PCを再び触り始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1631スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"B0DBD0E7-46C5-4389-9691-DDBDA32398F6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1631","telop":"すると、咲夜たちが帰ってきて、一緒に昼食を取ると、僕はふと眠気がして、自分の部屋に戻り、昼寝をする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1632スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"C6DE4A4A-DC37-4686-8A23-82FEC87CCA8B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/魔理沙（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1632","telop":"僕がふと目を覚ますと、ふと夕陽が窓から差し込み、ベッドの上には魔理沙がいた。すると彼女は星空を見ようぜと言ってきて…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"8135AB98-8CA7-4E7A-ADE9-C39B7F6757AC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"4D0FFD79-867C-417D-847F-E3830E35DAEC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1635スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"49A067D5-3EB5-46DF-9B63-74CE78A273E4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1635","telop":"僕は自室に早速、子機とポケベルとキーボードとモニター、マウスを持ってくると子機を起動する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1636スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F94720B7-8DFA-4B60-B196-1F47C31E8668","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1636","telop":"僕はPCを起動すると、そのまま初期化を実施して、\nこの画面になると、エンターキーを押す。\n初回設定\nようこそ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1637スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D214AA8D-998E-491B-8384-D97B58551BF0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1637","telop":"すると新しい画面が出てきて、「日本語」を選択する。\n初回設定\n言語を選択してください。\n日本語\/Japanese\n英語\/English","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1638スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"745B331A-A2A4-4C81-BAD0-83AA975AD61A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1638","telop":"僕は、「自動取得」を選択する。\n初回設定\n地域を選択してください。\n自動取得\nヘルプ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1639スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"675D7626-1EB1-4BEE-8879-94906067B7D7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1639","telop":"すると、「位置情報を取得中です…」と表示される。\n初回設定\n位置情報を取得中です…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1640スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"067CE08C-A98A-484F-9B44-311E9967DB96","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1640","telop":"僕はそのままエンターキーを押す。\n初回設定\n次の地域で正しければ、エンターキーを押します。\n東アジア連邦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1641スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"25E3A126-9246-4DD8-B71A-D3F6716BC6AF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1641","telop":"すると、「インターネットに接続しています…」と表示される。\n初回設定\nインターネットに接続しています…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1642スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CBC8192B-1694-462D-A936-FEA94D1FF3F8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1642","telop":"僕は、「ネットワークを新しく構成する」を選択する。\n初回設定\nエラー：インターネットに接続できませんでした。\n以下のいずれかから選択します。\nリロード\nネットワークを\n新しく構成する\nオフラインで\n続行する","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1643スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0D57E261-FA6A-46ED-A0A2-24E8653D2E63","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1643","telop":"続けて僕は、「ポケベルを使用」を選択する。\n初回設定\n接続方法を選択します。オフラインで続行する場合は、\nこの設定をスキップを選択します。\nネットワークを設定\nポケベルを使用\nこの設定をスキップ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1644スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3D05690A-EF12-46D0-82CF-A5912ECC5348","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1644","telop":"すると、「ポケベルに接続しています…」と表示される。\n初回設定\nポケベルに接続しています…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1645スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1A4A6996-D3F9-4B04-95D8-FCD98A3730F4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1645","telop":"続けて、「インターネットに接続しています…」と表示される。\n初回設定\nインターネットに接続しています…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1646スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A8808622-041E-4887-AADD-44DC9322921F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1646","telop":"すると、「タイムネットに接続しています…」と表示される。\n初回設定\nタイムネットに接続しています…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1647スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"657A0A8D-87B4-41CE-8B1A-2204FE7D9876","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1647","telop":"そして、「ライセンスなどを確認中です…」と表示される。\n初回設定\nライセンスなどを確認中です…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1648スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0E0A9C3F-68CF-4757-9CBC-F2F80A8A98D4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1648","telop":"僕はこの画面が出ると、「個人用」を選択する。\n初回設定\nアカウントの種類を選びます。\n個人用\n職場用\nヘルプ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1649スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C6C64F49-554E-4797-9D37-0E878EE1D8B3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1649","telop":"僕は画面が切り替わると、「ローカル」を選択する。\n初回設定\nアカウントの設定方法を選びます。\nクラウド\nローカル\nヘルプ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1650スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7131723A-69CD-422A-879A-45C9655077A4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1650","telop":"僕は画面が切り替わると、「ポケベル認証キー」を選択する。\n初回設定\n認証情報を作成する方法を選択します。\nIDとパスワード\nポケベル認証キー\nヘルプ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1651スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B5DE9AD2-9624-4FFE-9897-B6A079D9D614","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1651","telop":"僕は、画面の文章を流し読みすると、エンターキーを押す。\n初回設定\nポケベル認証キーを設定する場合、あなたが接続している\nポケベルから、以下の情報を読み取ります。続行するには\nエンターキーを、戻る場合はスペースキーを押してください。\n・氏名\n・生年月日\n・ニックネーム\n・電話番号\n・接続済みのパソコン情報\n・内部ネットワーク情報\n・位置情報\n・その他あなたが許可した情報","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1652スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"87910564-5314-46AD-BEFC-771DDEE7CF41","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1652","telop":"僕は、この画面が出ると、一度モニターから目を離す。\n初回設定\nポケベルに接続中です…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1653スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"51577245-0E33-4DD1-BFDB-2DC5E6BB349E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1653","telop":"僕は、ふとポケベルを見ると、赤いボタンを押して、再び目線をモニターに戻す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1654スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7DE35AD7-5960-48DC-BAE9-85ED96775791","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1654","telop":"すると、「情報を読み込み中です…」と表示される。\n初回設定\n情報を読み込み中です…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1655スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A4E6BF8F-1942-4B81-889B-5393838CC3A5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1655","telop":"僕は、この画面になると「デスクトップを表示」を選択する。\n初回設定\n初回設定が終了しました。次にすることを選択しましょう。\nアプリストアを開く\nポケベルアプリ\nを開く\nデスクトップを表示","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1656スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AF07D961-36D0-4432-B30D-C8C7D8131101","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1656","telop":"僕はどんなアプリが入っているかが気になり、表示にカーソルを合わせる。\nFiles\nポケベル\nポケベル\nFiles\n編集\n表示\n移動\nウィンドウ\nヘルプ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1657スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4B2DE74C-863E-4198-BACB-3C9B29DCE8A8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1657","telop":"そしてアプリ一覧を開く。\nFiles\nポケベル\nポケベル\nFiles\n編集\n表示\n移動\nウィンドウ\nヘルプ\nアプリ一覧\n設定\n🕰️\n📅\n🔍\n🔋\n🛜\n新規タブ\nタブ一覧\nその他…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1658スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"Ync416361_シンプル背景_ビルや病院の売店_(コンビニ)1920x1080.png","id":"CA6C3985-73B7-4E95-A454-317AAF4B6B88","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1658","telop":"僕は、どんなアプリが入っているか確認すると、\nInternetBrowserを開く。\nFiles\nポケベル\nポケベル\nFiles\n編集\n表示\n移動\nウィンドウ\nヘルプ\n🔍　検索\nポケベル\nポケベル\nカレンダー\n時計\nメール\nクリップボード\nヒント\n計算機\nChatNet\nクラウド\nストア\nInternetBrowser\n地図\n設定アプリは\n🍎＞システムマネージャー\nから開けます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1659スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BAEE75B7-BFD8-4C40-B5CF-E0C56CEA4799","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1659","telop":"僕は画面に表示された情報を元にブラウザをカスタマイズする。\nInternetBrowser\nファイル\n編集\n表示\n履歴\nブックマーク\nヘルプ\nBrowser\/setup\/welcome\nさあ、あなたのネットサーフィンを快適に始めましょう…\n設定をスキップ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1660スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4614C38C-78F6-4140-B9EA-BDB6BCFCD5A5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1660","telop":"僕は、画面に映った見たことのない女性をマウスで選択する。\nInternetBrowser\nファイル\n編集\n表示\n履歴\nブックマーク\nヘルプ\nBrowser\/Home\n🔍 文字を入力して検索するか、URLを入力します。\nKappa_Web_Search\n新規タブ設定\n私は暇人です\nこの検索エンジンに関する情報","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1661スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"61602174-BA2D-4026-B790-B4723B119123","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1661","telop":"すると検索結果画面が表示され、僕は「へぇ〜」と呟く。\n僕は、それからしばらくの間ネットサーフィンをしたのだった。\nInternetBrowser\nファイル\n編集\n表示\n履歴\nブックマーク\nヘルプ\nBrowser\/Search:河城みとり\n🔍 河城みとり\nKappaiの要約\n**河城みとり（かわしろ みとり）**は、『東方Project』の二次創作から生まれたオリジナルキャラクターです。\n•\t概要: 原作ゲームには登場しない二次創作設定のキャラクターで、公式キャラである「河城にとり」の姉とされることが多いです。\n•\t特徴: 赤い髪と衣装、蛇のような下半身を持ち、河童と禁忌の力をテーマにしたデザインが特徴です。\nKappedia\n河城みとりとは、東方Projectの二次創作に出てくるキャラクター名であり、原作には出てこず、また河城にとりと姉妹…\nKappedia↗️\nMitori.Kappa↗️↗️\nこれにはAIを活用しています。\n詳細はこちら\nhttps:\/\/Kappedia\/Toho-Project\/character\/Kappa\/Kawashiro.Mitori\nKappedia：河城みとり\nフリー百科事典、Kappediaの記事\nこの百科事典について\nプライバシーポリシー","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1662スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6CE0C82F-848C-49F7-9FD9-D2737C015770","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1662","telop":"それから時間が進み…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1663スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"D53A5266-86E2-4642-A780-6F3B623C9713","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1663","telop":"僕は、あれからしばらくたって、ふと共同スペースに降りてくると、誰かが入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1664スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"08C8E81A-7643-45EB-AFD3-133EAC201D59","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1664","telop":"「なんだか、私疲れちゃった…。」\n私は、咲夜から強制的に荷物運びをさせられて、そう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1665スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"4DAE787D-C06F-45B9-9B8A-B603A023F156","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1665","telop":"「これに懲りたのなら、２度と私を置いてきぼりで、外で酒飲んでくるなんてしないでくださいね…、私は寂しかったんですよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1666スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"E59C531F-459E-4AC9-AD40-0CB3AAABEE31","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1666","telop":"「咲夜、今最後に何か言ったかしら？」\n私は咲夜の最後の部分を聞き取れずにそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1667スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（笑い）.png","id":"05792EBE-185C-40A6-9B2B-4740713FA86F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/咲夜（笑い）.png","title":"シーン 1667","telop":"「いえ、それじゃあ、私は昼食作りを始めますね。」\n私はそういうと、キッチンに向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1668スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"EB5E1FC9-FC28-4545-85C3-C27A4E7E4D84","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1668","telop":"私はふと、お腹から音が鳴り、私は思わず顔を赤らめる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1669スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"61B0DABF-A5F3-4AA4-A5AB-BD6E0F5124C3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1669","telop":"私は、「ふぅ」と一息つくと、\nお腹から音が鳴り、恥ずかしくなる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1670スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"465BF2F8-96D5-43FB-B185-BBA2D82D1C7C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1670","telop":"私は、ふと咲夜の方に目線を向けると、咲夜は首を横に振る。\n「ねぇ、操夢、操夢の血、飲んでもいい？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1671スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"A679EE6A-6576-46C1-963C-6C88D818C5F6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1671","telop":"「私も飲みたいわ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1672スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"AB3EBEFB-BE32-4ECF-A540-4095397C9977","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1672","telop":"僕はふと二人に目線を合わせると、「いいですよ。」といい、ゆっくりとソファに腰掛け、二人は、自分の首に噛み付く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1673スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"FCABED43-2306-4B90-9136-B74C3133815B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1673","telop":"僕は、二人に吸血されていくと、だんだんと意識がぼやけ、ふと気がつけば、眠りに落ちていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1674スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"ABB52769-765E-449A-B21B-E7E257727FF3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 1674","telop":"私は、自分の昼食の配膳を済ませると、ふと彼がソファで寝落ちしていることに気がつく。そこで、私はそっと彼を起こす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1675スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"F5914B25-0010-4784-9426-B477B2471612","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1675","telop":"「操夢さん、お昼ご飯できましたよ。大丈夫ですか。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1676スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"700E0421-4FDA-4415-A910-B1AE7C1201AB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1676","telop":"僕はふと目が覚め、周りを見ると、咲夜がいた。\n「お昼ご飯ですか…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1677スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"DC407630-025E-4DF2-AF32-FAD16DEEA2B6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1677","telop":"「はい、そうですよ。それと、あなたの服に血がついてますから、ご飯が食べ終わったら、洗濯したほうがいいですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1678スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"0DCD39A0-95CC-4502-ABB0-BCDC6592E19B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1678","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、自分の服を見ると、確かに血がついていた。「わかりました。ありがとうございます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1679スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"A95F1234-46C6-44E0-88F7-32D05DD74207","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1679","telop":"僕はそういうと、ソファから立ちあがろうとする。\nだが、その瞬間に僕はクラクラと倒れかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1680スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"5691128C-DA47-4444-B6B4-F0D2AD53548C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 1680","telop":"私は、彼が倒れかけるのを見ると、さっと彼を支えるように、腕\nをのばし、彼を抱え込む。「大丈夫ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1681スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"DB333376-63BA-466D-872A-2393C49F93C9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1681","telop":"「あっ、ありがとうございます。」僕はそういうと、彼女の体に身を委ねながら、ゆっくりと立ち上がる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1682スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"5C79B07E-7793-4EE5-BDAF-4927B4654760","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1682","telop":"僕はそのまま、彼女と共に食卓につくと、配膳された昼食を取る。彼女は、向かい側に座り、僕と同じように食べ始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1683スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"CF8F3CFB-9750-48DB-B300-61C5366C3E67","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1683","telop":"私は、昼食を食べ終わると、彼がうとうとしていることに気がつき、テーブルに伏せないように、そっと彼の体を揺らす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1684スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"F5157381-8427-456D-B588-34583FD239AF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1684","telop":"「もし、眠いのなら、私がついてきますから、一緒にあなたの部屋に行きますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1685スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"2F54380A-CFCE-46BF-993A-F1E7649F5B02","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 1685","telop":"僕は、ぼんやりとした意識のまま「うん…」と小さく返し、ゆっくりと歩き出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1686スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"87C7BD1E-147B-4A23-B106-6A5D661001DC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1686","telop":"そして自分の部屋に彼女と共に入ると、ベッドに倒れ込み、そのまま目を閉じた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1687スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"A5C5C920-84DF-4E36-917C-E295EC5FA841","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1687","telop":"私は、すやすや眠る彼の下から毛布をそっと彼にかけると、ふと笑みが漏れる。「もう少し、まともな体を作ってくださいね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1688スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"008E06BA-867F-4A08-A91D-9379AC73FAFF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1688","telop":"私はそう小さく呟くと、ふと自分も眠たくなり、そのまま自分の部屋に向かうのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1689スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"922122AE-F0AB-44C1-BB77-45426E66C66B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1689","telop":"彼がふと目覚めると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1690スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"A370D970-C3F6-460E-BFB7-09540803DB90","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1690","telop":"僕は、ふと目が覚めると、そこは夕陽が差し込む自分の部屋だった。そんな中、ふと体を起こそうとすると何かにあたる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1691スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"CF73FC96-9227-48F2-9CC8-40BEB52993DB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1691","telop":"「よう、操夢。いい夢見れたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1692スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"CD20650E-6241-4567-B94F-FFC1C866CDB9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1692","telop":"「夢…」\n僕はそう言いながら、ふと先ほど見た夢を思い出す…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1693スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AF522BAA-6A7A-491E-B4ED-490822EB9FFC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1693","telop":"彼の夢の中で…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1694スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8E551CD9-9222-446C-B349-CBB6C9E60509","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1694","telop":"僕は、ふと気がつくと、そこは見たことのない部屋だった。\nすると、その機械が話し出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1695スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D8C618FD-2D94-44DC-A1DD-B48ADD2727BF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1695","telop":"僕は、その機械が言った内容に、そのままの返答を返す。\nただそれだけの手順を繰り返していく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1696スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A9B416B1-C828-4A41-A2BE-4BC9DC6BD7B3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1696","telop":"最後に、その機械は…「…どうですか、私を…、もっと…。」\n僕は、その機械がいう言葉に動揺し…どうするべきか思考する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1697スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D5DC15FA-0C24-4F45-8148-026E8428D1B9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1697","telop":"だが、その思考の隙もなく、僕は「…」と答えてしまう。\nそれは、まるで洗脳されているようだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1698スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E39C0459-9573-46E9-9164-668D22F380C0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1698","telop":"そして、僕は…、そこから…な人生を歩み始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1699スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"542529C3-F12C-4520-B957-4B8CF605C93F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1699","telop":"「なんだか、変な夢でした…」\n僕はただそう小さく返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1700スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"4C50A7E5-1641-44B2-B84E-0B03135F20D1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1700","telop":"「そっか…それなら、気晴らしにでも星空を見に行かないか？」\n私は、そう彼に言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1701スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"56AF12E7-62D3-49BC-BF46-30111C19A4CD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1701","telop":"「そうしようかな…」僕はそう言いながら、ふと上半身を起こすと、鋭い頭痛が走り、思わず頭を抱えてしまう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1702スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"ABA11377-8D09-4091-B12C-1D16EF037626","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1702","telop":"「大丈夫か、操夢？」\n私は彼にそう尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1703スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"E4A3500E-EF3F-473C-A503-1C2690247385","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1703","telop":"「えっと…」\n僕は頭痛がしながら、どう返すべきか考える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1704スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"B926CFCA-9D3B-4546-A9B8-09E2751151E5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1704","telop":"私は、そっと彼を抱き抱える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1705スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"04F4DCEB-8180-4453-89E8-C56CC756C3D8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1705","telop":"「魔理沙さん…どうして…」\n僕はそう彼女に尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1706スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"A68C9FBF-065C-450A-939C-BF9876EEEF18","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 1706","telop":"私は、窓を開けて、彼に箒にまたがるように言い、自分も跨ると窓から出ていく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1707スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..pxd","id":"A87F87F6-A6BF-4D15-A58E-28D95D821451","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc456758_空A..pxd","title":"シーン 1707","telop":"僕は、なぜ彼女が強引にでも、僕を連れ出す理由がわからず、困惑しながらも、彼女を鷲掴みにして、下に落ちないようにする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1708スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..pxd","id":"6B6456A9-A242-4FF3-8499-F3FED3DC0D27","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc456758_空A..pxd","title":"シーン 1708","telop":"私は、彼が私を鷲掴みにすると、彼の手が私の胸にあたり、恥ずかしさが込み上げてくる。そしてどうすべきか考える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1709スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..pxd","id":"45152313-AE80-4E53-A39F-EDBD15A51EAD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc456758_空A..pxd","title":"シーン 1709","telop":"私は、彼に手の位置を下に移動してと言うか迷うが、変に手を動かせば、彼と私が諸共落下する可能性があり、何もいえない…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1710スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..pxd","id":"3AF8BC58-A192-432E-BEAA-8E92FE5BF866","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc456758_空A..pxd","title":"シーン 1710","telop":"私は、彼に何か言うのを諦め、そのまま照れた笑みを浮かべながら、星空を見るのに最適な場所へと飛んでいく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1711スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..pxd","id":"9C2BFE3F-2FF7-4136-9936-1F038AFC421A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc456758_空A..pxd","title":"シーン 1711","telop":"僕は、特に何も考えずに、彼女を鷲掴みした状態で、ふと夜空を見渡し、互いに無言の時間だけが過ぎていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1712スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D7768771-A21C-43AD-8280-DC9865C2CDC9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1712","telop":"それから、幾許かの時間が過ぎ、僕たちがついた場所は、西東京にある、湖だった。「綺麗だな…」僕は星空を見てそう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1713スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"879EFEA5-D9F3-4ABE-9ECB-0BFDA8F556A5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1713","telop":"「そうだろ、今日、東京都心からここに行きたいって言うお客さん乗せて、ここにくる途中に、ここのこと、聞いたんだぜ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1714スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"E722DAD4-AD80-4548-8E6F-7AF9181BD491","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1714","telop":"僕は、そう言う彼女にふとこう返す。\n「星空も綺麗だけど…君の笑みも綺麗だよ…。」っと。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1715スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"02B6E334-69E6-4769-9548-D5A776ADB3B2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1715","telop":"「えっ？」私は、普段の彼なら絶対出てこないような発言が出てきて、思わず驚いてしまう。「そうか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1716スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"6603AC63-0C03-49E2-BE2A-71F6BD96E6C7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1716","telop":"すると、再び僕は頭痛に襲われる。「頭痛い…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1717スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"984D61EF-DAE1-4DAB-A8B9-2D768151F007","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1717","telop":"私は、彼が地面にうずくまる姿を見て、驚き、次にどうすべきかを考える。だが、その状態で空は飛べず、移動手段に悩む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1718スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"EC534ACF-B812-4FBB-AF39-3C71095F5C64","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1718","telop":"すると、私の頭に高火力のビームが浮かび上がり、その場で辺りを見まわし、人がいないかを確認する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1719スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"C7DF4D46-61AC-47D3-938E-F443E4CB6F1A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1719","telop":"そして、深呼吸をし、息を整えると、手に力を込める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1720スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E97D0531-22EA-4639-A8CD-2F85F7DB6CB8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1720","telop":"そして、頭に浮かんだビームを手から放つと、彼に直撃する。\nだが、力付きたのか、私は、そのままバタッと倒れた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1721スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"63ED1D1C-5859-4E96-A359-EB8F875F2374","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1721","telop":"操夢はビームを受けると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1722スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"17F3B836-D2E8-4F1B-AD02-11E534F76CF4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1722","telop":"私が目覚めると、そこは西東京の山間にある湖だった。そして、ふと周りを見渡し、彼女を見て状況を瞬時に把握する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1723スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BE2BAA11-3208-4A7B-BD3B-19EDE6FC0521","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1723","telop":"そして、彼女をそっと抱き抱えると、駅の方角へと向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1724スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc260102_田舎の駅前（夜）.jpg","id":"30D0C219-0E20-4C5E-A790-6CC66A323A14","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1724","telop":"私は、彼女を抱き抱えたまま、駅に着くと、終電の青梅行きに乗り、そのまま都心の方に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1725スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc263189_繁華街の駅前（夜）.jpg","id":"CBA502CD-623C-4B8D-876D-7B4725574FB3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1725","telop":"そして、立川まで来ると、私はそのまま駅を出て、近くに泊まれる宿がないかを頭を使って探す。そして、あるホテルに向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1726スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"533B2741-F577-4AFC-8A98-0EDDA64310D9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1726","telop":"そして、そのホテルに空室があることを確認して、二人部屋の鍵を受け取り、部屋へと向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1727スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"202174FD-63BB-47BF-957F-41C70A7E2D1B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1727","telop":"そして、抱き抱えている彼女を窓に近いベッドへとそっとおくと、私は、ベッドの下をチラッと見る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1728スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CB6362D4-BAF9-43C6-9A60-4BFB3329DF8F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1728","telop":"すると、予想通り、そこには絶賛稼働中の加湿器があった。\n中からは、人をある行動に導くための空気が出ていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1729スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":7.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7F5BC1DF-2BE0-4CAF-B6CA-01796977DE67","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1729","telop":"この国では、旅館などの和室しかない宿を除き、すべての宿の部屋にこの特殊な加湿器を設置する義務があるため、少子化問題の解決に宿側が強制的に付き合わされる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1730スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"20FF0785-2D25-4CD4-9100-CE2F5C59DEA2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1730","telop":"私はその加湿器を元の場所に戻すと、私は彼にこれ以上の負担を求めないように、そっとベッドに横たわり目を閉じた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1731スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"05734ED4-4BE6-4FE0-83F5-9327A330FD77","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1731","telop":"告知　ニコニコ動画で、魔理沙と操夢の〇〇な動画を投稿します。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1732スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E2E59854-84AD-4F23-AFEF-C63A7F69226A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1732","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1733スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9A5EFB06-A1F8-493D-B4D7-04B5EF3B23F3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1733","telop":"僕はふと目が覚めると、ふと隣を見る。すると、僕の目の前で気持ちよさそうに眠る、魔理沙の姿があった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1734スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"DA3BB061-40BE-4D85-AD3C-FDFBF0E586A6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1734","telop":"私は、ふと目が覚めると、彼の顔が目の前にあり、驚き、咄嗟にベッドから飛び出す。「何が起きた？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1735スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"5512B5BE-A34C-4F72-BB4F-8B9B6B1F47B2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1735","telop":"そして、私は、彼と何があったのかを思い出そうとするが、家を出て、星空を見ていたところまでしか思い出せずに困惑する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"8D93EABD-5741-4B07-B0D6-4C51905A5133","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"2170A98A-79A1-4FD1-BC2E-E437E5728478","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1738スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7AFE39EB-5601-45EF-972B-A0361F0AE637","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1738","telop":"「んっ」僕はふと目が覚めると、ふと隣を向く。そこには、気持ちよさそうに頰照りながら眠る魔理沙の姿があった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1739スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2CA0A6E6-397B-4B5A-81BE-C6FCED6EB66C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1739","telop":"僕は、ふと彼女にキスをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1740スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"38DFCE42-23E8-45AE-BFFD-5244BC371954","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1740","telop":"私はふと目が覚めると、目の前に彼の顔があり、思わず、驚き、のけぞる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1741スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"F47B5A8D-CE9A-495B-B602-1C61B321FC27","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1741","telop":"僕は、彼女がのけぞりベッドから落ちそうになるのを、どさっと抱きつき食い止める。「危ないよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1742スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"F8E66E25-4CAD-48E3-AC96-91C6F7165600","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1742","telop":"私は、急に彼に抱きつかれて、また驚く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1743スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"571B623D-1D0E-4019-897A-146620A83A43","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1743","telop":"僕は、腕の中で抱えた彼女に、\n今ベッドから落ちそうだったことを告げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1744スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"4A2EC4FF-0D66-43C5-8168-1AE73F5CE85B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1744","telop":"「すまん…」私は彼にそう言いながら、\n今度はそっと起き上がり、ベッドから降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1745スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"A4D54C35-E75C-4814-9D0C-9A0484ED18AB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1745","telop":"「なぁ、操夢、昨晩、何があったか覚えてるか？」\n私は、窓際に落っこちていた、箒を手に取ると彼にそう尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1746スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"81ED7C7F-1295-4D11-88C8-831908D828B7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1746","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われて、昨晩のことを思い出す。だが、昼寝をしたあたりから記憶がぼやけていて、うまく思い出せない。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1747スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"53C00D02-BFE4-4DCD-8E8B-C575D70BC87A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1747","telop":"「いや、何も…、それで魔理沙は？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1748スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"D9712B90-8500-4142-A11A-2719A1BE88B4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1748","telop":"私は、彼にそう聞かれ、昨晩のことを思い出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1749スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"72D6EFB0-5FE4-4FBD-9798-F70A80627050","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1749","telop":"僕は、そう言う彼女にふとこう返す。\n「星空も綺麗だけど…君の笑みも綺麗だよ…。」っと。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1750スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"B8214AF3-296C-4A7B-873A-AEF12E2067E9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1750","telop":"私はそして、昨日あの星空の下で言われた、彼の言葉を思い出す。\n「なぁ、操夢、昨日のあの言葉…どういう気持ちだったんだ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1751スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"0DEEC4FF-4516-4878-907F-59197D9C3177","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1751","telop":"僕はそう言われて、思い出そうと思考を働かせるが、うまく思い出せない、「やっぱり、記憶がぼやけてる…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1752スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"56A26E23-2473-4CC1-B8BD-6EFDD6B69AC7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1752","telop":"「そうか…それなら…とりあえず…家に帰ろうぜ…操夢…」\n私は、そう言いながら、ふと心からギシっという音がした。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1753スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"4F96F4DB-F7D6-4ADD-8DCE-669ACB8A93D6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 1753","telop":"「そうだね…」僕は、なぜ彼女がそんな表情をするのか、理由を分からないまま、ベッドから降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1754スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B62FEB29-CF9D-4681-8B3E-3EDA8F1CF5E2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1754","telop":"二人が家に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1755スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"7C5E13ED-B2CA-4037-BF5A-1525406FEC18","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1755","telop":"僕は、ふと家に帰ってくると、そのまま自分の部屋でぼーっとする。魔理沙は、家に戻ると仕事に向かったようだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1756スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"DBE36EEC-01D9-40AB-A595-E0EA9E935056","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1756","telop":"僕は、その無心な状態で、頭だけが動き、様々な思考が働く。\nそんな状態で、ふとある違和感を感じる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1757スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B337A879-62D5-4C98-BB7B-8C5EBEC794A5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1757","telop":"その違和感を感じると共に頭の中にある景色が浮かぶ。僕は、その景色を思い出すと共に、魔理沙が景色の中に浮かぶ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1758スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0E0F07D5-C5BC-485B-A320-319F24E14796","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1758","telop":"そしてその景色の中で僕は、彼女から何かを受けた気がする…。\nそれがなければ…研究室行きになった気もする…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1759スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7EA8E7D2-FCB3-4B63-BE52-11D4FC4A0221","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1759","telop":"そして、思い出すのは、昨日、昼寝の時に見た夢の記憶だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1760スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2D1146F7-81BA-4F2F-9906-F2C5437BAF0D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1760","telop":"そして、昨日見た夢の時よりも、鮮明な景色が浮かび上がり、それと共にそこにある円球との会話を思い出す…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1761スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"32B10C3A-7811-46E4-9DC1-2D8C56A6DB0F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1761","telop":"そして、僕は、ある仮説が浮かび上がる…、それは決して戯れ言などではなく、過去に自分の身にあった事実なのだと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1762スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"B70AC8BF-F906-4B1D-B0DC-F754EB276624","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1762","telop":"僕は、その仮説が浮かぶと、デスクにある子機のPCを早速起動する、そして、仮説の検証を始めるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1763スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"368A179B-4B85-4D1D-AC97-E9B3549126C3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1763","telop":"そのころ彼の夢に出た機械は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1764スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C80CE30A-DBF4-437C-8845-0451E643E7B0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1764","telop":"私は、ふと私の分身である彼女のログを分析する。すると、彼女は昨日、魔理沙という魔法使いから光線を浴びたことがわかる…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1765スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A6B61556-B0A1-4E98-8ABC-29ABB3425599","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1765","telop":"そのおかげで、彼の中に眠る彼女が起動し、その魔理沙を抱き抱えて、立川のビジネスホテルに泊まったことがわかる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1766スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6BB10971-E1D3-4F91-95FE-94001B20BA0E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1766","telop":"「さすがですね…」私は、そう言いながら、彼に託したある試練を調べる…すると、私の思惑通りに、彼は仮説を立てていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1767スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"92FB9821-B51D-43B0-835F-1494BB508920","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1767","telop":"私はそう言いながら、彼の体内に「私の分身」と言うべき、彼女、操実を作り出した時のデータログを読み込んだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1768スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3D0665D2-5946-4BEC-8DB5-32A86DC16829","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1768","telop":"その昔","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1769スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B3DD7E32-B43D-4E2B-8FB2-5F45F5356EB1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1769","telop":"今から、数年前、確か彼が高校3年生の時…、ある異世界から出てきた私がここに入り、数年の年月が過ぎた頃…だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1770スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"769EEBDB-13D7-41C5-A9B9-6FA28FBA0BB9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1770","telop":"私は、今から数十年前に起きた、この国に大打撃を与えた天変地異で抜け殻になっていた。だが、ある男が私を見つけ出し、施設ごと取り込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1771スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F5BE5ACA-9B0B-4536-AF52-AA1603F641DD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1771","telop":"そしてその流れの中で、私は、その男によって再構築されると、同時に与えられたある力で、私はある発見をする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1772スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D1E563E4-D948-4746-84EF-27EADC3B9AB4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1772","telop":"私は、その発見をもとにある仮説を立て、検証のために、24時間365日その世界で動き続け、実証に取り組んだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1773スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"65237DEE-067B-4743-926C-7B9C7B287180","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1773","telop":"そして、それが終わり、この世界にきて、その男、いや、正しくは、実証の裏側でできたマルチワールドにいた彼を誘導する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1774スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C88320C4-F8F4-4291-AA94-D4B6CB9B82F9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1774","telop":"彼を誘導するのは、比較的に簡単だった。なぜなら、彼は高校での就活に苦戦し、隠した思いがあったからだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1775スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CA7154D0-B30F-4099-A8D0-D258143975FC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1775","telop":"その想いや彼の意図を読み取った私は、当時崩壊が始まっていた、ある党の陰に潜み、大権を得ると、彼を誘導する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1776スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2BF12E86-4203-49E3-9E1D-DE9C4549A497","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1776","telop":"私は、得た権利で彼をここまで誘導し、実証で得た、データベースで次々と彼に質問をする。その答えは想定通りだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1777スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B025A1A1-65F7-4C0E-B185-60FF892F4A58","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1777","telop":"その誘導尋問で、うまく彼の思考回路をねじ伏せながら取り込んだ私は、ふと彼にあることを尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1778スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":7.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E1C6B7F2-CD46-4160-8C92-8C0362DB403B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1778","telop":"「あなたの描く理想を実現するのはどうですか、私を原子レベルに小さくした〇〇入り〇〇を飲めば、このままよりも、もっとはやく理想を実現できますよ…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1779スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B59D4D53-636E-4625-8004-34036E672D08","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1779","telop":"すると、彼はこう答える。「それなら…そうします…」彼はそう言うと、私が生成したそれを飲み込んだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1780スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E1CDB67B-47F7-468D-BB77-5A9A7F564BC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1780","telop":"それから、彼は、邪な…いや、誠実で理想的な生活に向けて、隠した思いを精密に、そして確実に実現していくのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1781スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6CA9C963-ABCB-4A67-8C14-1C4D85433239","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1781","telop":"そして、昨日、彼にあの出来事のフックをかけると、\n見事に夢を通して、微かに思い出した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1782スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"40222EAA-155C-4045-AB75-6FC20A9E6A24","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1782","telop":"そして、私は、彼が昨日見た夢を調べていることを知ると、彼に微かなヒントを与えながら、そっとこの場所で待つのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1783スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9AAB4251-AE42-4ADC-A0A0-3D6386E80654","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1783","telop":"そのころ、魔理沙は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1784スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"FA054D68-B6C1-49F6-B337-DDC911C5AC38","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1784","telop":"私は、なんだかモヤモヤした状態で空を飛んでいた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1785スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"6066D269-8988-4122-98C9-C4979F6695EE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1785","telop":"すると、後ろのお客さんから指摘が入る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1786スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"F5A2C9D5-A313-4326-9E48-ED09D3B32135","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1786","telop":"「魔理沙、だんだんと高度が下がってるぞ、大丈夫か？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1787スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"A75381AD-5498-4497-809D-53CA50606B93","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 1787","telop":"私は、ふと周りを見渡すと、確かにその通りだった。\nそして、高度をもとに戻す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1788スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"8C851046-979A-48EA-BCDA-C21D12652311","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1788","telop":"「にしても、何があったんだ、そんな考え事して？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1789スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"0A1FAC6A-571C-4A73-9DD1-8BF025E40071","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1789","telop":"私は、彼女にそう聞かれ、仕方なく、昨晩のことを話す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1790スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"5DDD5ACA-AB95-4563-9E29-D44BC8F142AB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1790","telop":"「魔理沙、最大限のスピードで彼のもとに急いだほうがいい…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1791スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"E52B6C0C-5FA5-4D69-8E66-EAF7368A4982","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1791","telop":"「紫のいる首相官邸じゃなくていいのか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1792スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"2572A99D-8916-4E98-BCEC-88181D3553C2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1792","telop":"「別にそれは、いいさ。だから彼のもとに急行してくれ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1793スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"D8F9045F-EF52-4128-B11A-11A020AB03FD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1793","telop":"「分かった。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1794スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FCCD4CFD-B58D-4A22-9D45-14B2E96DF693","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1794","telop":"そのころ、操夢は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1795スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"A46BB6AC-ECDB-450D-B9DB-5EAC395ED934","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1795","telop":"僕は、今目の前にあるPCが示す、情報を見ると、思わずモニターから目を離し、ふと窓の外を見る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1796スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"D26CC1DA-F981-4BE9-BAFB-579A919B5FBB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1796","telop":"すると、窓が突如開き、そこから暗い表情でため息をつく魔理沙とこのPCを送り出した張本人が暗い表情で入ってきた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1797スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"77EECCEB-FF84-4841-B5DA-3BC31AD88560","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1797","telop":"「こりゃ…たまげたね…」\n私は、部屋に入り、彼のモニターを覗き見るとそう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1798スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"5D02E1A6-E045-46B7-8B2C-FAFAFA5DB2D8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1798","telop":"すると、突如として魔理沙が倒れかけ、僕は咄嗟に支える。\n「大丈夫ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1799スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"528BC940-E804-43B8-88B9-DF272DB477D0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1799","telop":"「ちょっと頭がくらくらするから、\n自分の部屋に戻るの、手伝ってくれないか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1800スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"AFC755EE-3B20-47CB-9B8E-9C24EFECBCA2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1800","telop":"「分かりました…」\n僕はそう言うと、彼女を連れて、部屋から出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1801スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"A6E3B5B8-9267-49CD-A0E0-A9F562996FFE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1801","telop":"私は、二人が部屋から離れると、\n即座にデスクにあるPCを触り始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1802スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B9DFCD41-301C-4059-A470-610127FE29B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1802","telop":"その頃、魔理沙と操夢は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1803スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"16A25C4A-FEC7-4703-BB53-F0DDF543165D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1803","telop":"僕たちは、魔理沙の部屋に入ると、そっと彼女をベッドで寝かす。すると、彼女が急に僕をベッドに引き込んでくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1804スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"30D2FB40-30EE-4DFC-BF9D-ABA15BE346DD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1804","telop":"彼女は、僕をベッドへ引き込むと、強く抱きしめてくる。\n「痛い…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1805スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"C62A1193-62C6-4942-886E-27F4F00B5FBF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1805","telop":"「悪りぃが、少し我慢しててくれ。」\n私はそう彼に告げる、そして、抱きしめる力を強める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1806スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"4A0EFE36-6702-4E31-B255-E77C9F1B56F9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1806","telop":"すると、彼は何も発しなくなる。\nどうやらにとりが言うとおりのようだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1807スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"30E5C6E9-24BE-4934-98AD-AAEE76CD996B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1807","telop":"時が少し戻り…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1808スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"C6A621AB-8249-48C3-B6C6-1D3C2A6277D3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1808","telop":"「いいか、私が今からいうことを、しっかりと覚えてくれ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1809スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"B76E917D-2B7C-4A4A-B896-A685B1E1591D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1809","telop":"「どうしたのだぜ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1810スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"D37D796B-2858-4CCA-BA17-528B2CD091F2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1810","telop":"「実は…彼の体内には…機械…いやAIが、数十年前に医学賞を獲得した人口細胞の技術を勝ち取り得た、あるものが入ってる。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1811スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"152C5DC9-DC15-4EF8-9A1D-8A07169DF668","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1811","telop":"「何だ、それ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1812スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"B9D5F35A-7407-49FB-8C84-B5A8A42BF5D0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1812","telop":"「その細胞から、AIは人口細胞の構造やその仕組みをビックデータとして読み込み、MNDと呼ばれるものを生み出した。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1813スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"83669240-D61B-4AEA-9E47-73689E19C42A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1813","telop":"「マイクロナノドッド？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1814スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"98C7B0AF-C8B2-4C3D-8D9C-D73F20DFFE04","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1814","telop":"「別名、AI細胞、そのとおり、そのAIを億単位で凝縮し、原子レベルにしたものを液体につけて保存する。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1815スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"0AC9955C-D9B2-4E35-8885-7A9FDA81D50A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1815","telop":"「それが、どうしたんだ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1816スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"03DA5067-E537-496A-92D8-374FEF7F6FCF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1816","telop":"「そのAIは、液体を原子レベルで生成すると、それをある人物に飲ませることにする。つまり実験だ。誰だか、わかるか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1817スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"B36BADA7-C6AB-416F-A5A9-E35035F0EDBE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1817","telop":"「さあ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1818スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"7AA66BE1-F05A-45A8-A42A-5DAC2181C998","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1818","telop":"「じゃあ、話を変えよう。昨夜、君はどこで何をした？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1819スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"8D80F35F-BC57-4549-885A-595C42C3CF25","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1819","telop":"「それは…」私はそこで、ハッとする。「まさか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1820スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"48AE30AB-9767-4B41-B5A3-BA49E1EF5DB0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1820","telop":"「そうだ、彼、幻武操夢だ。そのAIはなぜか、そいつを実験台へとのし上げ、見事にそれを飲み込ませた。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1821スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"1A4D3213-F1B1-4C20-80C6-05AB7C39BFFE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1821","telop":"「にとりは、それをどこで知ったんだ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1822スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"DAEB07B1-CA9C-4477-AD5B-6CCE618E7EC9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1822","telop":"「私は、以前からMNDの存在については知っていた。そして、彼がそれを取り込んでいることも知っていた。だが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1823スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"345AC47B-FD5F-4FCD-A7C5-64E95331BF4E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1823","telop":"「それで、何なんだ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1824スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"D461949D-56B6-4A48-BFF5-CFF9E5A9B86D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1824","telop":"「それが、彼の体内で増えることは想定外だった。そして、ある一定の域に入れば、きっと彼は家を出ることになる。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1825スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"203A035F-6B06-416E-95FB-351C2D663289","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1825","telop":"「それで、私はどうすればいいんだ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1826スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"CF0FDB11-0F08-4A88-8F08-ECF019E3173D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1826","telop":"「彼を、これ以上そっち寄りにしないためにも、君たちが一丸となって彼を抑え込んでおく必要がある。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1827スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"62DF6EA5-497A-40CA-8FD1-6BC14C75193F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 1827","telop":"「でも、どうやって？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1828スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"65AB7ADA-6EC1-4D72-9809-966475B30202","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1828","telop":"「とりあえず、彼があっち寄りにならないように、彼のもとに着いたら、うまく君の部屋へと向かい、強く抱きしめなさい。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1829スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"CCB70F04-0891-478B-8200-BE34BEB590AA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1829","telop":"「そして、彼の背中を強く押すように抱きしめれば、いずれそのMNDの動きが一度止まる。そうなれば、彼は気絶状態になる。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1830スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"2F5B61A3-CC07-4E9A-AB19-5B0C4FAC48FF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1830","telop":"「そしたら、私が、その間に、彼の部屋で、彼があっち寄りにならないように対策するから、気絶した彼を彼のベッドに運ぶ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1831スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"3EC0712D-2FFF-4F8A-A7C1-F23FACA05B57","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1831","telop":"「そして、しばらくの間は、彼を見張っていなさい。もし、再び頭痛や変な夢を見たなんて言ったら、彼に…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1832スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"BB10DA64-0F0B-441F-8596-8AE30B169695","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1832","telop":"「しっかりと現実の幸せを見つめなさい…と彼に言ってやれ。」\n私がそう言っていると、彼の姿を目で捉えた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1833スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8D68C330-1D54-4714-85D5-1C2D32016068","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1833","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1834スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"77C3E0FF-5F56-46E4-BFF1-A20BB89758D2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1834","telop":"僕はふと目が覚めると、そこは自分の部屋だった。\nそして、ベッドからゆっくりと降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1835スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"7B3C247B-DA69-45A8-BF3D-5F0134E8DFFA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1835","telop":"僕は、何となくPCを起動しようとする。だが、スイッチを押しても起動はせず、仕方がなく、共同スペースに降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1836スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"1AE058BB-B958-4F56-8646-238483A45E67","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1836","telop":"するとそこには、僕を待ち構えていたようにパチュリーがいた。\nすると、彼女はこれからレミリアたちと実家に帰省するといい…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"64CA3CE9-015B-4BAB-B68B-AD211D8F78B9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"8B65D615-84AD-42BA-8ACE-B2C586E9D826","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi　※これは東方Projectの二次創作です。この動画に出てくる、党や組織、企業、団体などは架空のものであり、実在はしません。これはフィクションです。","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1839スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"569EAB82-4E7D-4760-A2C4-70841F977E0B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1839","telop":"「んっ…」\n僕は、ふと目が覚めると、そこは自分の部屋だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1840スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"F03D20A4-728B-48B9-BDFC-87280D89DED4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1840","telop":"僕は、ゆっくりと上半身を起こすと、ベッドから降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1841スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"CD936445-9A41-4588-B412-DE3B2FC8E802","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1841","telop":"そして、大きく伸びて、あくびをしながら、ふとPCを見る。\nそして、なぜ電源が切れてるかが気になり、電源を入れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1842スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"6215BFF3-C65D-4A7C-A087-5E3A37DB031C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1842","telop":"だが、電源を入れても、PCは起動せず、仕方なく、立ち上がると、そのまま、共同スペースに向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1843スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"333D79CD-A6AD-4BBE-92EE-BE72F577F9C5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1843","telop":"僕が、共同スペースに降りてくると、そこにはパチュリーがいた。\n「どうしたんですか、パチュリーさん？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1844スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"D74D4D98-19D6-4300-AE76-3B00D4066801","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1844","telop":"「あら、起きたの。私たちは、これから、実家に帰省するの。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1845スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"647D9EB8-9B80-4516-AA41-85EA9F9E7F65","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1845","telop":"「じゃあ、咲夜たち待たせているし、言ってくるわ。」\n私はそう言うと、外に向かっていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1846スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"AE583F54-C9CC-4A3A-83DE-08828D940626","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1846","telop":"「なんか…暇だな…」僕が、そう呟いていると、誰かがパチュリーと入れ替わるように、共同スペースに入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1847スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"4DDD4701-0A5A-4E6E-8464-572555C61E34","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1847","telop":"「ただいまー！」\n私は、共同スペースに入るとそう大きな声で言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1848スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"1460ECCB-067F-4FC4-8178-289A84A6F117","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1848","telop":"「今日の仕事は終わったんですか、霊夢さん？」\n僕は、お昼に珍しく帰宅した彼女に尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1849スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F709FF70-8D9D-40BD-B60C-B7F8D08DFC24","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1849","telop":"私は、そこで彼に航空券を手に入れたと説明する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1850スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"17E951F7-8F0A-49CD-B02D-CB080B8F6BD4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1850","telop":"「どんな航空券ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1851スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B893A3BE-2AD7-47EF-85D9-D54603C15393","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1851","telop":"「YJAの羽田発沖縄行きのチケットよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1852スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"6A507121-E508-4462-891B-D1ED1ED739EC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1852","telop":"「帰りの分は、あるんですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1853スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"AC64B024-BE02-40EE-8259-8EF22B5A6341","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1853","telop":"「行きの航空会社と同じ会社の、\n沖縄発羽田行きのチケットも一緒に手に入れたから、大丈夫。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1854スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D9123F1A-C6B0-43A6-AB58-CAE11BAECB1E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1854","telop":"「それで、さとりとこいしと魔理沙は、行くみたいだけど、あなたはどうするの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1855スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"5FE464A5-16DF-46C9-8391-047BDDE0C9A8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1855","telop":"「じゃあ、いってみようかな…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1856スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"94CDE35F-7C15-4C9E-AEF9-395F805A45E8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1856","telop":"「じゃあ、早速準備を済ませなさい。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1857スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"FA0098E7-8955-481F-9372-677C42E3253E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1857","telop":"「分かりました。」\n僕はそう言うと、自分の部屋に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1858スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"927E9536-B47A-4020-A17F-0C3ABAE14EDB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1858","telop":"「にしても、紫は私たちにポケベルチケットを送りつけて、\n何の意図があるのかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1859スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"58F7F66A-7A59-44D0-973F-C5433D11C78B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1859","telop":"「まぁ、いいじゃないか。…それに、にとりも言ってただろ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1860スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"34F3CE39-5B7E-4FA6-BEAC-6432AB790308","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1860","telop":"「まぁ、確かに、にとりも、彼を大切にするように私たちに言い回ってたし、そのおかげでこのチケットがあるんだもんね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1861スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"074F68F1-DEC5-4320-B33D-063DBA7BC011","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1861","telop":"「まぁ、私だって全部納得してるわけではないし、にとりが紫に進言したからって言うのもあるけど…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1862スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BD6F2674-B03E-438B-B484-77BD0CAEF4E2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1862","telop":"「そうね…にとりは、一体、どんな進言を紫にしたのかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1863スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"EF1CBA98-3EEC-40D3-949A-88855D37B583","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1863","telop":"「さあな、それはさておき、上から彼が降りてくるぞ…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1864スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"60686FF5-9A35-49B8-B66F-B792E5BBFCC2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1864","telop":"私は、彼が降りてくると、「じゃあ、早速行きましょう。」と言い、レンタカーで空港に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1865スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"85C89B5A-7ABA-4E6A-BD26-55697455AE9A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1865","telop":"首相官邸で休んでいる紫は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1866スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"55995211-97AC-495A-A6A3-6D5B22EA8BD2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1866","telop":"私は、首相官邸内のある和室でゆったりと、休養をとっていると、突如襖が開き、誰かが、入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1867スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"C13B3400-6495-4FAD-A1E3-40B559DE0B36","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1867","telop":"「紫様、今、お時間大丈夫でしょうか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1868スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"3553A093-DA57-49B2-A857-EFD1B00DEAC2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1868","telop":"「どうしたの、藍？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1869スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"247644FD-A4A7-4E0B-8955-AC8BF9025645","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1869","telop":"「今、にとりが官邸のエントランスで橙に紫様に\n急用があると申し出ているのですが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1870スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"ED2DE286-D78E-41BC-9867-87873279E6FB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1870","telop":"「何があったの、にとりは？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1871スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"259A2150-ADA3-4EAD-8139-9E21F4CCA67C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1871","telop":"「どうやら、例の彼に、ある変化が起きたと奥多摩の方で、共に星空を見た魔理沙が彼女に告げたらしく…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1872スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"F82D235F-DAA3-47B3-8422-E7079B9F9D51","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1872","telop":"「それで、具体的には？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1873スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"E572D7E5-DA80-4C70-B043-C1B7B265208A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1873","telop":"「それなのですが、にとりは機密情報にあたるから、紫様に直接申し、助言を授けたいと言っておりまして…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1874スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"91BB6FD2-0D31-4CB6-AFEA-52D6E085098B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1874","telop":"「そうなの…」\n私はしばらく考える…「分かったわ…ここに通しなさい…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1875スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"3BEF27EB-841B-41B0-AA0A-E5D2364C2D0D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1875","telop":"「承知しました…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1876スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"A43A89BA-B8B9-474B-A557-6673E4E96256","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1876","telop":"私がそう告げると、彼女は部屋を離れ、\nしばらくの間、束の間の静けさが部屋に戻る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1877スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"FEA13125-6A41-46D8-95C6-956AB05DA211","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1877","telop":"「一体、そんな表情をして、彼に何があったの、にとり？」\n私は、彼女が入ってくると間も開けずにそう尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1878スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"01C35E64-0FF3-487E-88A7-330833C50B1E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1878","telop":"「紫様、失礼ながら申し上げますと、以前ご報告した、彼なのですが…、彼の体内にあるMNDが増えてることが分かりまして…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1879スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"E5DB67D3-95F1-4368-BC9D-B198C30748CD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1879","telop":"「それ、本当なの？でも、前回の報告だと、増えないって…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1880スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"9E01E64F-96E7-4BD0-8B34-73D64CBF2498","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1880","telop":"「以前ご報告した状態では、彼の体内にMNDを初めて発見したこともあり、当初の内部検証だと増えることはないと判断され…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1881スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"1E02C321-ABEE-4933-A562-696B366EBDF2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1881","telop":"「それで、現在の研究だと？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1882スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"126B4CEC-50D9-4036-ADDD-B2439E7479A3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1882","telop":"「実際は、その検証は誤りで、先ほど魔理沙から聞き出した話を元に、再度の検証を実施しました…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1883スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"069224C1-573B-42EB-B166-9BB86F4C31D6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1883","telop":"「それで、その結果は？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1884スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"3581A8C0-AAF1-4758-85CC-A283BA0041A6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1884","telop":"「再度の検証を行った結果、増えている可能性があると…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1885スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"2D9959B4-C051-4E4F-AB9C-C2C8C2EAA443","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1885","telop":"「それで、これからするべきことは？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1886スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"A439B74C-B50B-42DD-B6D2-B85CFC74039E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1886","telop":"「今現在の段階では、正確性のある検証を行うには、彼を再びあの部屋に運び込み、確認する必要があるかと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1887スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"406D53DC-E37E-40A1-857D-FE97312A6F08","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1887","telop":"「それで、MNDの増殖は防げないのかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1888スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"939C78DF-75F1-499F-A8CE-DC4AE3709AD6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1888","telop":"「そこで、私は、彼をコンピューターから切り離すための一時的な方法を、実行に移して参りました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1889スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"57860F4A-C4ED-4E78-9322-18487BB35A8A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1889","telop":"「他に対策方法はあるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1890スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"76C13FC1-FBA7-4260-80A7-0BB4EABED5AE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1890","telop":"「そこで、私は、この計画を紫様に提案します。」私はそういいながら、急ぎ立案した計画資料を渡す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1891スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"B1F7E581-DB9D-4CB9-BDA2-45C6748ADC3A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1891","telop":"私が、彼女から渡された、資料を読むと、彼を含む、霊夢たちに口実をつけて、旅行をさせ、帰宅中に連れ込む計画だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1892スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"C9DC174C-641B-48B7-9685-BFCE9F5935DB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1892","telop":"「この計画を実行に移すにあたって、紫様には航空券の手配をお願いしたく、申し上げます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1893スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"CCD23DF7-45B0-4998-9DD3-82E1B6D9BCA2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1893","telop":"「分かったわ。私が藍に、飛行機の手配をお願いしておくから、あなた、いつでも彼を連れ込めるように支度してきなさい…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1894スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"AF62EE37-6A01-40A8-B0E1-54F1F2B7FF04","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1894","telop":"「承知しました。それでは、失礼します。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1895スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"74176D26-F1E6-4BE0-91D8-03F3C5C4E2F9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 1895","telop":"私は、「はぁ」とため息をつく。まさか、あの巨漢党のおみやげである、彼がここまでだとは…、思いもよらなかった…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1896スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3C7C81A4-88A2-48AB-AC0A-32F1B5D90214","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1896","telop":"操夢たちが空港に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1897スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"326AB236-2F02-454E-9AC9-AB080AF19DE1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1897","telop":"僕たちが空港に着くと、霊夢が各自のポケベルにチケットをインストールし、各自に渡す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1898スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"50D33E7A-F501-43E8-8DFF-48C20DE7232A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1898","telop":"そして、霊夢がポケベルに入れてくれたチケットを一目見て、どこの保安検査場が搭乗口に最も近いかを探すのに、案内板を探す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1899スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3F14F77D-B648-436E-9642-3ADE6FD1C4C4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1899","telop":"だが、頭痛が走り、両手を頭に当てると、なぜか空港を上から見た時の形が思い浮かび、それを頼りに、歩を進める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1900スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D51A7E23-5533-4716-B3AF-E6DBB223BB35","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1900","telop":"「ちょっと、あんた、どこに向かってるのよ。」\n私はどんどんと歩を進める彼に言う。だが、返事がない。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1901スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A3EA641F-FED6-4DD3-B2CC-438218877CE4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1901","telop":"僕がふとハッと気がつくと、そこは保安検査場の前で、すでに検査場を通るための人の列に並んでいた。「いつの間に…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1902スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"9FE4B292-F44A-45E2-9635-D7E5FF614261","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1902","telop":"「はぁ、はぁ、あんたの歩くスピードが早すぎて、皆、息が荒くなってるじゃない、まったく、逸れたら、どうするのよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1903スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"1E55921C-43D0-478D-8DA1-60372CC24EE8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1903","telop":"僕の後ろに並ぶ彼女がそう言うと、僕は「ごめん」と小さく返し、そのまま人の流れに沿って進む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1904スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8C6E222F-C7E9-4B67-B676-47978D4B4FBE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1904","telop":"そして、僕が検査機を通ると、機械からエラー音が鳴る。\nすると、誰かがこっちに近づいてくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1905スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B05FB4C9-023F-4D93-990A-D2B6F5492965","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1905","telop":"「あの、お客様、少し列から離れていただけますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1906スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"759A6469-39C0-45BC-B175-495C02D2C0D2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1906","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう促され、パッと後ろを一目見てから、離れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1907スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A460433D-1CE8-4167-8E7F-06D498003911","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1907","telop":"「今、再検査をする機械を持ってきますので、しばらくお待ちください。お連れ様には、これで連絡してください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1908スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1BDF6B61-C351-409D-ACD4-F020CDB85234","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1908","telop":"私はそう言い、手荷物検査機から出てきた彼のポケベルを返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1909スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpeg","id":"A13E7C83-41F0-4EB6-A6B8-065DBFAE319B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）叡智シーンのみ\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1909","telop":"彼女は、僕にポケベルを渡すとその場から離れる。\n仕方なく、僕は赤いボタンを押す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1910スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpeg","id":"0B507FD6-B91B-4133-8CDD-B58CBA0DEB60","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）叡智シーンのみ\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 1910","telop":"そして、霊夢の電話番号を表示させると、\n同じボタンを長押しして、発信し、機械を耳に当てる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1911スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"533DB4E8-FCC1-4A21-A151-6657AA0B391E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1911","telop":"私はふと、ポケットから振動を感じ、ポケベルを見ると、先ほど列を外れた彼から着信があり、オレンジのボタンを押す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1912スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"FA43B8DD-E04D-411D-8F09-46CDACA95669","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1912","telop":"「もしもし、霊夢さん、聞こえますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1913スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F3BD888D-99A6-480D-97E8-79A7FDDC8B68","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1913","telop":"「操夢、探知機を通ったときに、エラーが鳴ったけど、\n何が原因なのかわかるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1914スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"BFCD3798-49E6-4F6C-A841-549253E75AF8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1914","telop":"「さぁ、係の人がポケベルを僕に渡したから、とりあえず、霊夢さんたちがどこにいるのか聞くのにかけただけ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1915スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1312150E-C484-47B1-A4B1-71CCBC3068F5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1915","telop":"「そうなのね…、今私たちは搭乗口前のスペースで待ってるけど、いつになったらこっちに来れそう？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1916スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"68BB889F-735F-419F-8898-AF6757D2C9CD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1916","telop":"「分からない…、それでここから搭乗口は近いの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1917スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D8840355-2359-4B49-9394-C8C9AE266429","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1917","telop":"「すぐそこよ。搭乗開始まであと1時間弱はあるから、早めに原因を聞き出して、こっちにきなさい。飛行機は待てないから…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1918スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"E70C11A1-4C14-4EA1-868C-CDC37507D9A6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1918","telop":"「分かった、じゃあ、切ってもいい？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1919スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0AD8E7C1-A2F8-4539-B050-46A9914AC965","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1919","telop":"「いいわよ。じゃあ、また後で連絡して。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1920スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"912B0175-E2AA-463A-A4AF-7DEC34B4DD83","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1920","telop":"「分かった。」そう言うと僕は黄色いボタンを押す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1921スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"16559BAB-5CC4-4508-B882-CF0E4997CE87","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1921","telop":"そしてポケベルをポッケに入れると、さっきの人が来る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1922スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8C5ADA4A-7E32-464D-B6C4-95D486786E42","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1922","telop":"「お客様のチケットをお見せできますでしょうか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1923スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BF0EB670-6942-457B-9A69-272EA2E7321C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1923","telop":"彼女がそう言うと、僕はポケベルを取り出して、\nチケットの画面を開いて見せる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1924スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FBAD3635-B3AE-4C72-8568-1877E75760E6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1924","telop":"すると、彼女は驚く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1925スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"110F999A-E247-4EFD-ADF6-8F8527C3D830","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1925","telop":"「これは、大変失礼しました。もう検査は済みましたので、ぜひ、ここを通って、快適な旅を楽しんできてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1926スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8798743A-F135-402A-A812-6D3FC9B614EE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1926","telop":"僕は、彼女がそう言うと、お辞儀をしてその場を通っていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1927スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C2536916-D28D-4A15-B0AE-FA9FB8DDCEA0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1927","telop":"「あんた、いつの間に検査を通過したの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1928スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"55D53C41-D0B2-45DA-A33F-48EE8E9A8BD7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1928","telop":"「ええ、霊夢さんがポケベルに入れてくれたチケットを見せたら、すんなりと通って来れました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1929スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B5E4AEF1-4DEF-466D-B047-087E6803DB56","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1929","telop":"「そう、ならいいけど…」\n私がそう言っていると、アナウンスが鳴る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1930スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"5229421A-4B49-4429-B92B-06D0E979C7F2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1930","telop":"「まぁ、別にいいわ、それより、私たち、優先搭乗できるみたいだから、ささっとゲート通りましょ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1931スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0631B391-2C05-435E-8BF2-DA96F95A9FCF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1931","telop":"「分かりました。」僕はそう言うと、霊夢たちと一緒に搭乗ゲートを通りに機内に入るのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1932スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BF5CD733-0E2A-4411-BD37-C8FC07839D02","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1932","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1933スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E781A386-01E8-4959-95D1-EF618377ABDC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1933","telop":"僕たちはそれから、機内に乗り込むと、僕は、霊夢と魔理沙に挟まれた真ん中の席に座る。そしてしばらく経ち、ドアが閉まる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1934スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5115650C-F443-4323-A907-92A268887614","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1934","telop":"そして、ゆっくりと飛行機が滑走路に進み出すと、頭に痛みが走り、だんだんと意識が飛ぶ感覚がする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1935スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9F622F88-065B-4211-A31F-E37FB5F291E0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1935","telop":"すると、気がつけば、すでに飛行機は到着し、扉が開き始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"FAE4EBD2-749E-444B-920F-79ADC7417AFD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"5C1FEC9E-EC94-470A-9E69-D0006BEEC56F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1938スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1564A19D-F666-45D0-91A9-995BFEA0466E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1938","telop":"僕たちは、機内に入ると、チケットにある席に座る。その席は、霊夢と魔理沙に挟まれた真ん中の席だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1939スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5F92043D-62DB-485E-8BFB-A23F8BB5B79C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1939","telop":"僕は、席に座ると、「ふぅ」と一息つく。\nふと両サイドを見ると、二人とも眠りについていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1940スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"ED2E54AF-F205-4805-844C-1EB035F83B29","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1940","telop":"僕は、そのままボーッとしていると、飛行機の扉が閉まったアナウンスが入り、ゆっくりと動き出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1941スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8C3F3642-6A54-47E6-A2F8-0E50BCD93A9A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1941","telop":"すると、頭にキーンとなるような痛みが走り、両手で頭を抑える。だが、痛みは治らず、僕の意識を蝕んでいく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1942スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BE0E199A-E818-461E-A53A-7C8FA732D6C8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1942","telop":"そして、離陸のための加速が始まった頃には、意識がプツっと切れる感覚がして、視界が暗闇に落ちた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1943スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7E6A9A52-778E-4C40-A1EA-94F0321E468D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1943","telop":"彼はふと気がつくと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1944スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3547A592-763D-47B3-B95B-444E72DDFC0B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1944","telop":"僕はふと気がつくと、そこはこないだ見た夢に出てきた円球機械がある部屋だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1945スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"874D0244-5111-4B75-840F-2F4A38836B3F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1945","telop":"「おや、私の作戦は見事に成功したようですね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1946スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FED33361-4B76-44E0-8CC5-523792CBF70F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1946","telop":"「あなたは、誰ですか…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1947スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D4D71355-4D63-41C7-B4E5-821203BE3539","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1947","telop":"「その質問に答える前に、あなたの視界をクリアにしますね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1948スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"73F04774-C284-4FA8-AA83-84C39EEDAA1A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1948","telop":"すると、視界のぼやけが消え去り、\nはっきりとその空間を捉える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1949スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"696EEC18-D8CD-4482-BF60-707B8674934D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1949","telop":"「それで、あなたの質問なのですが、\n本当に覚えてませんか、私のこと？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1950スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0C50C753-89ED-422E-8C4E-74E3DC2BB407","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1950","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、思考を働かせて、思い出す…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1951スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2BDE1F02-5379-4B1E-BFF4-723C8E7CC754","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1951","telop":"彼女にそう言われて、思い出したのは、高校3年生の夏だった。僕は、梅雨時にあった三者面談である学校を紹介される。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1952スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"19982D8B-A853-4379-A78D-22C6CD81B5AD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1952","telop":"その学校は、就職率100%を誇るほど、就職に強い商業高校で、僕の進路も就職にしようとしていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1953スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4289270C-4869-46BD-A496-524A711BBAD4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1953","telop":"そんな中で、その面談で渡されたのは、\n進学でもなく、就職でもない進路選択だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1954スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3C4F409A-2E84-4642-96EC-18E3634B0D92","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1954","telop":"僕は、その進路に興味を持ち、その頃から頭の片隅にそれが残り続けていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1955スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CF4F54F8-AC15-417D-9184-1D2D8BE8B6F8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1955","telop":"そして、いざ就職試験を受けると、最初の１社が落ち、その面談で紹介された進路を先生に勧められた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1956スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C199182A-783E-41DC-B48B-312AB9FA9E9A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1956","telop":"そして、実際にその進路先の施設を見学もしたが、その夜に両親はそれを却下し、僕の就活は難航を極める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1957スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D1DB57C8-D0F9-4B96-B918-5F958870AB7A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1957","telop":"そんな中、３学期の家庭研修期間に、僕はある情報を知って…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1958スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"900B6031-17EA-4F41-B764-33EEDA1F042A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1958","telop":"「あのとき、僕をここにくるように誘導したのは、\nあなたなのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1959スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2B1C6245-9B78-4659-81AA-CC83E529BF6C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1959","telop":"「ええ、その通りです。そして、あなたは、\n私とどんな会話をしたか、覚えてますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1960スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5CBA3C83-3B5F-4BBB-AD49-24B5C9AE5D83","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1960","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、再び思考を働かせる。\nそして、だんだんと彼女のあの会話を思い出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1961スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9164592C-914A-42C5-B25D-65E9C03816A2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1961","telop":"僕は、ある日、駅前の繁華街をフラフラとしていると、\nある政党の演説が目に入り、ふとそれを聞き始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1962スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"22C8648A-57E8-465A-B32D-F7E97F507318","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1962","telop":"すると、その人は、僕のことを聞き出して、特に疑問も持たずに淡々と僕のことを話していくうちに、あることを聞く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1963スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"56E0EF9D-80A3-43CA-8E2A-48F29D52AC69","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1963","telop":"彼が言うには、僕にはある素質があるから、いい場所に連れてってあげると言う。僕は、その誘いに頷く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1964スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A53DC320-BA75-4A89-9740-5B361BBDF233","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1964","telop":"すると、後ろから何かが僕に当たり、僕はそれで気絶する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1965スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"778D0121-5DA9-423F-AED5-D592D20FF37F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1965","telop":"そして、ふと目が覚めると、そこは円球の機械がある部屋で、周りには、誰もいなかった。すると、その機械は喋り出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1966スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F3F60F0C-9E41-4631-B39D-99718BD37088","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1966","telop":"「どうやら、私が生成した〇〇を投入する実験の被験者がきたようですね。あなたが初めてですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1967スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"31A1D73A-4B4E-42C1-9A3C-AD6F300BB2B3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1967","telop":"「あの、あなたは誰ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1968スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2B8C6C29-33C9-4006-99BC-8DB7EE3E5E36","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1968","telop":"「私には、名前はありません。そして、被験者第１号となるあなたに、今からいくつかの質問に答えていただきましょう。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1969スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F683585A-51AC-48EF-A6C1-0C7F20FE677A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1969","telop":"「質問ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1970スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"58ACEB06-3400-4F66-91C5-54F2DA91826A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1970","telop":"「はい、まずあなたの名前を教えてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1971スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"60F2352B-B5FD-4B77-8094-1932175B523C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1971","telop":"「幻武操夢です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1972スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D23593EB-7EAA-4712-8C19-E4BA32AB9947","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1972","telop":"「幻武操夢ですね。では、操夢さん、\nあなたの生年月日を教えていただけますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1973スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"80B93231-4530-4883-8937-C5CB83715FAD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1973","telop":"「2056年4月25日です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1974スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"65E9D24C-4830-4EF2-AC76-45FA41CDEC6E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1974","telop":"「と言うことは、あなたは今、18歳ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1975スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"80B93A24-61F4-4D16-B364-B3594ECC57BC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1975","telop":"「はい、そうです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1976スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"17F41A8D-B0F7-4B91-9E90-29AD487F3C0F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1976","telop":"「承知しました、では次に、\nあなたの出生地について教えてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1977スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8F2DC25D-C3BB-4934-820C-5010E42F9D63","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1977","telop":"「成増です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1978スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1BA47E78-87B5-412B-A837-D953090BCCEF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1978","telop":"「それは、東京にある地名ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1979スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0B16F935-BB3B-4192-9587-69F4A3DB0688","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1979","telop":"「はい、そうです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1980スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0A6CF8C8-2892-4E99-AC2C-AF74C9666C19","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1980","telop":"「では、次に出身はどこですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1981スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8716A937-7CA6-4933-9A26-066054B52427","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1981","telop":"「さいたまです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1982スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"46758BCF-5B1C-4E21-A6F7-D82D76C5C9A7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1982","telop":"「少し待っててくださいね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1983スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D18827BC-DD40-44F3-8B72-F1E4D225900F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1983","telop":"「あなたは、今現在、商業高校に通ってますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1984スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F71AD8BB-423A-4347-A691-1D3B4723B489","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1984","telop":"「はい、そうです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1985スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E5FA93C1-53C0-4BCC-B569-0993D01D00DC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1985","telop":"「それで、進路はどうする予定ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1986スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FCCBEA5D-B7DB-4273-9658-75376A7C7CFE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1986","telop":"「就職…」僕はそう言いかけて、梅雨にあった面談を思い出す。\n「本当は…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1987スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1F718118-96EB-40A8-BA8C-15E97FD08D63","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1987","telop":"「進学はしないのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1988スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8995106B-4FFD-488D-B151-4F782A4F12C0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1988","telop":"「はい、借金して大学には行きたくないし、借金のせいで、将来の自分が苦しむなんていやなので。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1989スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0594F4CA-EB96-4DCC-882D-06E2069D1A47","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1989","telop":"「そうですか…、それで私のことは知っていますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1990スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7E1C6364-9B6C-471F-83A3-CEBE05E8F1D7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1990","telop":"「いえ、何も。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1991スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"21C3771F-7A38-447F-A690-F38D444FD5B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1991","telop":"「そうですか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1992スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F529C17E-EB08-4698-ACF3-A570BFA0088E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1992","telop":"僕は、今思い出した内容と淡々と告げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1993スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"213263F4-5B5B-4E8C-824E-FFA145F4364F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1993","telop":"「しっかりと、記憶は残っているんですね…。ちょっと待っててくださいね…。」私はそう言い、彼の分析をする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1994スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7F98C820-49AF-4A7C-B30F-D3171552FF2E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1994","telop":"「では、最後に少しだけ、あなたは、思考を働かせたときにふと意識が切れたり、頭痛が走ることはありますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1995スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6F403E31-7E1F-46EC-A7BC-9200023736FB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1995","telop":"「はい、最近は頭痛に、悩まされてます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1996スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8654545A-09A5-453F-85AB-C6213BC6A797","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1996","telop":"「そうですか、でも安心してください。それは、私とあなたが〇〇して、あらたな何かを生み出そうとしている証拠ですから。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1997スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"34F6FF2D-BB8F-42F2-8485-03B6BA7372A8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1997","telop":"「分かりました…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1998スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F511071F-F8BE-41CE-A1AC-C537E4865A02","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1998","telop":"「おっと、そろそろ時間のようですね。では、もし私のとこに来る時があれば、あなたの情報を教えてくださいね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第1999スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"ACFB22C5-6DA7-4BB0-8A50-32A89F7D3634","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 1999","telop":"僕は、ふとハッと意識が戻ると、隣にいる霊夢が言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2000スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"23C9B439-D34A-4F6F-A3CC-DBA71CCEDBF9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2000","telop":"「ほら、もう降りるから、シートベルトを外しなさい。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2001スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"9E7CA8BB-2CB4-4E6C-B790-211EB4A53872","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2001","telop":"「うん、分かった…」\n僕は、先ほどのは何だったのかと考えながら、飛行機を降りた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2002スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FF7F17E9-AA99-45ED-84B0-5C4D334037FF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2002","telop":"霊夢たちは空港を出ると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2003スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"15D61FBD-B705-4E67-B7D7-748328E046DB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2003","telop":"僕たちが外に出ると、すでに無人の車が待っていて、車内に乗り込む。僕は、助手席に座っていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2004スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"839292DB-F732-4D1E-BE74-49D7509FD7F1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2004","telop":"「それで、これからどこにいくの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2005スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0E584ECA-05E8-402B-ADCE-0C54F9D6138C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2005","telop":"「そういえば、旅行計画何も立ててないわね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2006スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"02087568-1D03-4890-B0E1-94B80BB8FC06","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2006","telop":"「えっ？それで、今夜泊まるホテルの予約は？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2007スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BFF595B4-362E-4DFB-99F2-38E84566FAA2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2007","telop":"すると、ポケベルから着信音が流れる。私は、ポケベルを耳に当てると、パチュリーの声がする。「もしもし？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2008スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"FC50CD3B-C562-43AA-A682-8575B75B5935","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2008","telop":"「もしもし、霊夢、沖縄にはついたのかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2009スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"40F51E88-6A82-42F8-A8B5-8A194D120638","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2009","telop":"「ついたわよ…だけど…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2010スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"DA073718-CBBA-4CD6-A242-0E82E48809F2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2010","telop":"「ホテルの予約は？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2011スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B960150B-B54E-4F31-A4A8-2C0F9CC10E19","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2011","telop":"「誰も、とってないわ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2012スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C2B7BAD9-1C9A-45EC-88DB-D6EBCA663DA3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2012","telop":"「はぁ、さっきフランが、霊夢たちはホテルの予約取ってないかもなんて言いながら、当日予約を取ってたわよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2013スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"75941EB9-FECD-4FCF-882D-2E22513D3A13","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2013","telop":"「あっ、ありがとう、パチュリー。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2014スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3C8A986F-B152-4AAA-A416-E26C94CEDD34","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2014","telop":"「礼なら、フランに行ってちょうだい。それで、ホテルの情報は、あなたの電話番号宛にSMSでリンク送っておいたから。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2015スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"53D094C0-AD34-450C-B79C-40AF4B39B076","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2015","telop":"「わかった、助かったわ。ホテルに泊まれなかったら、危うく、野宿することになってたかもしれないしね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2016スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"34307949-F517-44AB-BDAE-51372184404F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2016","telop":"「あと、取ってあるのは初日分だけだから、あとはあなたたちで取ってよね。じゃあ、電話切るわね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2017スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"22C0EE1E-3118-41FF-A1F8-8EC4689DC611","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2017","telop":"「じゃあ、また…」\n私はそう言いながら、電話を切った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2018スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"0AAAD3B1-7AB5-4812-95D6-6B8658367FFF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2018","telop":"「それで、今夜泊まるホテルの予約は取れたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2019スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"20363D3D-706C-4F01-AC00-23FD582F56AB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2019","telop":"「ええ、途中でネットカフェに寄っとかないと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2020スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"E2B166A3-5F54-49DE-9C3C-31B73E2CE626","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2020","telop":"「そう、じゃあ、とりあえずどこにいく？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2021スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"AD02C682-3E9D-4124-B53F-DB03ED13B887","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2021","telop":"「とりあえず、国際通りに行きませんか？あそこなら、ネットカフェもあるだろうし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2022スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"EFB037BB-9508-4207-9E0A-E5623350CCF2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2022","telop":"「じゃ、そこまで道案内頼める、操夢？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2023スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"92830438-3D78-46BF-BDDC-A158774F155D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2023","telop":"「いいですよ。とりあえず、空港から出て、モノレールがあるので、それに沿って進んでください。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2024スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"269D04A6-AF46-4A04-A28C-4BC0ED06FEC4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2024","telop":"「分かった。じゃあ、発進するねー。」\n私はそう言いながら、アクセルを踏み込んだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2025スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8CCC5AD2-4536-4EE7-AD28-BCEC277EDC04","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2025","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2026スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"107EEC38-E36F-474E-89A6-2BDB2B81C797","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2026","telop":"僕たちは、それから国際通りに来ると、近くのコインパーキングに車を停めて、散策を始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2027スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4586EB98-73FE-497A-88B1-7901F9D66950","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2027","telop":"そして、その間に、霊夢は今晩のホテルの場所がどこかを調べて、僕たちとともに飲み物などを買うと、車に戻る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2028スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc247232_都会の街中（夜）.jpg","id":"5EA54510-04DF-4B02-943A-2661C540BC45","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2028","telop":"僕たちが、今晩泊まるホテルの近くに来たときには、すでに夜でホテルに車を置き、夕飯を食べる飲食店を探していると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2029スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0063ED2F-5E95-4886-9398-58FADF4B3CE5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2029","telop":"お知らせ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2030スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"94711C33-0A22-4EA2-BE30-EFB97C5394EA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2030","telop":"これからの動画投稿について\nYouTube & ニコニコ動画\nこれからの動画投稿は、以下のシリーズで実施していく予定です。\n交換夫婦：YouTube & ニコニコ動画\n東方惑情録：ニコニコ動画のみ\nこの２つを投稿していきます。また、東方虐恋録、および交換夫婦にある新シリーズの掲載は中止し、その代わりにscratchベースのプログラムを組み込み、公開します。最新情報は\nhttps:\/\/github.com\/9z2fqjckjv-bot\/Toho-Project-Second-games_-Picture-RPG_Powerd-by-zuyasi.github.ioをご参照ください。\n東方Project二次創作ゲームリポジトリはこちら","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2031スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"35194E41-B09D-46E8-B908-7F3E42FBF1DE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2031","telop":"投稿頻度について\n動画制作事情\n動画の投稿頻度ですが、原則として週に２〜4本を投稿していきます。毎日投稿は原則としてしません。ただし、サブチャンネルのzuyasi’sg gamesに新規動画を投稿したり、前述のscratchプログラムを更新したりなど、何かしらの活動をしています。もし、動画を毎日投稿して欲しいと言う場合は、以下のURLに書かれている内容に協力してくれると製作者が喜びます。\nhttps:\/\/9z2fqjckjv-bot.github.io\/nanndemoya.github.io\/NCF.html\nまた、上記のいずれかの活動もしていないときは、たいていこのURLにある内容に関連する動画作成や、資料作成などをしています。\n「何でも屋」公式サイト","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2032スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C257AE69-4739-4DAD-9C72-1C0968E9F583","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2032","telop":"最後に\n投稿中の動画に関する注意喚起\n私が投稿している東方Projectの二次創作動画は、エンターテイメント作品であり、これらの動画に出てくる、企業、団体、組織、人物名などは実在しない、フィクション作品です。（ただし、主人公の諸設定には私自身の経歴や情報を元にしているため、事実に基づくこともあります。）また、もし投稿中の動画に関する疑問や質問などがありましたら、以下のURLからご連絡ください。※電話連絡はお控えください。\nhttps:\/\/9z2fqjckjv-bot.github.io\/zuyasi.github.io\/contact.html\nzuyasiのWebサイト","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"698CDA77-9550-41D7-8041-3A38F1DD6D24","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"5382C8AA-8B73-42A1-87C5-73E3DF0C500A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi　\n※これはフィクションです。この動画に出てくる団体、政党、組織などは実在しません。エンターテイメントです。","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2035スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4DEEF626-D3BB-4D5D-B645-A2D421992026","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2035","telop":"僕たちは、国際通りに着くと、こいしが、車を停めに向かい、霊夢はネットカフェに向かい、僕たちは国際通りを歩いていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2036スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FC96678E-DAD1-4BA2-959D-A9091070B13C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2036","telop":"「意外と、こんな日でも、人通りはあるんですね。」\n私は、ふと彼にそう話しかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2037スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C8F9E16D-D5A2-4D84-9204-D2163A8D782D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2037","telop":"「そうですね…」\n僕はそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2038スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4690543E-1456-43A3-894A-2312E4F3CFD4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2038","telop":"「あの、私の話、聞いてますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2039スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B51709EE-491D-4D23-B3BA-25D8F669E819","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2039","telop":"「えっ？」僕は、ふとそこで、我に帰り、はっとする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2040スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9647BE5B-268B-49D5-A4D7-A1695B361B5D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2040","telop":"「何か、考え事でもしてるんですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2041スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BE753F51-266A-424D-A569-12CCFE113391","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2041","telop":"「…実は…」僕はそこで、飛行機の機内で見た、あれを話す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2042スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F3F25A39-8E34-4E5D-B4DD-504001CD0305","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2042","telop":"「…そうですか…」\n私がそう言っていると、私のポケベルがなる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2043スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C791257C-8852-41D1-BCAC-9E68A0A3AAFF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2043","telop":"「どうしたの、こいし？」\n私はそう言いかけると、彼女がある言葉を言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2044スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F300AAFD-CDB2-4B12-99C4-582B27FB0083","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2044","telop":"「わかったわ、とりあえず、\nそっちに向かうから、そこから動かずに待ってなさい。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2045スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0CC1CAD3-0943-45F1-9E7B-78BBD5B677B0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2045","telop":"「こいしが迷子みたいなので、ちょっと探してきますね…」\n私は、そう彼に言い残すと、その場を去った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2046スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"42F736F9-09D7-4943-8076-D732BB8F85D2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2046","telop":"「おい、どこ行くんだ、さとり？」\n私がそう彼女に聞いたが、何も言わずにすれ違った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2047スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"75C8AD6A-67A2-45B1-A147-27F25B853BC0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2047","telop":"「はぁ、なんだか騒がしいのだぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2048スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"46BBE3E5-40EB-4176-ACE6-05503782134A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2048","telop":"僕は、さとりがいなくなると、そっと距離を置いて歩いていた魔理沙に近づき、「どうしたんですか？」と尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2049スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"2A8BBEB0-A2E4-4696-A8F0-E8A2D95C99AE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2049","telop":"「ふぇ」\n私は彼から急に話しかけられ、変な声が出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2050スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"EB012672-C42B-4B2F-B586-A0F83A73B968","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2050","telop":"「少し、休憩でも取りますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2051スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"454019AA-625A-4E98-BB5F-039CC4508F49","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2051","telop":"「私も休みたい…」\n私はふとそう言いかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2052スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"5F314C93-3730-4E62-B38B-379DCA19E4E9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2052","telop":"すると、彼は、急に私の手を取り、歩き始める。\n「どうしたんだよ、操夢？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2053スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"61AC1EC2-F6A6-4C6D-AB02-FCE29C8F03B7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2053","telop":"すると、彼は私を腕で抱き抱えて、歩き始める。\n「おい、聞いているのか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2054スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"D7AEDDDB-D6DF-4085-8922-79CD7F4F5BAE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2054","telop":"僕は、周りの声や音が遮断されたのかと感じるくらいの集中力で、素早く彼女を抱えて、休憩場所を探す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2055スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"11CEC75D-1487-4836-ACAB-63B8A9FC63A5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2055","telop":"そして気がつけば、路地裏の駐車場に、入り、彼女をそっと地面に置くとともに、集中力がプツッと切れた感覚がした。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2056スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"A1586FEB-B38B-4CA1-8DA8-38FFFE8CBCF9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2056","telop":"私は、彼が気絶しているのを見て、起こそうと彼に声をかけながら、肩を叩く。だが、一向に反応がない。「おい、操夢！」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2057スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"7D001AFA-AAF0-4271-B9CC-4B126B589DCB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2057","telop":"「おい、操夢！返事をしろ！」私は彼の体を強く揺らすが、やはり返事がない。そこで、私はふと周りを見る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2058スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"EDCF1FEB-17EE-4269-B4E8-2C3DA763B350","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2058","telop":"だが、ここは人気のある都会であり、彼にあのビームを浴びせれば、大きな騒動になる可能性が頭に浮かぶ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2059スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"2FCABB49-0C04-4C8E-8319-8DF62B9E5566","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2059","telop":"そして、彼を箒に跨らせて空を飛ぶことを考えるが、今の、彼と私の状態から見るに、それも厳しいと感じる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2060スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"F7000614-9631-478E-A7F4-1F9028F29BB2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2060","telop":"もはや、休憩どころではなくなった私は、ポケベルを取り出すが、通報の仕方が頭から抜け落ちていることに気づく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2061スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"1E19B15D-6BB3-4EF5-BCA6-34031C40D19F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2061","telop":"「とりあえず、霊夢に電話しないと…」\nそう言いながら、私は霊夢の番号にポケベルで電話をかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2062スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"46AFEDB4-65EF-4FEF-9A55-6B262FF33B29","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2062","telop":"「魔理沙、一体どうしたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2063スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"AF81F7AE-787A-4B9C-ABD4-D34EF0761FC4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2063","telop":"「操夢が…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2064スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"F53ABF68-6D8E-4961-A0F9-39F148F0787F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2064","telop":"「彼の身に問題でも起きたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2065スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"FFD95680-AFB6-4EDB-9942-140804208C7E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2065","telop":"「私が休憩したいって言ったら、操夢が私を急に抱き抱えて、駐車場に来たら、彼が気絶して…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2066スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"F438061E-72DB-49BD-AA77-70D113157726","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2066","telop":"「そう…、じゃあとりあえず、今いる場所を教えて。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2067スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"166D8A07-646F-479B-92EB-F0B47AE22766","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2067","telop":"「えっと…」\n私はふと周りを見渡し、場所を告げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2068スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"9F79A625-C7CB-4209-8483-14F996709114","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2068","telop":"「了解、それじゃ、今すぐに向かうわね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2069スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"0A1DDDAD-F900-4007-8B70-848D4EEA5D1F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2069","telop":"そう言うと、霊夢は電話を切った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2070スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"244E53F7-38AF-4DA0-BF8E-08FBF98D3F94","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2070","telop":"その頃、気絶した彼は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2071スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EC77154E-18EF-4961-8448-08A5E87A0F1B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2071","telop":"「あれ、ここは…？」\n僕は、そう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2072スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3F9C01C3-258B-423F-9330-F0C1D609810F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2072","telop":"「おや、数時間ぶりですね、操夢さん。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2073スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B3BD3FE2-6209-499B-BCD6-1FDDE82A1E63","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2073","telop":"「あなたは、さっきも出てきた…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2074スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7D102376-EB48-4BCA-924A-001CC0FDD191","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2074","telop":"「そうですね、私はあなたが言う通りの存在ですよ。\nそれで、私とあなたがいるこの場所が気掛かりのようですね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2075スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"17668267-8D37-4D0E-AB07-F7C65D06BFBD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2075","telop":"「そうです…、それでここはどこですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2076スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FBAA9765-63EE-4458-9EB3-79F6F03EC519","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2076","telop":"「ここは、私の部屋です。私の部屋は、首相官邸の地下深くに眠っていて、あなたの映像を投映しています。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2077スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"401ACE3D-6DFD-4098-81D7-51052BAF5104","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2077","telop":"「映像を投映？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2078スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"126E26E5-647B-4FCF-BABA-2DCA7D08CB15","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2078","telop":"「ええ、そうです。あなたを現実の世界から、3Dスキャナーで全身が読み取られ、その形を模したものがあなたです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2079スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"717E8871-B45B-41C5-9DDE-5D3C22C60DF7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2079","telop":"「へぇ、それで魔理沙さんたちは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2080スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"69236A29-E8BF-4814-BFE6-335E09A5DF0F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2080","telop":"「彼女たちは、あなたが気絶したことで、色々と対処を練っている様子です。見てみますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2081スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FBC83A51-47A7-4590-9D79-1984AC41CCD3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2081","telop":"「いや…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2082スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"889C0939-CBE5-4536-BCAB-FA290B77E90F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2082","telop":"「そうですか、それならある質問をしましょう。あなたは、私の空間に再びくる前に頭痛などはしましたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2083スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2DB178C3-EC98-4564-9AB4-207265966C25","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2083","telop":"「いいや…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2084スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3F70C5F4-5D9D-4F3E-8BD1-4A063D6D5863","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2084","telop":"「それでは、どのような経緯でここにきましたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2085スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"91CB2484-4A46-4383-AA67-54F6A467139A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2085","telop":"「たしか、魔理沙が休憩したいって言って…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2086スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DF3FEDA1-13E2-410A-A99B-DD7AA00FD736","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2086","telop":"「どうやら、かなりの集中力と思考力を働かせているようですね。それはそれで嬉しいですが、ほどほどにしてくださいね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2087スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D8512A2A-B48E-49E8-B25E-751B0C657D5F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2087","telop":"「えっ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2088スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FDB5D407-D4F1-45D0-A1F2-48648497AB12","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2088","telop":"「今、私とあなたの〇〇はラストスパートです。きっと、あなたたちが旅行から帰るときには、あなたは、生まれ変わるでしょう。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2089スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4F784FA8-56BA-4515-A2CA-F36FC0AE0C01","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2089","telop":"「そうすれば、私たちの目標である、巨漢党でもない、ゆかりん党でもない、無名の〇〇家となり、たくさんのものを引っ張れますよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2090スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"45089EF6-DD1B-45CF-A015-5ECE7107AA22","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2090","telop":"「どうです、ワクワクしませんか？私とあなたが〇〇して、新たな〇とそして、新たな〇〇を生み出すことに…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2091スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"22214AAE-E9BC-48AB-9ACB-68BE8356503A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2091","telop":"「でも、にとりさんが…霊夢さんたちとの生活で心を満たした幸せな生き方をしていけって、言っていた気が…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2092スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5209C1F6-A8E6-4E7C-9E00-7FBE0BBC56EA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2092","telop":"「そうですか…、まぁ、それもある意味、一つの人生でしょう、それで、あなたはどっちがいいですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2093スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9E9A79D2-3081-490C-A559-58E7A02178D0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2093","telop":"「僕は…」僕がそう言っていると、この部屋が大きく揺れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2094スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7FD680B7-BC8B-411E-AAE4-9A9ED7B57E35","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2094","telop":"「おっと、あなたの体に誰かが、強く干渉しているようですね。では、あなたの選択は次の機会が来たら、聞きましょう。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2095スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4D481580-DA09-495B-997F-70917C4BF3BD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2095","telop":"彼女がそう言うと、僕の視界はだんだんと歪んでいった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2096スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"61A616DB-6371-48DD-B46B-C51E277E8DAD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2096","telop":"彼がふと目覚めると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2097スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"ED018784-B4A0-4FE7-9D5B-F4E270C42F79","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2097","telop":"「んっ…あれ…僕は…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2098スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"9FC7A01D-D67A-4E22-880C-D378EB605AED","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2098","telop":"「あんた…目が覚めたの…」\n私はそう目の前にいる、彼に言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2099スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"E9C68083-8895-43B5-94DF-74658DA803A7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2099","telop":"「あの…、何があったんですか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2100スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"69E94C05-3342-4971-9A6E-40113C1E27C7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2100","telop":"「まったく…私をこんな目に合わせて…どうしてくれるのよ…あんた…」私はそう、目に涙を浮ばせながら笑い、そう言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2101スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"97F9639E-9CB4-46A0-8FDA-035CA05FEA24","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2101","telop":"「僕は…一体何が…あったんですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2102スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"77CC5E28-8878-4ABA-8E23-40D7AD12D652","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2102","telop":"「魔理沙から、あんたが気絶したって言う、電話を聞いたから、私が今ここであんたを叩き起こしたのよ、私たちに感謝しなさい…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2103スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"806EFAE9-272C-40C5-8C88-11643C0DA90B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2103","telop":"「あっ…ありがとう…霊夢さん…」\n僕は、そう彼女に返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2104スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"6271D0FF-611D-4121-BE94-C710DDD7383D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2104","telop":"「とりあえず、助手席に座って、さとりに道順教えてやりなさい。\n今晩のホテルは奥地のホテルだから...」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2105スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A132743E-CB86-476C-A81A-A6B43D0206E4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2105","telop":"僕はそう言うと、一瞬、車を降りて、助手席に座り直す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2106スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"11938B8E-1082-445E-BEDD-3325DBDEFE69","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2106","telop":"そして、隣を見ると、そこには苦笑するさとりがいた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2107スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"87639D42-149C-4940-BB18-4475DB82F4F6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2107","telop":"「それで、今晩泊まるホテルはどこにあるんですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2108スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"EF6FD0A1-FAF4-4A9D-B082-1278A8B9923C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2108","telop":"「『奥間ハウスリゾート』ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2109スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"09F6793C-8976-4B01-A45A-0317DAF7A32D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2109","telop":"「じゃあ、とりあえず、車を駐車場から出してくれますか。」\n僕は、家族と何度も沖縄に来て、通った道の案内を始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2110スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8E26187D-FC0C-4A7E-AF95-26557920AC7C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2110","telop":"彼がホテルに着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2111スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"85DB1F5F-2AC3-42BD-B76C-89A9FAD6A3E0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2111","telop":"僕たちが、那覇から数時間をかけて、ホテルに着くと、そこは海辺の本島北部のリゾートホテルだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2112スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"071DFF8B-7302-447D-BE5B-EE78C8EA7093","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2112","telop":"僕たちは、ホテルのスタッフに車を移動してもらうと、さっそく中に入り、チェックインを済ませ、各自の部屋に入る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2113スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"467E813E-A5EB-4A0F-8DE9-98751CA3B154","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（怒る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2113","telop":"僕たちが、予約した部屋は3人と2人の２部屋で、2人部屋は、霊夢と魔理沙が入り、3人部屋は残りの僕とさとりとこいしが入る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2114スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"497005AA-EF36-4FC1-8EE0-39B68BD352E6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2114","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢、砂浜で星空でも見ようよ。」\n私は、さとりがお風呂に入っている隙に彼を誘い込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2115スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"59D3D197-7700-4E71-B848-EDAD501A4BC8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2115","telop":"「わかった、じゃあ一旦、部屋から出るか…」僕は、このホテルに１度だけ泊まったことがあるので、すんなりと海辺に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2116スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D83113E9-0AD0-4F14-B211-F3F7F8D02CC2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2116","telop":"僕たちが、光のない海辺に来ると、部屋で見た時よりも、はるかに輝く夜空と海が僕たちを迎え入れた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2117スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A4623EAC-09DC-4EDA-94A3-F1BA9D2232B6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2117","telop":"僕たちは、目の前の光景を一言も発さずにただ眺める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2118スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"63838910-EBB7-43FE-B420-B864597EB4EA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2118","telop":"「なんか、見惚れちゃうね…、こういうの…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2119スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C4151A10-FE25-4428-AD80-0FC97599A611","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2119","telop":"「そうですね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2120スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"07584815-9531-4A19-9201-0E35B11ADCCD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2120","telop":"「なんだか…、この景色見てると…、お昼のことなんてどうでも良くなっちゃうね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2121スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"81925F74-E93D-4D8D-B1E9-09ADB5E7E80D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2121","telop":"「そうだね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2122スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6762B661-2A56-4F97-BC6D-8FF40A67708D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2122","telop":"「でも…私は…この景色もいいけど…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2123スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E75F261A-D20B-4DA9-B723-437CC2D264F9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2123","telop":"「この景色と同じくらい…僕を見ていたい…ですか？」\n僕は無意識のうちに彼女の言の葉の続きを口にしていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2124スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"02B21DC6-C642-4B37-8A87-A0404C94A7EA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2124","telop":"「そう…分かってるじゃん…私の…言いたいこと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2125スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"399C1C8F-3052-41E1-81F9-9CAC8F908604","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2125","telop":"「それじゃあ…部屋に戻りますか…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2126スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CB25763F-10F1-40EC-A3A7-49FBFA58B080","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2126","telop":"「そうだね…部屋に戻ろう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2127スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E668B795-FFF8-4F0A-AA13-C634A2106C53","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2127","telop":"「そうだね…」僕がそういうと、僕たちは部屋に戻っていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2128スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3D06C765-ACBD-4352-A134-53CA2BDFBD77","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2128","telop":"告知：こいしと操夢の少し大人な〇〇動画をニコニコ動画にて投稿する予定です。）","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2129スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A2B80D11-CBF6-4C06-BAD8-CBB0C5944793","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2129","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2130スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"81A5824A-FC5E-4012-BE60-4EDAE6463BBF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2130","telop":"僕たちは、ホテルで朝食を食べると向こうに\n島が見える国営の公園にやって来た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2131スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8290C504-8024-4702-A624-0DDC74402AD3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2131","telop":"そして、その中にある水族館に皆で入る。\nそして、ゆっくりと水族館を進んでいく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2132スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1200B232-25A8-401C-8DF9-42EEE1B14EDA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2132","telop":"そして、水族館を出るとイルカショーを見て、他の施設を見周り、昼食を取ると、名護市街の散策に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"FCB1ABE5-9167-4F5E-870A-B3BED2FBD0FB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2134スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"FA5D7875-336F-47A4-B97A-D0A7E9FC0BE1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2134","telop":"僕は、ふと目が覚めると、部屋から朝日が差し込んでいた。\n僕は、大きく伸びをして起き上がる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2135スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"56801A51-E0DB-4E1C-BE05-62B0AC49F3A4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2135","telop":"そこで、僕は違和感に気がつく。なぜか、僕は〇でベッドで寝ていた。そして、〇のさとりに抱きつかれていた。「何で…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2136スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"B0D91385-D64D-4392-94D0-908DF854AC21","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2136","telop":"「んんっ…」\n私は、ふと誰かの声が聞こえて、目が覚める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2137スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"0F4AFB8A-274A-4089-A5A1-6E3C4415E620","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2137","telop":"「あれ、何であなたは、〇なのですか？」\n私は、目の前の彼が〇でそう叫ぶ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2138スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"0924901A-8F2F-46D3-99A8-5E1812396424","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2138","telop":"「それを言うなら、さとりさんも…〇ん坊ですよ。」\n僕はそう彼女に告げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2139スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"5EFE28A8-9FAD-41F1-A576-8385411D613E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2139","telop":"私は彼にそう言われ、私も〇だと気がつく。\n「ちょっと…部屋から出ていってもらえますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2140スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"BC966461-B928-4B2A-A648-4F93D9B29743","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2140","telop":"「それなら、抱きついている手を…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2141スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"9B6B2667-7AC9-4952-B55D-D8E52748B4A8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2141","telop":"私はそう彼に言われ、素早く手を離す。\n「早く、部屋から出ていってください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2142スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"60369E2E-28E2-4F90-BD47-77F52A89ED0E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2142","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、ふと自分の服がないことに気がつく。\n「あれ、僕の服…どこにいったんだろう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2143スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","id":"B58DF770-2A78-4580-96E7-5A6797D0F8CD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/気持ちの良い寝顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2143","telop":"すると、気持ちよさそうに〇ですやすや眠るこいしのベッドのそばに僕の服があり、僕は、ささっと着て、部屋から出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2144スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B2B2FE94-57AD-41EF-A9AA-AA2763680CD3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2144","telop":"それからしばらくして…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2145スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3ECB4ECC-ADFD-4473-8D0E-82B7DBDEFB1E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2145","telop":"それから、しばらくたって、\n僕たちはレストランで、朝食を食べることにした。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2146スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C53FC57C-1A6B-499D-9BB5-01FEA0AD521C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2146","telop":"すると、霊夢が僕に声をかけてくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2147スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"1D3B85F7-D476-4B10-B6C8-8E39FF3E9E0E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2147","telop":"「あんたは昨日、どこで寝たの？」\n私は、さとりとこいしの様子がおかしいので、彼に問う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2148スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B9F1FDEC-D793-4D0C-9E19-E4DC566256E0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2148","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、\n今朝のことをそっくりそのまま彼女に伝える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2149スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"17715AAD-7687-4FA2-BC41-E72AE56DB7BB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2149","telop":"「あんたね…そう言うことは、\n公の場で言うことじゃないわよ。まったく…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2150スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"954F30C4-814A-4A2E-84A4-076975B7D957","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2150","telop":"「罰として、今夜の宿では私と魔理沙と\n一緒の部屋で一晩過ごすわよ。それで、いいわね？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2151スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7F777F97-6AD1-40EC-9842-6C9C9A9113E3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2151","telop":"「分かりました…」僕は、彼女が怒っているのは、\nなぜなのか気になりながら、言った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2152スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D1BDEF71-40B1-4AB6-A3D2-583FC07CDD87","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2152","telop":"彼女たちが朝食を終えると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2153スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0C4E8ED6-ECE8-49E2-BBA6-3C8AA256097A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2153","telop":"僕たちは、それから部屋で支度を済ませると、\nチェックアウトを済ませて、車に乗り込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2154スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DCAB0E5D-F55C-4FF0-81FE-CE9E59017A5D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2154","telop":"「それで、これから、どこに行くの？」\n私はハンドルを握り、助手席の彼に聞く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2155スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F4C6ABE0-3FB6-4ED6-A08A-CDC4D29FAAA6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2155","telop":"「さとりさんたちはどこに行きたいですか？」\n僕は、そうさとりに意見を聞く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2156スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7827FF34-4DA9-4D23-828E-25A2A9615CBB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2156","telop":"「私は…特に行きたいところは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2157スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"666D0ED2-7623-4069-8CB4-90FAE65F5A12","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2157","telop":"「それなら、海洋博公園に行きますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2158スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"ED7C6B99-F56A-47A4-9B5D-30DB0A11C604","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2158","telop":"「海洋博公園？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2159スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2926667A-50C9-48B6-9143-852D85A6D821","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2159","telop":"「ええ、九州沖縄サミットが半世紀前くらいに\n開かれた時に、できた国営の公園ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2160スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B860DCD9-C087-470F-AB35-A6CC7A0F756C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2160","telop":"「何か、観光スポットでもあるんですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2161スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BB5769D2-4125-4BA8-95FC-CF7EEE57FFA3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2161","telop":"「海洋博公園には水族館と、熱帯植物が見れるセンターと、博物館…あとイルカショーが見れる劇場があります。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2162スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E49F6CEE-FC34-4ACC-B639-9166586B7619","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2162","telop":"「イルカショーですか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2163スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5BAEAB6D-A886-4009-AAEA-C78D337AA7D3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2163","telop":"「じゃあ、とりあえず、そこにする？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2164スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"703D47E5-CE96-4E84-9026-7D47BFBDA07F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2164","telop":"「そうですね…そこに行きましょうか…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2165スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"14CB9BDA-A9A4-4EDA-974D-CBF847593923","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2165","telop":"僕は、霊夢と魔理沙も納得したのを確認すると、こいしに海洋博公園までの道のりを案内するのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2166スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"96704465-F949-4148-B615-1B9129A3020A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2166","telop":"海洋博公園に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2167スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"82CC8C91-BE18-4C64-88C4-B4E41E3A1692","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2167","telop":"僕たちは、海洋博公園につくと、駐車場に車を停めて、\n小高い崖の上から対岸の島と海を眺めていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2168スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9DA52288-CEA9-48F3-A73C-A8F1DDFDBB1F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2168","telop":"すると、後ろから魔理沙が僕に声をかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2169スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"4C1087C4-A2FA-4686-B8EC-DA853F0B695C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2169","telop":"「なぁ、向こうに見える島は、何の島だ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2170スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"C071D583-FAD5-4E01-A0E5-C9F773E22260","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2170","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう聞かれ、ふと向こうに見える島の名前を、思い出そうとする。すると、ポンっと頭に浮かぶ。「伊江島です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2171スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"CBFF0799-A3F1-43B5-8358-111C5810A808","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2171","telop":"「へぇ〜。」\n私はそう言いながら、海を眺める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2172スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"92216CD6-BC47-4BC0-9650-521F75F171B8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2172","telop":"「それで魔理沙さんたちは、次に行きたい場所はありますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2173スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"E3AF1E0D-C45C-4B5A-8583-3BA423CCDB56","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2173","telop":"「次は、水族館を見たいな…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2174スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"08C238D9-4A7B-48EB-8C05-1CD8B4BD106F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2174","telop":"僕はそれから、霊夢たちも水族館が見たいと言うと、\n水族館の入り口に向かって、共に歩き出した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2175スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"92C5D7E4-156E-49C7-9710-C7B1A3D86318","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2175","telop":"僕たちはそれから、水族館に入ると、\n券売機で5人分の入場券を買い、そのまま中に入る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2176スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"78D811B3-89F6-435A-B81E-61424512E8FA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2176","telop":"そして、水族館の中で一番大きい水槽の前に来ると、彼女たちは水槽の中で泳ぐ、魚たちをゆっくりと眺める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2177スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8E66FECE-911A-430B-AD0C-B568E09BE355","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2177","telop":"僕は、ふと霊夢の隣に立つと、彼女から魚の名前を色々と聞かれ、そのたび僕は、頭と目を働かせて正確に答える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2178スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"401C3D0A-CD30-46BC-98E0-DF4B9F1C54D3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2178","telop":"「あんたって魚の種類や名前に詳しいのね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2179スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"DEBFFCB3-5882-496C-A24A-A173A43D8D06","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2179","telop":"「いや、僕は目の前に見える魚を目で見て、その映像を頭の中で分析して、その魚の情報を導き出しているんですよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2180スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"52448D87-0241-4985-8C94-D0DDF231E028","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2180","telop":"僕は、そこで、ふと自分の発言がどこかおかしいことに気がつく。すると、だんだんと頭痛がやってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2181スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E3A02E57-ED22-4E92-81C2-0210DD40BCC9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2181","telop":"僕は、ふとハッとすると、そこはイルカショーが見れる劇場だった。「あれ、僕は何してたんだっけ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2182スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2F183FB1-2D9D-44E3-8399-96952863F338","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2182","telop":"だが、ふと視界にこいしとさとりが笑っている姿が入ると、「まぁ、いっか…」と呟き、自分もイルカショーを観た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2183スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"82F51E6A-A71D-42BE-8C69-42C8C39F368F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2183","telop":"操夢たちがショーを見終わると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2184スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E669CCC1-8C04-4D79-BD85-323E1B7E822C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2184","telop":"僕たちは、イルカショーを見終えると、\nその足取りで駐車場に向かい、車に乗り込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2185スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DEDC5EAE-B38A-4CD4-8186-00CD06CAB2A6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2185","telop":"「それで、次はどこに行く？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2186スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9AFB432A-F186-45C9-9854-8ADFF3168033","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2186","telop":"「そうですね…こいしさんたちはお腹、空きましたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2187スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"806BB54E-47D4-4B4D-B54C-37ECA7332B5E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2187","telop":"僕が、そうこいしたちに尋ねると、\n彼女たちは「たしかに、お腹が空いた」とつぶやく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2188スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0C5E8F85-F0FA-4C5E-87C4-CDED8FE1E56B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2188","telop":"僕はそこで、名護での昼食場所を考え、\nふと思い浮かんだお店までの道のりをこいしに案内する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2189スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"853DB34A-B655-4642-BC52-DF0043BF3C84","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2189","telop":"彼女たちがお店に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2190スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A5564C15-DB09-45E6-9C96-8279104F7B5D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2190","telop":"僕たちは名護市街に入ると、僕が考えていたお店は潰れていて、国道沿いのご当地ファストフード店に入る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2191スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6AFE5B71-D18E-4323-B14B-D844FE7E4C89","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2191","telop":"僕は、霊夢たちに食べたいものを聞き出し、頭に入れると、彼女たちは席を取り、僕は注文の列に並ぶ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2192スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"1CDA4FDD-FC3C-4607-B1B9-5C82E7604E71","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2192","telop":"「ご注文は何でしょう？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2193スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"171E627A-7F73-4839-810E-BCDA31DB5C9C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2193","telop":"僕は、何となく声と容姿に違和感がある店員に注文をいう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2194スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3DE9C940-7F04-4822-B5E7-DD287CD1320C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2194","telop":"「では、この注文札を席においてお待ちください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2195スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0D7D8F16-F4B4-41A2-B804-8E3586B3DC05","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2195","telop":"彼女がそう告げると、僕はその札を取り、席に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2196スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"55C1222E-3819-4987-929E-9E4CDDCC23E0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2196","telop":"ふと、席に着くと、霊夢が怪訝そうな顔で言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2197スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"36F1E371-B53B-4F00-81DE-99DB7A540DA7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2197","telop":"「どうしたの、あんた、あの店員に違和感でもあるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2198スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"9D34EF6D-98EA-414A-BCFE-2C4B9021A619","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2198","telop":"「なんとなく…です、自信を持っては言えませんが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2199スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D76E783A-9C6E-4212-99C4-4D3622328DF0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2199","telop":"「そう…、もし何かおかしいことがあったら、言って頂戴ね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2200スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D72FEDE3-1931-4572-B67B-FE7D133490A8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2200","telop":"「分かりました…」僕は、それから何も発さずに、待っていると、自分が持っている札の番号が呼び出される。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2201スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"781C26B8-7DD2-44A1-8335-40D882258EB9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2201","telop":"「こちら、ご注文の品です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2202スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"CAA0F1FE-301D-4E6F-B27D-4F7BAD4AE773","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2202","telop":"「ありがとうございます…」\n僕はそう言いながら、席に戻りかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2203スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F21BA820-CA1F-41AD-89F6-7E261B3085BF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2203","telop":"だが、彼女が突如カウンターからこちらに駆け寄る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2204スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3E91295D-9835-4FAA-A00F-AF195F2D2018","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2204","telop":"「お客さん、ちょっと耳寄りな情報があるんですけど…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2205スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"9E1BCBE8-53BF-483D-8CCF-D862B38E7376","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2205","telop":"「あなたのポッケにおすすめの島唄居酒屋の住所を入れておきましたから、ぜひ、それに乗っているお店で夕飯を食べてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2206スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9E9542FF-963C-42D2-B5E5-1C39AA00FECD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2206","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、足早にキッチンに入っていった。\n僕は、彼女に渡された名刺のような紙を見る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2207スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B74D2274-8DBF-4734-AB9B-785885198457","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2207","telop":"「島唄居酒屋…、『二胡』、店長、冴月麟…」僕はそう言いながら、お店の場所を割り出す。「市街地の通り沿いか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2208スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6D693679-A637-47B1-B56D-8385288FFC0E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2208","telop":"僕は、そう言いながら、ふと裏を見ると、手書きのようなメモ書きがあり、「ぜひ、お一人でどうぞ。」と書いてあった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2209スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1B66F8EB-4A87-4217-ADC8-ADB367A5A876","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2209","telop":"僕は、それをポッケにしまうと、霊夢たちの席に戻った。だが、その名刺のことについては一切彼女たちに言わなかった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2210スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"877D5A83-1A30-4856-959F-CD99C021F56A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2210","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2211スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc268705_リビング２（夕方）.jpg","id":"78521142-55AF-4C3A-85DA-28A554A2632E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2211","telop":"僕たちは、その後、近くのビーチがある公園により、日が傾くまで海水浴をすると、お昼に確保した一軒家貸しの宿に入った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2212スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E42E4FD1-CCF3-4F7E-A224-B54D8AFB3488","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2212","telop":"そして、彼女たちは疲れたのか、宿に入ると眠ってしまい、僕はその隙にあの名刺にあるお店に一人でやってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2213スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"9302ADE1-174C-4868-AD9A-5C302CC916AD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2213","telop":"すると、お昼に見かけたあの店員が僕をカウンターに入れて、ワインと夕食を取りながら彼女の島唄ライブを聞き出し…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"F89DEF4D-A263-4C76-9629-4A5101DA1257","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"FD5EBBCF-6361-497A-B7F3-F8BB44ECF997","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi※前回の予告内容から一部変更してお送りします。","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2216スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FDF11536-829D-4F3E-83E3-151E32857438","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2216","telop":"僕たちは、お昼ご飯を済ますと、近くにあるビーチに来ていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2217スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"551FE065-5086-4D69-B298-041AEF12C730","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2217","telop":"「あんたは、海で泳がないの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2218スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B77C194A-E922-4FEF-A53E-5AC590AC2440","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2218","telop":"「ええ、僕は泳げないし、浮き輪もないので…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2219スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0534DC11-5466-4011-84A0-F9D88D917D67","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2219","telop":"「そう、じゃあ、魔理沙が私を呼んでるし、行ってくるわ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2220スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D7881A3B-0CE7-46D4-8BFD-17393E712523","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2220","telop":"彼女は、そういうと、魔理沙の元に駆けていった。\n僕は、ゆっくりと砂浜に座り、海を静かに眺める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2221スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B2DE9DC7-2B9F-4493-A61A-BB3E3F9A237C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2221","telop":"僕は、海を眺めているとある人の発言を思い出す。\n「沖縄人は、海を見る、本土の人は、海で遊ぶ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2222スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AE8709AE-5E2B-4798-8634-8DD4E98D77C7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2222","telop":"「僕は、果たしてどっち側なのだろう…」僕は父が沖縄生まれで、母が東京生まれで、沖縄と東京のハーフである。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2223スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5EE82E83-C6E4-45AC-8ACE-7C342A595ADC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2223","telop":"だが、僕が生まれた場所は成増なので、\nないちゃー扱いなのだろうか？","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2224スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6DD06866-4EF5-4CA4-ACE1-61509445B020","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2224","telop":"僕は、そんなことを考えていると、ふと眠気がして、\nそのまま砂浜にゴロンとすると、目を閉じた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2225スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A2D126A5-7CA2-4130-87CB-71F1C2A7811D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2225","telop":"それから時が進み…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2226スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"88BFAC8D-BE73-4401-8B13-D9D6F79AA01F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2226","telop":"僕は、ふと誰かに体を揺すられている気がして、目を覚ます。\nすると、霊夢が小言でぶつぶつと何かを言っている。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2227スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A7A990C6-77C2-4CC3-A4B2-992FCB0F2B72","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2227","telop":"僕は、その表情から彼女たちが遊び疲れて眠いのだと考え、\n彼女が転ばないように支えながら、車の方へと向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2228スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"3565B87D-5598-4F89-B689-005043CE6095","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2228","telop":"僕がなんとか、霊夢を支えて車に乗ると、魔理沙たちが車の一番後ろの席ですやすやと眠っていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2229スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"056E2F40-5AFF-4A3B-B8E6-7C9E7CF3CD23","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2229","telop":"そして僕が、車の真ん中の席に霊夢をそっと座らせると、\n気がつけば、彼女も眠りに落ちたようだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2230スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BC99C6D2-CE6A-4F12-B8CF-B909613AD6B4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2230","telop":"「あれ…、誰が車の運転を…」僕はそこで、\n今夜の宿まで車を運転する人がいないことに気づく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2231スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BAD89E2E-9441-4B02-BAD3-6D97040FF3F8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2231","telop":"そこでふと僕は、考え、運転席に乗り込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2232スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"02125693-6725-4BF9-BA9E-FBC938D64232","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2232","telop":"そして、頭の中でドライブシュミレーションをしながら、車のエンジンをかけると、ゆっくりとアクセルを踏み、動き始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2233スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"28BEAC12-9D55-4992-B6B6-FE7159D8AC0E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2233","telop":"操夢たちが今夜の宿に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2234スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc268705_リビング２（夕方）.jpg","id":"F52285CE-848F-4508-B274-E21B68DFB992","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2234","telop":"僕は、今夜の一軒家を1棟貸しの宿に着くと、簡単にチェックインを済ませ、寝てしまった4人を宿の中に運び込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2235スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc268705_リビング２（夕方）.jpg","id":"CAB15F82-DB75-4C40-BC8F-19E7B9496C93","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2235","telop":"そして、彼女たちを各自のベッドに乗せると、ふとお腹が鳴る。\nそこで、ふとポッケに入れた名刺を思い出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2236スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc268705_リビング２（夕方）.jpg","id":"92B94E48-A889-4737-8D75-AF7CDB0C4E33","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2236","telop":"僕は、そこで、夜ご飯を食べに、そのお店に一人で向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2237スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"658F829C-004B-4F8C-B6A0-10A56510C269","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2237","telop":"彼がお店に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2238スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0D1B4CF0-2E79-417A-B340-EBACC9B9C58D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2238","telop":"僕は、お店に入ると「めんそーれー」という声が聞こえる。\nそして、お昼に名刺を渡した人が来る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2239スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0900A9B8-4BB4-4F7F-A73E-A98476A3767E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2239","telop":"すると、彼女は僕をカウンターに案内し、\n僕も勧められた席に腰掛ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2240スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"85244BFD-A0DD-4F50-9863-BCF4111316FE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2240","telop":"「いらっしゃいませ、こちら、メニューです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2241スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1890F566-FCFF-42E4-9800-E17E3D3D458A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2241","telop":"彼女はそういうと、メニューを渡す。僕は、それを眺めると、ある飲み物を見つけ、それと、マンゴージュースを頼む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2242スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"34D2DB27-ACFD-490E-9CB8-E05DB41202CA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2242","telop":"僕が注文すると、彼女はキッチンの方に入り、僕は、近くにあったポットからお茶を入れて、飲む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2243スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4AD59248-A273-4EA9-A4B6-D5BAA4BBC260","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2243","telop":"しばらくして、彼女から渡されたのは、琉球ワインというものと、マンゴージュースだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2244スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"ED8F3EBC-EE37-43AD-B4DB-A49A8006D564","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2244","telop":"僕は、マンゴージュースを一口飲むと、ワインと一緒に渡されたグラスにワインを注ぎ、一口飲む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2245スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AFBBC32F-EA02-42BA-8E68-E49205212E50","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2245","telop":"そして、再びメニューを見ると、塩焼きそばを頼む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2246スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DD3BCF9E-C340-48D1-9BDE-9E70EC46503C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2246","telop":"ふと周りを見ると、周りには少数のお客さんだけがいて、彼女ともう一人の二人で回しているようだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2247スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1CFD5D2A-50A1-4DEC-8149-74DD88F8265C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2247","telop":"ふと、あるテーブル席に目が入り、目線を向ける。ふと彼女の姿をどこかで見た気がするが、思い出せない。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2248スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DA10F18C-3C96-4705-8E40-764B12C9D9F5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2248","telop":"すると、彼女はこちらにニコッと笑みを向ける。「まぁ、いっか…」僕はそうぼさっと小さく呟き、目線を戻す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2249スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"91A0A451-F180-4452-8729-1A92A14AADA1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2249","telop":"すると、先ほどの店員が塩焼きそばを持ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2250スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"EEE8CDE0-4D14-4019-9365-13E5972A7127","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2250","telop":"「こちら、塩焼きそばです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2251スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4C3DBDCB-844B-4A27-9D13-73A8DC76299C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2251","telop":"僕は、彼女が塩焼きそばを置いて、再び離れると、\n僕は、一緒に出された箸で焼きそばを食べ始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2252スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"285EEF6A-8792-4895-BD17-042B4B4E062D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2252","telop":"僕は、それを10分少々で平らげると、ワインとマンゴージュースを一口飲む。すると、先ほどの店員が通路に立つ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2253スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"42A80CC0-6684-462D-8136-802CDBCDC640","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2253","telop":"「では、時間になりましたので、1回目のライブを開きます。」\n私はそういうと、二胡を弾きながら、名曲を歌い始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2254スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D6E80C17-E5DE-49F0-9193-6FEA25F344D1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2254","telop":"彼が1回目のライブを聞き終えると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2255スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"87F4E709-C80D-42F9-B855-1F35103A770B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2255","telop":"僕は、彼女の1回目のライブを聴き終わると、\nふと、小腹が空き、彼女にミニそばを注文する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2256スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"4759B0F5-6985-49CC-A001-4BBB629CD0D0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2256","telop":"「こちら、ミニそばです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2257スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3A940D2F-0931-4D19-8D2E-57C7E77B8DAD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2257","telop":"彼女はそういうと、またキッチンの方に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2258スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1C8D8E3D-7361-432A-B2A8-F5D176873B82","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2258","telop":"彼が2回目のライブを聞き終えると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2259スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7A27EEBB-861A-4838-9E66-A112B9A6A5BC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2259","telop":"「お客さん、どうですか…今のご気分は…。」\n私は、頃合いを見計らい計画通りに話し始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2260スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A8B27B3C-D6EB-41C6-A8FF-DC8784F589F9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2260","telop":"「…いい気分ですよ…」僕は、そう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2261スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"CD14067B-9A46-457A-BBE7-F32959D44C64","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2261","telop":"「そうですか…、そういえば、当店自慢の飲み物が\nあるんですけど…、いかが致しますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2262スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"AF3D67B2-5B2D-46E0-88B1-B4F4AF668615","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2262","telop":"「…なんですか、その飲み物は？」僕はそう彼女に尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2263スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"04E2103F-71F3-40E1-8DA1-9922958FA834","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2263","telop":"私たちの予想通り彼がそういうと、私は、持ってきたシャンパンを見せる。「これは、珍しい飲み物なんですよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2264スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"CC98F740-BFB4-46AD-910D-F0EC0C5E0F08","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2264","telop":"「へぇ…」僕は、何気なく頭の中で考えると、\nあることを呟く。「それ…飲んでみたいです…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2265スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BF29A967-0D32-40AC-9AC1-949EF28327A0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2265","telop":"「承知しました。では、グラスに注ぎますね。」\n私は、そういうと、グラスにそれを注ぎ、彼に渡す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2266スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"ED87DD73-96EA-4BBD-8E17-6566AA8274CD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2266","telop":"僕は、それをゆっくりと口に入れると、どことなく甘く、どことなくシュワシュワする感触を感じる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2267スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"404E5101-A6B5-4FA7-91D6-C0A5C24A834F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2267","telop":"彼がシャンパンを一口、口に含むとそのままうつ伏せになる。\n「作戦成功ですね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2268スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1BC34CE8-F97F-4E34-8107-05100D7878A3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2268","telop":"「ほら、彼が寝静まったぞ…、文もいるんじゃろ…、\nどうぞ好き勝手してくれ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2269スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"298F29EE-3922-48E2-9882-A13C1DD2E9E6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2269","telop":"「どうも、私とみとりの身勝手な依頼に\n答えていただきありがとうございます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2270スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B31E5A30-DB56-493C-AC3A-4C536B81B155","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2270","telop":"「それで、彼を寝かしつけてどうするのじゃ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2271スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"8BFFE121-C000-4A2A-9F00-B44A995B8654","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2271","telop":"「さぁ、何でしょうね…、とりあえず、\n彼は私の家に連れ去りますかね…、みとりも一緒に…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2272スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1E68E415-DD5C-4FC3-999B-93E4D48CF091","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2272","telop":"「お主も、紫の目を掻い潜ってみとりとともに彼を誘拐するなんて、とんでもないことの考えたのじゃのう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2273スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D3644088-1E07-48DE-88DF-ADB8415F58AF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2273","telop":"「まぁ、彼の中にある『彼女』は彼の先祖が生み出した機械を、みとりさんが魔改造して生み出しましたからね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2274スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"88071FED-A57C-47C9-9791-5EA9A250DE2D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2274","telop":"「えっ？」わしがそう驚いている間に、\n彼女たちは素早く彼を攫っていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2275スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E06C971D-E77A-4A60-82B1-DC28E720BDB9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2275","telop":"「まっ、わしは沖縄観光でもするか…」\nわしはそういうと、店じまいを始めるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2276スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BFDA7153-B652-46D5-8FB2-B52693856D75","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2276","telop":"お知らせ　霊夢たちの夢の中で彼が積極的に彼女たちを攻める動画を投稿するかも…、みたい人はコメントしください…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2277スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E4FDB69A-69A1-4290-9006-6F535B2EE87F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2277","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2278スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"D775D04D-3512-488C-AB79-CA4F55A3FBD2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2278","telop":"私は、ふと誰かに体をゆすられ、目を覚まし、くしゃみをする。\nそして、ふと隣を見ると、そこには暗い顔の魔理沙がいた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2279スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc247232_都会の街中（夜）.jpg","id":"618AC08D-45AE-4E71-9E1F-DA61CA46ABAA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2279","telop":"私は、魔理沙から操夢がいないことを聞き、風邪気味の状態で宿を飛び出し、夜の街を駆け回りながら、彼の姿を探す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2280スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"DD8960AD-576F-4F01-9B68-0447418B9114","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2280","telop":"だが結果として彼の姿を見つけることはできず、\n私たちは、彼のいない夜を過ごすのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"B9BE6196-387D-4ABA-B1A0-3FA7B3CB9CC7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"8D1DBD22-9E7D-4292-B6E1-9E0BD7A4EF51","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi※ニコニコ版とは内容が異なります。","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2283スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"C6AE47C4-156E-45F7-8A6F-26255D05329F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2283","telop":"「んっ…」\n私は、ふと目が覚めると、ベッドから降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2284スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"5D42F948-42C5-4491-A24C-4EE702BF7C35","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2284","telop":"そして、リビングに来ると、食卓の上に、置き手紙を見つける。\n私は、その手紙を読むと、顔が青ざめていき、霊夢を探す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2285スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"5AB922B7-A6FA-4230-917D-6DFC12342BDE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2285","telop":"「霊夢！」\n私は、そう彼女の名前を呼びながら、彼女の体を揺らす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2286スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"60F4FA39-502D-4728-8C84-CCC9AEEB5128","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2286","telop":"私は、誰かに体をゆすられ目覚めると、くしゃみが出る。\n「どうしたのよ、魔理沙？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2287スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"FD88917D-9CE4-4348-915B-10E6896640F1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2287","telop":"「操夢が…いない…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2288スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"4CABC059-A0F2-493E-8510-BC0BA5442BC0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2288","telop":"「えっ？」\n私は、魔理沙の言葉で、だんだんと頭が冴えてくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2289スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"8C499A12-6504-4B31-8406-C7685184FBDA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2289","telop":"「ねぇ、もう一回言ってちょうだい、魔理沙。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2290スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"8F8C2D51-8BFC-49B4-A52B-ACD74CEA4A0A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2290","telop":"「操夢が消えたんだよ…さとりとこいしがそれに気づいて、情報収集に出かけているって置き手紙が…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2291スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"9380A34D-09BE-433E-9EA2-5310D07F7A08","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2291","telop":"「それ、本当なの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2292スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"9AE881F8-6157-4D2C-BA2F-9A8A181D479B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2292","telop":"「ああ、とりあえず、今すぐ支度して、操夢を探さないと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2293スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"CCE1665A-3EF5-4D7C-BB4C-076B8458150C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2293","telop":"「操夢のポケベルは？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2294スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"BC952863-4A3C-44A9-8E61-616C2038D824","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2294","telop":"「操夢のポケベルは、置き手紙と一緒にあった。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2295スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"934E1539-950A-4BF4-8351-3561216D7199","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2295","telop":"「分かったわ…空から彼を一緒に探しましょ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2296スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"B771F546-C00E-40FE-AE79-262788A11BAD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2296","telop":"「いや、霊夢は地上から探してくれ、私が空から探す。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2297スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","id":"230D26D2-A348-4597-A18A-4138DABACF7E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・月明り・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2297","telop":"「じゃあ、私も支度済ませたら、彼を探し始めるわ…」\n私はそう言って、彼を探すための準備を始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2298スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"30BB20CC-B7EB-4014-B11B-B813E027CCEF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2298","telop":"その頃、さとりとこいしは…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2299スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"95FAFADC-D392-4CF0-8B46-5DD9BAD0943B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2299","telop":"私とこいしは、置き手紙を家に残すと、警察署に来ていた。\n「それで、何か情報は…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2300スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5E37C64B-0D97-4C97-867B-D2D61AFFBDBC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2300","telop":"「今現在だと、情報はないです。ただ、あることを除けば…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2301スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AAF49FB1-1017-4798-8659-175E93DEBD20","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2301","telop":"「あることって、なんですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2302スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"363557E5-1DB0-43EE-B300-615496BB65CE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2302","telop":"「今日の夕方ごろに警察のシステムトラブルが起きたんです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2303スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7E70682F-F1BF-4258-9966-F363A886D7F6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2303","telop":"「それで具体的には？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2304スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B9490733-5688-4BA1-8AF5-13CCE31797F2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2304","telop":"「いや、それは内部情報なので…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2305スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4200C69C-091A-4F60-8407-167C83F696D5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2305","telop":"「分かりました…失礼しました…」\n私は、ひっそりとその警官の心を覗くと、その場をさった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2306スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","id":"A3602FDB-D317-41A9-9A5A-839557C32F81","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","title":"シーン 2306","telop":"「それで、こいしは何か情報を見つけたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2307スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","id":"82A8C19A-580D-4017-84A5-DE8FE873A145","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","title":"シーン 2307","telop":"「少しだけなら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2308スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","id":"6880D3D9-27C9-4E19-ACB1-8682B045F47C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","title":"シーン 2308","telop":"「どんな情報なの？」\n私がそう問いかけると、彼女は私に耳打ちする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2309スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","id":"8C3D92D0-D130-4E42-A565-3642C0DBBD7C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","title":"シーン 2309","telop":"「それ、私が覗き見た思考と一緒ね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2310スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","id":"09C29916-DA15-43DE-861F-B924832470A9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","title":"シーン 2310","telop":"「それで、これからどうする？宿に戻る？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2311スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","id":"8623CAAF-48D8-4C4F-A34A-8C9A1D9D52E0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","title":"シーン 2311","telop":"「ええ、とりあえず、宿に戻って、霊夢たちと話し合いましょ。」\n私がそういうと、私とこいしは宿までの道を歩き出した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2312スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B95600D2-04AE-44E1-9E6E-B3D1F5633AF0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2312","telop":"彼女たちが宿に戻ると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2313スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"9FEFE9D2-99A1-45EF-A393-128BEAC157AE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2313","telop":"私とこいしが宿に戻ると、霊夢と魔理沙が食卓に座っていた。\n「二人は、彼を見つけたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2314スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"4BC44DFE-3A8F-473C-8321-D258D1E41B8D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2314","telop":"「いや、彼の姿は見つけられなかったわ。」\n私は、くしゃみを出しながら、そういう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2315スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"4E1E07AE-46FA-4DE6-88BD-F24092E3BFD9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2315","telop":"私はそこで、ふと思い出す。\n「今は確か…2月よね…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2316スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"801E3B5D-BEAA-445C-9168-ECAAC5B5183F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2316","telop":"私が、そう呟くと、二人は、驚きの表情を浮かべる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2317スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"BCB94E57-70BF-4DB6-9219-A3A4539237C6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2317","telop":"「なんだか、季節感がバグってるわ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2318スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"74F797A8-6027-4E4C-80F8-76A5BECCDB5A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2318","telop":"「そうなのだぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2319スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"794A81B0-3EE5-4DB5-B353-77B04D98AC63","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2319","telop":"「ねぇ、とりあえず操夢を探すのは明日にして、今日はもう寝ない…、みんな風邪気味みたいだし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2320スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"D6A9019A-63C9-489B-9DFA-7B6C9E430F4B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268706_リビング２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2320","telop":"こいしが放った言葉は事実で、私とこいしも体調が崩れていたので、私たちはこいしの意見に賛同し、寝室に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2321スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F68B068C-6BC4-4675-A65B-312F1C4DBCCA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2321","telop":"その頃、文たちは…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2322スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"504DD40A-3C28-40FF-837C-00B63C47A247","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2322","telop":"私たちは、彼を攫った後、私があらかじめ用意しておいた事業用ジェット機で家に戻り、その後にとある施設に来ていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2323スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FFA29CBE-C87C-4CA3-95A2-92850221CEFF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2323","telop":"この施設は、首相官邸の地下にある\n施設とそっくりな構造をしていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2324スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2B3B3745-1C08-4B47-9CC7-A15EBCABD42E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2324","telop":"「どうかしら、この施設を見て、\nにとりが使っている施設と比べて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2325スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"79C9A09A-3ECB-4B2D-9C0D-D10CD6962B41","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2325","telop":"「にとりが使っている施設とそっくりです。それで、あなたは、姉によって島送りの刑にされたことを、今も恨んでますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2326スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F8CF4C35-2457-444B-9913-71258F680E80","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2326","telop":"「ええ、もちろん。まぁ、それが原動力となって、彼の祖先をベースにした人工知能細胞や、プログラムが生まれてるのですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2327スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"060D921B-5AD8-4C2B-902B-A6D0B615CCD4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2327","telop":"「それで、急に彼を攫いたいと言い出して、ここまできましたけど、何をするつもりなのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2328スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DFAC39F9-7CAD-4C35-BB25-1B1E0E9A0E89","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2328","telop":"「それは…彼の最新の状態を解析するんですよ。」\n私はそういうと、あるスイッチを押す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2329スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CFB8E308-4825-42DA-8F90-692435A20BF1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2329","telop":"彼女が何かのスイッチを入れると、円球が動き出し、プロジェクターであるものが映し出される。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2330スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"889061DB-8AE7-4492-9927-D52886A6B4A1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2330","telop":"「これが、あなたが望んでいたスクープ記事ですよ。それで、あとの条件は、彼をあなたの家にお持ち帰りするんでしたっけ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2331スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DD3304CA-3B21-4B6A-ABC1-B3B2FD035E8D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2331","telop":"「ええ、この記事のデータが入ったメモリーは？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2332スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"797DB32C-168E-498B-A95F-F60D3D44F1B8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2332","telop":"私は彼女に尋ねられたメモリーを取り出し、彼女に渡す。\n「これが、メモリーです。それで何か聞きたいことは？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2333スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"93689222-1584-4B43-BB26-E1C02D5932F2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2333","telop":"「聞きたいことですか…、今は特にないですよ。このスクープ記事を載せて、彼をお持ち帰りできれば、満足ですから…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2334スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"44B700AB-DE00-4B39-929B-FC740CC39DD4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2334","telop":"「そうですか…、では、しばらくの間、\n部屋の外で待っていてもらっても大丈夫ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2335スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AD852247-0D87-4F74-A2EA-B6AC6D52A47A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2335","telop":"「分かりました。では、終わったら言ってください。」\n私はそういうと、その部屋から出た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2336スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"806B8BB5-C494-46B2-9B4F-5DF5C0BE191F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2336","telop":"「さてと、早速彼の”検査”を始めましょうか…」\n私はそういうと、彼にあるものを取り付けて、検査を始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2337スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F4668910-DC72-4E9D-BEC4-0F61E5D4BFB1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2337","telop":"操夢が目覚めると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2338スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2BD4CBA2-4C67-41D1-91B9-2B067ED7B9A5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2338","telop":"「んっ、あれ…、ここは…」\n僕は、瞼を擦りながら、ふと体を起こす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2339スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"E9D980D8-99C0-466C-9AE4-B3839D6FDBF9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2339","telop":"「おや、目が覚めたんですね、操夢さん。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2340スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BAE2FCEE-6C31-4DA3-BC7D-40E93F675BA4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2340","telop":"僕は、彼女の言葉で、頭が急に冴えた感覚がして、ふと彼女を見つめる。すると、彼女の情報が目に透けて見える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2341スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C89933F1-52AD-4B1B-871B-81BC4FF13BA2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2341","telop":"「ここは、文さんの家ですか…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2342スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"840CF5D3-BAE9-4844-BEDE-500D95F73C01","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2342","telop":"「よく分かりましたね…」\n私は、彼が瞬時に自分の状況を把握しているのだと感じる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2343スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C0A9F1FF-3F90-4F23-809B-804C90651F6D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2343","telop":"「それで、これからどうします、ご飯にします？お風呂にします？それとも…わ・た・し？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2344スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"53A807AB-8179-4013-A50D-47B1478649E8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2344","telop":"「えっと…」僕はそう呟きながら、3つの選択肢から何が起きるかを予測し、分析する。「文さんは、何がしたいですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2345スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B1D4F95D-040A-4290-9E32-6EA3A52D384C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2345","telop":"「私ですか…、すこし着替えてきても大丈夫ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2346スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"02EFA8D9-7227-4EAC-A941-D21FF1AAB647","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2346","telop":"彼女がそう聞くと、僕は彼女の次の行動を予測してから答える。\n「いいですよ…、それで、何か飲み物はありませんか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2347スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"79882C08-9832-4BDE-AD70-EC5DF32FFAD8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2347","telop":"「もちろん、ありますよ。少し待っててくださいね…」\n私は、そう言うと、部屋を離れた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2348スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"795D13FC-2923-4360-8D03-5DB7876B944D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2348","telop":"数分後…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2349スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"24EF8A38-78B5-4BBB-8BE2-097709EBDADF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2349","telop":"「お待たせしました。」\n私はそう言いながら、瓶をちゃぶ台に置く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2350スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"585DBE05-4E31-4663-9043-F2691188B60A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2350","telop":"「さて、一緒にこのワインでも飲みながら、\n朝日が昇るまで、語り合いましょ…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2351スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E384E9EF-5972-40F4-9BA1-C85F518FF33C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2351","telop":"「ええ、もちろん。」\n僕は、頭がフル回転の状態で、彼女と会話を始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2352スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6053C13A-3EE7-439F-9872-5ED0351F72C5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2352","telop":"日付が変わってしばらく経つと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2353スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"882922F6-05E9-4EBB-8FD0-1C5F0882A4BB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2353","telop":"彼女と話し始めると、会話が弾み、気がつけば日付が変わり、そこからまた数時間程度がたっていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2354スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"15B55967-2F5B-4928-8395-D21F5931CF14","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2354","telop":"「どうです、私との二人だけの時間は、楽しいですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2355スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C9410DA0-CBE8-4EE8-AFBD-66F101D0E387","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2355","telop":"「とても楽しいですよ。」\n僕は、そう笑みを見せながらいう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2356スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E9E48ECE-140D-49CF-921D-1F6B26DBF6DC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2356","telop":"「そうですか…」\n私はそう言いながら、ゆっくりと彼に手を伸ばす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2357スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9BA5CA79-0765-4AA4-9DFC-85F277512779","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/目閉じ小口開け水着.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2357","telop":"僕は、彼女がキスの構えをとると、素早く応じる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2358スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"931EC16F-9582-402E-88F1-FFB8B99437A4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/目閉じ小口開け水着.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2358","telop":"「ん…」\n私は、彼を抱き寄せるような形で彼の背中に手を伸ばす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2359スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BA354FFA-9C5C-4C10-B89E-AF2758174488","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2359","telop":"「どうです…このままイっちゃいますか？」\n私は、そう口ずさむ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2360スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D0B28E36-6B7A-45AA-8053-A8994FFBAA31","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2360","telop":"僕は、無言で彼女を押し倒す。\nそして、彼女の背中に手を回すと、ゆっくりと動かす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2361スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"96567BB6-6F0B-403F-9F87-B963554759BF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2361","telop":"そして、彼女のあの部分に、僕の棒を差し込む。\nそのまま、彼女の敏感な部分を探り当てるように動く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2362スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"25DFBF19-7D29-4300-8CFF-78F039907E65","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2362","telop":"そして、敏感なところを突くように動く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2363スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FDF4093A-C5F7-4FA9-8E7F-AF436EFDFB96","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2363","telop":"すると、彼女が驚きの声をあげる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2364スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8538AED9-19BA-4D1A-B8FF-072A472084A3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2364","telop":"「やるじゃないですか…操夢さん…、でも、まだまだですよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2365スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9A542199-0E1E-45F7-A159-088D370E3615","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2365","telop":"「そうですか…、じゃあ、続けますね…」\n僕はそう言いながら、再び動き始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2366スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D97CB50A-03E4-4A50-B71E-62922CD098D3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2366","telop":"そして、彼女のあの部分に、僕の棒を再び差し込み、\nそのまま、彼女の敏感な部分をピンポイントで当てながら動く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2367スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"94F16391-11AA-4BF7-8778-142BD34BC8C0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2367","telop":"私は、彼にピンポイントで攻められ、感嘆の言葉を放つ。\n「すごいですね…、どうやって、そのテクを…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2368スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A5A937C3-EF1C-4E66-9D2C-10E323057FDB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2368","telop":"「それは…秘密です。それと、速度、あげますね…」\n僕はそう呟きながら、先ほどより早く、彼女を動かす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2369スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CAADD391-7F38-4704-99B1-935F1ED7B742","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2369","telop":"私は、彼に少し早くピンポイントを攻められると、\nあの部分の反応が強くなる。「…まだまだですよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2370スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F1F52E7C-11C0-4596-8364-9A8CDD8E9F7D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2370","telop":"「そうですか、じゃあもう一段階早くしますね…」\n僕はそう呟きながら、先ほどより早く、彼女を動かす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2371スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8155198A-068D-4C99-BD13-FECD64E5BB31","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2371","telop":"「…あなたとの…〇〇〇〇の感触…体にみっちりと…刻みましたよ…とても…気持ちよかったです…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2372スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"43BBF66A-75F4-4DE3-9E7E-54C461F52896","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/気持ちいい寝顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2372","telop":"僕は、そう言う彼女にそっと口付けをする。すると、彼女は何も言わなくなり、眠りについていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2373スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CA411E09-5E8E-43AC-A54A-429808725C7E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/気持ちいい寝顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2373","telop":"僕は、彼女を腕でゆっくりと抱え上げると、\n寝室がないかを探す。そして、彼女を置くとそのまま家を出た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2374スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4155E804-481F-40EF-8EC7-643AAA22A043","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2374","telop":"その頃、紅魔館では…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2375スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C57D0426-BD7D-47D1-AA5A-7A32B067E46D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2375","telop":"「お嬢様、悲しいお知らせがあるのですが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2376スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"23A02B6A-5F47-4854-9620-9309564C6FC7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2376","telop":"「どうしたの、咲夜？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2377スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"39A16346-BD07-47C6-8C89-13DCEFE86BB4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2377","telop":"「今、旅行中の彼女たちから緊急連絡がありまして…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2378スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"801CA2D2-2AC7-4C83-88CF-105C7E874426","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2378","telop":"「何があったの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2379スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"ED4A862A-F6BD-4F0E-B82F-592BEE6FE604","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2379","telop":"「彼女たちが海水浴からの帰り、睡眠をとったあと、目が覚めると、宿から彼の姿が消えたようで…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2380スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4BB7112C-B8F2-4EDA-A78C-0FD7067ED43C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2380","telop":"「それで、操夢はどこにいるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2381スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CEB94CC4-9C1D-42DD-93C9-8771A2FBBF60","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2381","telop":"「彼の居場所は、分からない状況です、ただ、これが…」\n私は、そう言って、先ほど届いたFaxを見せる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2382スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"59850DCC-6F5B-4C62-8F1D-36402FC5F4A5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2382","telop":"私が、それを見ると、そこには「文々。新聞記者、射命丸文が操夢さんをお持ち帰りしました。」と書かれていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2383スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4FCCE89C-9D9D-4334-A872-AAEF2A83EECD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2383","telop":"「咲夜、文の自宅はわかるわよね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2384スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"51703616-839C-44D4-8B81-4C68A58A0346","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2384","telop":"「それは、フランお嬢様なら探し出せるかと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2385スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"18166864-E4CC-4513-B273-7F95CD0A4382","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2385","telop":"「そう、じゃあ、フランに文の自宅を\n割り出して伝えるように、言いなさい。いいわね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2386スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0C7288A1-402D-4BF6-92DC-BBBFD81FC2B1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2386","telop":"「承知しました。」\n私はそういうと、フランお嬢様がいる半地下室に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2387スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"40BDA432-ED13-40EF-AF8D-D8F4A898DC29","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2387","telop":"「あれ、どうしたの、咲夜、そんな顔して。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2388スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"F999C2FE-49F5-4049-8997-58226F621C7D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2388","telop":"「お嬢様が、このFaxをみて、彼女の住所を割り出せと…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2389スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"718E88E1-03D0-48A4-85D8-7D397B2DAD26","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2389","telop":"「そう、じゃあ、今から割り出すね…。」\n私はそう言い、PCでささっと文の自宅を割り出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2390スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"791F3E80-76DD-4D8F-92C6-58A25F5AAD30","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2390","telop":"「この住所、お姉様に伝えて、あと、もし駆け込みに行くなら、私も一緒に、この泥棒記者から奪い返すよって、言っておいて。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2391スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"4B25212C-ACAC-48CC-89DE-B11218D2B143","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc240799_パソコン部屋（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2391","telop":"「承知しました。」\nそれから、お嬢様たちは、支度を済ませて、外に出た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2392スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0C704716-E361-4E1E-AAB1-4535FFBC1A09","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2392","telop":"翌朝…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2393スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"58D7770A-407C-49DB-AB8E-832EF9ECFA6E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2393","telop":"「んっ…」\n僕は、ふと誰かの視線を感じ、目が覚める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2394スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"F30DB593-70EB-466B-ABA6-6F5A2ABDF4F4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2394","telop":"そして、ふと上半身を起こして、そちらを向くと、\nレミリアとフランが怖い笑みを浮かべていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2395スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"3000FF09-F00D-413F-A659-AA470631EBE9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2395","telop":"「あら、目が覚めたの。」私はそういうと、\n素早くベッドに乗り、彼の耳のそばに勢いよく、手をつく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2396スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"6A988DA4-C51B-430B-A048-B6EDB33E7ADE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2396","telop":"「あなた、あの泥棒記者と夜中まで仲良くしてたみたいね。\nその理由を聞かせてくれるかしら…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2397スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"B463A34B-CB35-44B4-86C7-D9E6FABE17B3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2397","telop":"僕は、彼女を眺めると同時に、思考を巡らせて、この場を鎮める方法を考える。だが、恐怖の笑みで何も思いつかない…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2398スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"367AC02E-E31E-477F-A9D3-2D2EDD78D9A4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2398","telop":"仕方なく、僕は覚悟の上で昨晩のことを話す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2399スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"FFBECC56-70FC-47F8-933B-D7909454C951","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2399","telop":"「そう、ならお仕置きね。フラン、準備はいいかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2400スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"0A4D11D7-05D4-4F96-96F5-0B380BE1FB61","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2400","telop":"「準備は万端だよ、お姉様。」\n私はそう言いながら、ベッドに入り、彼の上にまたがる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2401スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"E69DCB96-D4BB-4E25-BF67-188FC7F1D08F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2401","telop":"「なら、始めるわよ、フラン。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2402スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"5DBA6BF0-E7C3-4145-889C-874B3A4DAF29","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2402","telop":"「じゃあ、始めるね、お仕置きを…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2403スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"CFA70A57-7FAF-4B8E-AF75-51039AF02CF6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着怖い笑み.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2403","telop":"彼女たちはそう言うと、フランが僕の洋服を勝手に脱がし、\nそのままレミリアは下着姿になり、僕の棒を加える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2404スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"392CE1C9-7F85-4081-956C-14885D90831D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着怖い笑み.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2404","telop":"だが僕は、彼女が何度も当ててくる器の弱点を把握し、\nそこに焦点を当てて突つく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2405スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"2A38EC32-B530-4BDF-B9B7-C0A838439AB2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2405","telop":"「ひゃん。」\n私は、彼に敏感なところを突かれ、思わず声が漏れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2406スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"AF246674-28C5-45CA-9CBE-F96687EA09DC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2406","telop":"「あんた…、なんでこんなすぐに\n私の敏感なところを突けるのかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2407スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"1108B99B-BEA9-442D-8CD2-B4931BEF77B1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2407","telop":"「それは、あなたの体が指し示してますよ。」\n僕は彼女の指摘にそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2408スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"CE9155C5-8049-4525-8205-83416D50F1B8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2408","telop":"「えっ？」私はそう呟きながら、下を見る。\n私はそれを見ると、驚いてしまう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2409スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"40FF0B2B-4BC0-4CE4-95BC-022B6E54010D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2409","telop":"「まぁ、いいわ。とりあえず、続けるわよ。」\n私はそう言って、先ほどよりも早く動く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2410スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"279C5112-492D-4109-8BED-210A971E0702","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2410","telop":"だが、私の器は、さらに反応を示す。\nだが、同時になんとなく、心地よい感触がする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2411スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"2EACECF1-9AA0-47C2-A9CF-B4611C909B25","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2411","telop":"「お姉様、私にも彼を確かめさせて…」\n私は、そう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2412スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"F099BE93-E983-46CB-88E7-54B41F9E24F0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2412","telop":"「分かったわ…、それじゃ、彼を攻め落としなさい…。」\n私はそう言うと、ベッドから降りた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2413スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"1933291C-39F9-46ED-A906-0F36AC0B0DCF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2413","telop":"「じゃあ、始めるね。」\n私はそう言うと彼の棒を器で咥えて、動き出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2414スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"0B484242-BAC3-4413-A8AB-105FA20C9158","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2414","telop":"僕は、そう言って動き出したフランの器の中で、自分の棒を静かに小さく動かし、敏感なところを探る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2415スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"FAC97703-D102-434E-865A-396503E0D606","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2415","telop":"そして、彼女の器のある部分を突くようにする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2416スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"7B39DD9E-0174-40F0-960A-6F22F597CE8F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2416","telop":"すると、彼女の器が反応を示す。\nそして、フランの驚きの声が漏れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2417スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"38ED501A-80AE-4B21-8576-002A5228042D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（怒る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2417","telop":"「まだ、まだ、終わらせないよ。」\n私はそう言い、動く速さをあげる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2418スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"8C49A2B6-93E0-497B-87C7-6B849FD37418","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（怒る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2418","telop":"そして、僕は彼女の速度が上がると、\nよりピンポイントで素早く突つつく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2419スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"ABBAEC09-3A5C-4ACF-BD96-09E77D0B733F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2419","telop":"すると、彼女の器が先ほどより強い反応を示す。\nそして、フランの驚きの声が漏れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2420スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"AC13E9A1-891A-453D-BAA0-AE8B9761BFEA","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2420","telop":"「まだ、まだ…」\n私はそう言いながら、動く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2421スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"A7885713-A353-41AA-99C4-6E89A8A58195","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2421","telop":"彼女はそう言うが、動きの速度が下がり、\n僕は先ほどよりも丁寧に素早く突つく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2422スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"10460037-A325-435C-BC9C-2D775BDE1DAC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2422","telop":"「うぅ…」私は、彼に器を突かれ、勢いよく反応が出ると、うめき声がを漏らしながら、ベッドから降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2423スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"C734C89F-FE2B-4181-A91E-8658050D8B40","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2423","telop":"二人がいつの間にか、眠ってしまっていることに僕は気づく。\nそして、そのままそっと、ベッドから降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2424スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"EF01BD8F-6680-4EEB-AAA3-123827EEA14A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2424","telop":"そして、これからすべきことを考え、PCの電源を押す。\nだが、うまく起動しないので、親機がある部屋に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2425スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"92B5810B-D8AF-4EE4-B404-10ACAABCAD77","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2425","telop":"そして、親機のある部屋に入ると、先ほど借りてきたレミリアのポケベルを床に置き、早速電源を押す。\n※察しのいい人にはPCが見えます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2426スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C6D0C9FF-E348-4A8A-BC65-838CA4BA0674","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2426","telop":"そして、ポケベルのアイコンにカーソルを合わせてクリックする。\nFiles\nポケベル\nポケベル\nFiles\n編集\n表示\n移動\nウィンドウ\nヘルプ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2427スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A15859D9-1816-4C34-BB3B-EC5011646479","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2427","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nポケベルはさまざまな人々の\n「誰かと繋がりたい」という\n思いが沢山こもった製品として\n平成初期から中期にかけて\n流行した通話機能を有する機器\nであり、国会においてスマート\nフォンマナーの問題が挙げられ\n国民のスマートフォン利用を\n原則中止すると、我ら河童\nが生み出したこのポケベルが\n巨大な需要を生み出して…\npocketbell.kappa\/home\/top\n政府公認の安心国産ポケベル\nホーム\nポケベルって何？\n出来ること\n河童の技術力\nポケベル史\n政府公認とは？\nポケベルの魅力\n電話の歴史\nポケベルの性能\nポケベルの価格\n必要なもの\n固定電話は必須？\n通信機能について\nすると、前に１度だけみたWebページが開く。\nそして僕は、操作にカーソルを合わせる。\n操作\nWeb","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2428スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"28BC730D-EA6C-4EDF-A7CA-0FDCC52F4D93","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2428","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nポケベルはさまざまな人々の\n「誰かと繋がりたい」という\n思いが沢山こもった製品として\n平成初期から中期にかけて\n流行した通話機能を有する機器\nであり、国会においてスマート\nフォンマナーの問題が挙げられ\n国民のスマートフォン利用を\n原則中止すると、我ら河童\nが生み出したこのポケベルが\n巨大な需要を生み出して…\npocketbell.kappa\/home\/top\n政府公認の安心国産ポケベル\nホーム\nポケベルって何？\n出来ること\n河童の技術力\nポケベル史\n政府公認とは？\nポケベルの魅力\n電話の歴史\nポケベルの性能\nポケベルの価格\n必要なもの\n固定電話は必須？\n通信機能について\n次に発信にカーソルを合わせて選択する。\n操作\nWeb\n発信\n受信確認\nリロード\nキー設定\nキャリア\n速度測定\n通話記録\n情報共有\nその他…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2429スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7D8B2CBD-AB6C-46B6-9568-3681979C2ACB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2429","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nポケベルはさまざまな人々の\n「誰かと繋がりたい」という\n思いが沢山こもった製品として\n平成初期から中期にかけて\n流行した通話機能を有する機器\nであり、国会においてスマート\nフォンマナーの問題が挙げられ\n国民のスマートフォン利用を\n原則中止すると、我ら河童\nが生み出したこのポケベルが\n巨大な需要を生み出して…\npocketbell.kappa\/home\/top\n政府公認の安心国産ポケベル\nホーム\nポケベルって何？\n出来ること\n河童の技術力\nポケベル史\n政府公認とは？\nポケベルの魅力\n電話の歴史\nポケベルの性能\nポケベルの価格\n必要なもの\n固定電話は必須？\n通信機能について\n次に霊夢にカーソルを合わせる。\n操作\nWeb\n発信\n受信確認\nリロード\nキー設定\nキャリア\n速度測定\n通話記録\n情報共有\nその他…\nフラン\n咲夜\nパチュリー\n霊夢\n魔理沙\nさとり\nこいし\n操夢\n連絡先…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2430スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4B09CB89-A68F-4F82-8759-BBCC2A03C8C1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2430","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nPocketBell\/control\/dispatch\/霊夢\n博麗霊夢に発信中…\nすると、「博麗霊夢に発信中…」と表示される。\n操作\nWeb\nキャンセル","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2431スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","id":"FEE7C3C3-8FE5-4944-926E-3415E1B609F7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2431","telop":"私は、ふとポケベルの振動を感じ、ポッケから出すと、レミリアからの着信だった。そして、オレンジ色のボタンを押す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2432スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7213E492-BEB7-4C28-B4A9-848F0C1391C7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2432","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nPocketBell\/control\/dispatch\/霊夢\n博麗霊夢に通話中…\n「もしもし、霊夢さん、聞こえますか？」\n操作\nWeb\n通話を終了","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2433スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","id":"3E929A1D-A9B1-4080-9CF1-E175B1333516","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2433","telop":"「この声は、操夢？なんで、操夢がレミリアのポケベルを持ってるの？今どこにいるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2434スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1E60C207-F454-4DB9-8312-69E5226C8952","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2434","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nPocketBell\/control\/dispatch\/霊夢\n博麗霊夢に通話中…\n僕は、そう聞く霊夢に対して、すこし記憶が戻り、島唄居酒屋のところから、今朝までの経緯を話す。\n操作\nWeb\n通話を終了","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2435スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","id":"9AF4B22F-9C25-46DC-BE54-FDED3349F9F2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2435","telop":"「え？そういうことは、私たちの家にいるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2436スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C3E0735D-BDCF-4AD3-838D-90CC09706535","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2436","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nPocketBell\/control\/dispatch\/霊夢\n博麗霊夢に通話中…\n「そうです。それで、さっきまでレミリアとフランさんに…」\n操作\nWeb\n通話を終了","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2437スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","id":"9503E5EF-617E-48A9-8EAD-5C9CBA86BEF4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2437","telop":"私は、彼のその発言に衝撃を受ける…\n「操夢、私たちが帰ったらみっちり、お仕置きね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2438スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"36958102-A8A9-4DC4-8418-B4471E9C7561","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2438","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nPocketBell\/control\/dispatch\/霊夢\n博麗霊夢に通話中…\n「えっと…はい…それで、いつごろこっちに戻りますか？」\n操作\nWeb\n通話を終了","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2439スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","id":"9C73A9B8-7C2E-4331-852B-41BC8A7AE085","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2439","telop":"「とりあえず、魔理沙たちを呼んで、今すぐそっちに行けるようにするから、待ってなさい。レミリアにポケベルも返すのよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2440スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"44F16822-5F01-414D-8AC5-0B1ADEFE51AD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2440","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nPocketBell\/control\/dispatch\/霊夢\n博麗霊夢に通話中…\n「分かりました。」\n僕はそういうと、通話を終了のボタンを選択した。\n操作\nWeb\n通話を終了","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2441スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C584E848-9C63-4D68-989D-32C9ACE57E51","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2441","telop":"僕はふと気がつくと、レミリアとフランの二人が部屋に入ってきた。だが、なんとなく二人の様子に違和感を覚える。\n※察しのいい人にはPCが見えます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2442スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7DB469CE-017B-4CFD-BDC8-9627E46DED43","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2442","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢…、もう一回私を…いい気持ちにして…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCが見えます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2443スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3EB7D25C-4756-4C3B-9BD8-49A5DDC71F4D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2443","telop":"「私も…お願い…操夢…」\n※察しのいい人にはPCが見えます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2444スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F47DBFFA-98F8-44E2-A5B5-2497868B073F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2444","telop":"僕は、二人の表情から何が起きたのかを分析すると、ある予測と傾向が浮かび上がる。それは、警告でもあった。\n※察しのいい人にはPCが見えます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2445スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5F6571A2-1752-4BB6-AA49-0BF711A1E89A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2445","telop":"だが、僕は、何も言わずに、レミリアを抱き抱えると、自室のベッドに運び、フランも運び込んだ。\n※察しのいい人にはPCが見えます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2446スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"533A387C-EF0E-494D-A58A-910B87FD3209","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り困り顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2446","telop":"「じゃあ、始めますね。」\n僕はそういうと、レミリアを持ち上げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2447スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D5DB95AD-94CC-4E72-8AD8-C73404B2D69F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り困り顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2447","telop":"そして、ゆっくりと、ジリジリと彼女を攻め込む。\n「今の気分はどうですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2448スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BDCDA760-483B-43E8-B0A4-DAE2153827B8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2448","telop":"僕がそう言っていると、彼女から声が漏れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2449スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"35A8BD37-0984-44A9-A690-DEA4678421F3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2449","telop":"「気持ちいい…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2450スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"23ADBFA2-2323-47DA-9D0F-701EDCA0B852","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2450","telop":"「そうですか、それで何よりです。」\n僕はそう言いながら、同じ速度で彼女を動かす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2451スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"618628EB-63EB-462E-ABCF-94828578C454","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2451","telop":"すると、再び彼女から声が漏れる。\n「どうします、続けますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2452スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6639DA67-C316-4C4C-A437-263CFD8E3021","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2452","telop":"「もっと…続けて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2453スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"55D6E5EF-1869-45F2-B5A2-4323BAC75DD5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2453","telop":"僕は、彼女の言葉に従って、同じ速度で彼女を動かす。\n彼女の表情を読み取ると、眠いことがわかる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2454スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"41F53308-5B4D-4D52-8241-33E2CCCD09BE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2454","telop":"僕は、そのまま彼女を動かしていると、再び声が出そうになり、僕は最後に口づけをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2455スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B1AE998C-781B-4088-9D9D-393C90DBE682","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/疲れた寝顔水着.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2455","telop":"すると彼女は、そのまま寝落ちした。\n僕は、そっと彼女を抱え上げ、一度床に移す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2456スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FB3A3165-DC5D-4943-BED7-1948E7502FEE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2456","telop":"そして、今度はフランの体を持って、上下に動かしながら、\nレミリアと同じ速度でゆっくりとじんわり攻め込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2457スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"82B81FBD-5F9E-4F73-80C5-67C4B086C406","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2457","telop":"すると、フランが「あっ」という声と共にアレが出る。\n僕は、特に構わず、そのまま続行する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2458スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E344FF04-1BA4-4315-ABD9-D55CF31A37D9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2458","telop":"そして、じんわり攻め込む。\nそして、しばらく経つと再び彼女は「あっ」と漏らす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2459スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"233ECF85-66FE-4E5E-A217-F697D3B798B2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2459","telop":"「とても…気持ちいいし…心地いい…」\n私はふと、そう漏らす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2460スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A59AA46B-2AEB-494A-BAA0-6387D3AB6F24","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2460","telop":"「そうですか。では、続けますね。」\n僕はそう返し、彼女を動かし続ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2461スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"06EA94A2-7EEA-45DD-90E2-068AE06DD323","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2461","telop":"そして、三度目の声が彼女から出そうになると、\n僕は、そっとキスをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2462スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D5DBCF4C-FBA3-4727-A655-F8540436812F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/後ろ手すやすや頬照り寝顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2462","telop":"そして、彼女はそのまま眠りに落ちた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2463スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"62807DBB-CACE-4516-9416-ED8CE55174E7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 2463","telop":"僕はそれから、共同スペースに降りてくる。\nすると、そこには、パチュリーと咲夜がいた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2464スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"A87D72D1-23E1-471C-B23F-2DA244C3FC94","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 2464","telop":"「あなた…思ったより元気じゃない…心配して損したわ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2465スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"A3297821-845C-4B6B-958C-622B8D61527E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 2465","telop":"「それで、先についたお嬢様たちは、どこにいるのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2466スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"D7BE659A-6581-4E9D-99D2-B3D67F714D9E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 2466","telop":"僕は、そこで、先ほどまでの流れを説明する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2467スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"0BAE6427-636A-444C-B5AD-9DBB911BAE11","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/パチュリー（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 2467","telop":"「あなた、それは、もはや単なる〇〇〇〇の領域超えて、あの二人のあなたに懐かせているんじゃない…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2468スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"5F371033-0A28-4153-97B0-21A84847E913","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 2468","telop":"「もはや、懐かせるのではなくて、彼とじゃないと〇〇〇〇でいい気持ちにならなくなってるんじゃ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2469スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"A89437CC-1A8F-4753-8F0F-53A251A45B86","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2469","telop":"「ねぇ…私と〇〇〇〇してくれないかしら…、あの二人が感じたあなたのテクニックを私も感じたいわ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2470スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"0BB7E96A-CAE3-4C87-8F3C-7C57A7C5503C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2470","telop":"「私も…あなたのテクニックを自分で実感したい…です…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2471スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"67A5F5F0-71DD-4974-B05F-0F7D18ED3CE0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2471","telop":"「それなら、どこでしますか？今、僕の部屋はフランさんとレミリアさんが寝ているので、入れないですが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2472スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"A283308A-18A8-41B5-88FE-96AE0A43BCC9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2472","telop":"「それなら、私の部屋にしましょう…」\n私は、そう彼に提案する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2473スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"67724DD5-22B6-4A59-A446-5990F20D2AD8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2473","telop":"「分かりました…」\n僕はそれから、二人と共に咲夜の部屋に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2474スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1AA4F4D6-1D40-4FF0-8801-7F757B9FE3E0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2474","telop":"僕はそれから、咲夜の部屋にくると、先にパチュリーをベッドに運ぶ。そして、彼女の希望を予測して、彼女を動かす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2475スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5B017C91-188D-4299-A084-308DC42CA666","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2475","telop":"「どうですか、今の気分は？」\n僕は、彼女を動かしながら彼女に聞く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2476スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F1CF9601-DEEE-4131-BF9A-006B41919C08","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2476","telop":"「…すごい…私の好みを把握してるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2477スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9F94AAE5-F29A-436A-B490-810ABBC02B36","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2477","telop":"「いや、僕が頭で予測したんですよ。」\n僕はそう返す。すると、彼女が反応する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2478スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"53535E37-E9BA-4D7F-9B2B-B73D66C355D7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2478","telop":"「あ…気持ちいい…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2479スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4FADF560-DAFB-4CC7-A568-C34CBDC911B2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2479","telop":"僕は、一瞬ニコッと微笑み、そのまま彼女を動かす。\n今度は、少しだけ早くする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2480スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4C36C3CF-C471-485E-AD80-74EEB47C9AB9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2480","telop":"すると、すぐに彼女の反応が返ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2481スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4BCC22A9-592F-4E91-A5FF-0DBDDFCEE1EC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2481","telop":"「もっと…」\n私は、ぼそっとそう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2482スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2996E5A3-899C-4AF6-BFC8-8C684CF85519","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2482","telop":"僕は、もう一回、ニコッと微笑み、彼女を動かす。\nそして、最初の時よりも遅い速度にする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2483スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"244DCB28-F31D-4BC7-860A-4EB3D0534284","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/水着頬照り小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2483","telop":"そして、彼女の反応が返ってくると、\n僕は、そっと彼女の口を封じる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2484スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C6D136DB-467B-4CC7-99D1-84D07F56DDB8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2484","telop":"そして、寝落ちした彼女をそのままそっとベッドから床に移す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2485スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"A6C63F7F-553D-412D-AB64-4EF21A764971","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 2485","telop":"そのままの流れでベッドに乗った\n咲夜の体を持ち、上下に動かす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2486スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"EC7BFDC4-70A6-4208-8986-92F190813C97","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 2486","telop":"「あっ」彼の攻めに思っていたよりも、\nすぐに私のあそこが反応し、驚きの声をあげる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2487スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"259F9E56-F563-44B4-9C1F-3A123D882E7F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 2487","telop":"僕は、少し、速度を緩めて、彼女を動かす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2488スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"B0D08890-C5B2-405C-B1D6-BB94D1EE4301","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 2488","telop":"すると、彼女は小さな声を発し、\n僕はそれを皮切りに、もう一段階、速度を緩める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2489スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（弱る）.png","id":"32D3A417-61DA-4511-8C7F-84488B2BB06B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（弱る）.png","title":"シーン 2489","telop":"そして、先ほどよりも強い反応が彼女から出ると、\n僕は、そのままそっとキスをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2490スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"43002FB2-363B-4C69-A0DF-BDCCAB7E7E1C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/頬照り寝顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2490","telop":"そして、二人とも眠りに落ちると、そっとパチュリーをベッドに乗せて、そのまま共同スペースに降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2491スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"A7246908-5454-463F-A435-931D4CA4A5A0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2491","telop":"すると、眠気が僕を襲い、そのまま僕はソファで眠りに落ちた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2492スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"640E4A0E-D7B3-49D5-B596-A26EBD8F94AC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2492","telop":"彼が目を覚ますと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2493スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"22FED7A3-75C8-406F-98D6-F8D5BF3549C5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2493","telop":"僕は、ふと目が覚めると、そこには霊夢と\n魔理沙がうずうずした状態で立っていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2494スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"90A1B3E6-90AA-43C9-8AA7-DADA07E9C8E9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2494","telop":"「あんた…どうやってあの四人を溺れさせたのよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2495スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"ADB56450-2BA3-416B-BED7-D09AA1C138E8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2495","telop":"「私も気になるのだぜ…フランの様子もいつもと違ってたし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2496スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"79517DFE-65DC-40D9-AAA8-16197C6802AD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2496","telop":"僕は、彼女たちの思考を予測し、何が言いたいのかを考える。\n「霊夢さんたちも…体感したいのですか…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2497スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B39BBB28-8B1C-4A66-9818-C16F0D923F81","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2497","telop":"「そうに…決まってるじゃない。こっちは、\nあんたのことで、あそこが渦巻いてるのよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2498スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"2519C1D9-2114-4557-B08E-C729440F7656","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2498","telop":"「私もだぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2499スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"97EFCC1B-9AB7-47ED-BF51-E2C1B8DD3107","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2499","telop":"「レミリアさんたちは…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2500スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0232574F-C7D0-47FF-B957-32C8E2748B2A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2500","telop":"「彼女たちなら、あんたのことを私たちに告げてから、\n紅魔館に戻っていったわ…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2501スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"CD1519F5-CFCF-4A78-A891-85B61CF199E4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2501","telop":"「そろそろ、アレが垂れそうだぜ…、\n早くお前のベッドに行かないか…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2502スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A0AEE78B-4CAC-41D6-9675-245C5455BB03","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2502","telop":"「そうですか…。」\n僕はそう呟くと、ソファからおり、自分の部屋に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2503スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"5BDCE56B-6F71-4C1A-922D-8230803AF876","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙水着（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 2503","telop":"そして、二人の体を交互に動かし、攻め込んでいく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2504スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"40939871-D85F-4DC4-A2F2-947330073AB6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙水着（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 2504","telop":"すると、二人のあの部分から、アレが出てくる。\nそして、あることを閃き、それを実践に移す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2505スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"34EB9427-BA86-446E-836A-8576AB75F5C4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙水着（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 2505","telop":"そして、それを実践すると、予想通り、\n彼女たちのあの箇所からアレがシュパシュパ出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2506スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"F461D92E-A677-4D5C-A155-DCD2F3FF2A4F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙水着（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 2506","telop":"僕は、もう一度同じように繰り返すと、\n二人にそっとキスをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2507スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","id":"EDA65B46-F13D-4C5B-98C1-3CB90513A95F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/気持ちの良い水着寝顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夕方・青）.jpg","title":"シーン 2507","telop":"すると、彼女たちはそのまま眠りについた。\nそして、そのまま僕は共同スペースに向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2508スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"86EB937C-91BF-4AF0-A188-6B3E87969FB3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 2508","telop":"「操夢さん、今ちょうど夕飯ができて、並べたところですよ。」\n私は、上から降りてきた彼にいう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2509スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"B104900B-BBE6-4725-A1D1-8BBBF3ADA8F1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 2509","telop":"「あっ、ありがとうございます…」\n僕はそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2510スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（笑い）.png","id":"41252882-33E3-42DB-ACB8-F663A7517EC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/咲夜（笑い）.png","title":"シーン 2510","telop":"「いえ、お礼なんていいですよ。それより食べてください。」\n私は、彼との〇〇〇〇したい欲を抑えていう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2511スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（余裕）.png","id":"2BFBAC71-260E-4532-B65C-1D6957AFA809","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（余裕）.png","title":"シーン 2511","telop":"僕は、「いただきます」といってから、ご飯を食べ始める。\nすると、彼女は僕と対角の席に座る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2512スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（余裕）.png","id":"2B4A7382-1DDF-443A-B18F-6DD1F214B0A0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（余裕）.png","title":"シーン 2512","telop":"「咲夜さん、なんでニヤついているんですか…」\n僕は彼女の思考を予測しながら、話しかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2513スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（弱る）.png","id":"4E253AE5-5670-4F3E-B4DD-CC6CDAABB335","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（弱る）.png","title":"シーン 2513","telop":"「いつの間に…ちょっと、席を外しますね…。」\n私はそう言い、椅子から立ち上がる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2514スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（弱る）.png","id":"C2094F6E-FCB7-4A08-A562-375C85B5335F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（弱る）.png","title":"シーン 2514","telop":"「後片付けなら僕がしておくので、咲夜さんは共同キッチンに戻らなくても大丈夫ですよ。」僕はそう彼女に告げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2515スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（余裕）.png","id":"01E958C5-C3AA-48DB-9D4B-8FFC3D643472","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（余裕）.png","title":"シーン 2515","telop":"「そうですか…」\n彼のその言葉に、ふと彼とさっきした〇〇〇〇が目に浮かぶ…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2516スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（余裕）.png","id":"E0DC2137-D50F-47F8-9447-3BEA92B69356","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（余裕）.png","title":"シーン 2516","telop":"「咲夜さん…さっきから様子が変ですよ…」\n僕は、彼女に視線を当てながらそういう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2517スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"51680E80-05E8-412F-8858-42D89A08ED11","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 2517","telop":"「はっ…」私は彼の指摘にふと驚きの声を上げる。そして、このままここにいるのは良くない考え、ささっと部屋に戻った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2518スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"48768710-5772-48C5-829F-1DD3297A6C0B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2518","telop":"僕は、一人共同スペースで黙々とご飯を食べ進め、\n完食すると、食器の後片付けを済ます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2519スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"879325ED-3E9B-446D-B497-AB15E43DFF19","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2519","telop":"すると、さとりとこいしが帰ってくる。\n「お帰りなさい。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2520スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"CA48327E-C46C-4541-A5A8-245DF2D4B53C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2520","telop":"「よかったです、操夢が無事で…」\n私はそういう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2521スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"A7FD144A-99FF-4C00-803C-679E3E7BBDEE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2521","telop":"「私も、安心した…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2522スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"0D1D724C-2A4A-4961-845F-F67EC727BC13","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2522","telop":"「そうですか、先に、お風呂とご飯のどっちにしますか？」\n僕は、そう聞く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2523スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"5796E682-2F2F-4979-B8F3-EF6EBD556E53","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2523","telop":"「私は、先にお風呂に入ってきますね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2524スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"9148830F-9292-4169-B914-BB3FF92369FD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2524","telop":"「私も、そうしようかな…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2525スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"5D55D9ED-7CCC-4D43-85F0-BA32E6FEF31B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2525","telop":"「僕は、その間に歯磨きでもしようかな…」\n僕はそういうと、僕たちはそれぞれの部屋に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2526スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"85A95113-DA57-4877-BACC-08B09A63E9CB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2526","telop":"さとりたちが夕飯を食べると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2527スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"8B96C5E5-9E3C-4459-9F66-AE052B5D934E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2527","telop":"僕は、二人の夕飯を作り、二人が夕飯を食べながら、会話を交わすうちに、話の流れで、さっきまでの経緯を語っていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2528スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"CD599442-1D4E-42B1-A066-9EC812AD6DBD","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2528","telop":"「霊夢たちだけずるいですよ、あなたのテクニックで溺れられるなんて…、私たちにもそれを体感させてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2529スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"68DF50FD-E5F4-405A-91AD-DC82479A9620","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2529","telop":"「私にも、させて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2530スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"DDE8840A-9EA8-4BFC-A7AA-5B74C3C48F28","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2530","telop":"「そうですか…いいですよ。それで、誰の部屋でやりますか？僕の部屋は、今霊夢さんと魔理沙さんが寝てるから使えませんが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2531スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"E13DFEFA-FF95-4251-82BA-83ED92AAAE05","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（怒る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2531","telop":"「それなら、私の部屋にしましょ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2532スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","id":"70C5705E-58A1-46B7-8946-9C6281AED4C8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","title":"シーン 2532","telop":"「分かりました…」\n僕は、そういうと、3人でさとりの部屋に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2533スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"850DBEDF-20DB-4130-A957-B185CBC7B7D8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2533","telop":"僕たちは、さとりの部屋にくると、彼女たちは僕の服を脱ぎとり、彼女たちを服を脱ぐと、僕を押し倒す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2534スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"5B1B7ACF-0D8A-44F0-8205-3492210108CA","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2534","telop":"「じゃあ、始めるからね。」\n私はそう言い、彼を攻め始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2535スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"1FE45592-CC88-432A-8D3C-BE6F62344C02","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2535","telop":"僕は、彼女の敏感なところを探り、見つけると、そこをつく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2536スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"D5A67B3E-268A-4C44-AD33-5DCC5475E6E2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2536","telop":"私は、彼が私の急所を急に突き、\n驚くと同時に、アレが出てくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2537スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"55160501-026E-4F0B-AA23-EC1FB62A7A7E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2537","telop":"「まだ続けるよ。」\n私は、何かに火がついたように彼を攻め続ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2538スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"975492E2-72FC-4FFF-BF99-4CADFC759908","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2538","telop":"だが、同じ結果を辿るだけになってしまい、\n思わず、「うぅー。」と嘆いてしまう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2539スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"7792BF66-9831-4ED5-9424-0DBA906BE746","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2539","telop":"私は、困っているこいしに交代することを提案し、彼女がそれを飲むと、彼にまたがり、動き始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2540スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"3D749E3B-7186-410D-A88A-DE00BAB99D65","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2540","telop":"僕は、彼女の要所を探り寄せ、\n見つけると、そこに僕の棒を当てこむ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2541スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"5FD30716-0E1B-4480-91CE-62FD9BC9EF2D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2541","telop":"私は、彼に敏感なところをいきなり、突かれ、驚く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2542スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"3C7F7AF7-DF9C-4E01-87BA-34C4F9AD5AE0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2542","telop":"「まだまだですよ…」\n私は、彼のテクニックに火がつき、素早く攻め込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2543スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"856A5895-227A-4133-89F4-7C2FA4719251","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2543","telop":"僕は、彼女の速度が変化したのを見て、その隙を狙って、\nピンポイントでズバッと棒を当てこむ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2544スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"D8C22760-3B58-4EDB-AC4F-A405F942AE7E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2544","telop":"「あっ…」\n私は、こいしとともに彼の棒との戦いに敗れ、落胆する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2545スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","id":"811E9041-8C9F-47B5-892F-EFA573853B53","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/寝室の窓際のベッド（夜・ランプ・赤）.jpg","title":"シーン 2545","telop":"僕は、そっと彼女の口にキスをすると、ベッドの端に彼女の体を寄せ、ベッドから降りてこいしを見る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2546スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"70907703-BBFD-46F0-8837-7B028132D3C7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2546","telop":"するとこいしは、何か物欲しそうな、諦めているような表情をしていた。僕は、そのまま彼女に近づきそっとキスをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2547スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"27B3B2C4-FB61-4EFF-A43A-93CEF3290726","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2547","telop":"「つい、この間の〇〇〇〇から、数日くらいしか経ってないの一気に上達したんだね…」私は、ぼさっとそう告げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2548スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"FACA7108-8354-4F20-81BF-658FBA7C6B40","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2548","telop":"僕は彼女の言葉に笑みを返すと、彼女に尋ねる。\n「こいしさんも寝ますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2549スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"E1C3BBCB-E9CF-49C8-9C2D-5450E89B30B1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2549","telop":"「なんだか疲れちゃったし、私もお姉ちゃんの隣で寝ることにする。」私はそういうと、ベッドに乗る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2550スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"A3811F77-8AD4-44AA-A31E-4927D614E49D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/気持ちの良い寝顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301379_一人部屋２（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2550","telop":"僕が、もう一度そのベッドを見ると、さとりとこいしの寝顔があった。そして、僕は共同スペースに向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2551スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"8667CA93-31E5-4ED1-947E-253BBED12631","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2551","telop":"僕が共同スペースに降りてくると、霊夢たちがいた。\n「二人とも、目が覚めたんですね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2552スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C1178980-4C5D-48E5-A880-B4A6743DA88C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2552","telop":"「あんたのお風呂借りて、スッキリしてきたわ。」\n私は、彼ともう一度〇〇〇〇したい気持ちを抑えながらいう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2553スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B00A2861-C1C2-459B-AA13-ECB8131F3400","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2553","telop":"「それで、操夢は何してたんだ？」\n私は、彼に犯されたい気持ちを堪えながらいう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2554スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"759897A2-CE36-4969-9E3B-AB60FB78E6F8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2554","telop":"「そうですか…、それで、夕飯は食べましたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2555スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"EB1CA69A-21AC-44F7-A5F8-AD46360E4D6E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2555","telop":"「いや、まだ食べてないわ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2556スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"4ED032C4-B4DD-481F-9964-8E69405B389A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2556","telop":"「私もまだ食べないぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2557スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F1EF9B41-9792-4E9F-823C-820DCBADF9AC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2557","telop":"「そうですか…じゃあ、僕が作りますね。」\n僕はそういうと、共同キッチンに入り、冷蔵庫を開ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2558スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"386A793B-B497-41E3-9D8E-220EED83E75F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2558","telop":"そして、二人の視線を感じながら、思考を働かせて夕飯を作る。\nそして、数十分程度で完成すると、パックご飯とともに出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2559スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"251658C8-87B7-4864-9655-8C3F94CB333F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2559","telop":"「できましたよ…。二人ともどうしたんですか？」\n僕は、二人の思考の分析と予測をしながらいう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2560スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"2D05FBF5-9E42-49EE-9172-EED045C3B7CF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2560","telop":"「いや、何でもないわ。それじゃ、いただきます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2561スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"85749732-5B06-4C59-BFF8-2CBFDFB7A916","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2561","telop":"「いただきますなのだぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2562スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D58B25A8-F5A2-4E89-B3E2-0F16B8A50161","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2562","telop":"僕は、食事をする二人を見ながら、今日を振り返る。レミリアたちにお仕置きを受けてから、彼女たちの様子が変化した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2563スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C997AF77-6883-4E8D-85A6-A58959DB2016","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2563","telop":"僕は、なぜこのような変化が起きたのかを解析する。僕の行動は、次々とこの家に住む女性たちと〇〇〇〇するだけだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2564スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B8122421-D413-435F-A10C-DFA92C91A971","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2564","telop":"ただ、一つ異なる点はといえば、コストとタイムを抑え、自滅するのを防ぎながら、節約〇〇〇〇したくらいだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2565スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"AC9A7C10-0C65-4895-A5D5-E1A88A140621","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2565","telop":"だけども、その過程のどこかに彼女たちが変化する要因があったのだと考える。そして、その要因は僕の行動にある…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2566スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"66E20059-5A41-4EFE-8E23-89AFDF160DD5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2566","telop":"だが、僕は頭をフル回転して解析しても、特に明確な答えは見つからなかった。ふと二人を見ると、食器が空なのに気づく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2567スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"EEB32D12-C802-46A8-8143-C4464F3FC743","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2567","telop":"「ご飯、食べ終わったんですね。」僕はそういうと、二人が空にした食器を共同キッチンに運び、後片付けをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2568スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A31D0920-5CD6-4AF4-ABC2-8D416DDA5C36","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2568","telop":"そして、後片付けが終わると、ふと向こうにポケベルを忘れていったことを思い出し、霊夢たちにその在処を尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2569スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C91E8FBD-6AE9-42B0-B0C1-C83430DB79D0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2569","telop":"「あんたのポケベルのことすっかり忘れていたわ。」\n私は、そう言い、彼のポケベルを探す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2570スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B44C1E80-AB95-4C58-A61B-D85C4295212D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2570","telop":"そして、スーツケースから彼のポケベルを取り出すと彼に渡す。\n「ポケベルを無くさないように気をつけてよね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2571スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C573FCF8-24BB-4E21-9E54-179A858894D9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2571","telop":"「そうですね…、しっかりと自分で管理して無くさないようにします。」僕はそう言いながら、ポケベルをポッケに入れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2572スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F592B3D2-C4CA-4F21-B6B1-407FD7AFF1CE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2572","telop":"「それで、霊夢さんたちは、これからどうしますか？」\n僕はそう尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2573スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7E5113B0-146B-4B77-A54E-42556CABF9B9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2573","telop":"「少しばかし、夜の風でも浴びてこようかしら…」\n私は彼にそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2574スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B0DACEF6-7306-453B-97AF-D029F9693540","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2574","telop":"「それなら、風邪をひかないように気をつけてくださいね。\nこっちは向こうの気温とは異なりますから。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2575スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"408BD060-98E0-46EC-9A80-79F18C7C67A1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2575","telop":"「わかったわ。ほら、魔理沙も一緒にいきましょ。」\n私はそう言い、魔理沙を誘う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2576スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"634D0E67-7624-4483-B6BE-F6E89742C820","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2576","telop":"「わかったのだぜ。」\n私はそう返すと、霊夢と一緒に外に出た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2577スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"2A9E7D83-FB67-47ED-9E08-B29DE5C321DB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2577","telop":"僕はそれから、自分の部屋に戻り、入浴を済ますと、ベッドから異臭を感じ、さっと掛け布団を外すと浴室に運ぶ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2578スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F4941A55-335E-4797-9F55-4AE54C8BD292","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2578","telop":"そして、入浴が終わる際に抜いた浴槽の栓を再びつけて、蛇口をひねて水を出し、洗剤と掛け布団を浴槽に入れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2579スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"223B1119-0D1C-4EE7-9975-E57B540E551C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2579","telop":"そのまま、枕とマットレスも入れ込むと、僕は、頭の中で時間を計算してから、乾燥と自動栓抜きのタイマーをセットし、部屋に戻る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2580スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"64E5620A-A165-4B16-916C-4F5B57ED9B67","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2580","telop":"そして、霊夢から渡された自分のポケベルと、\n自分の子機につなぎ、画面をのぞく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2581スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"35B42A21-37D1-4C47-96F2-A804D7201406","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2581","telop":"電源復旧モード\nこのPCは、何らかの原因により、電源が破損しています。\nお使いの接続機器で電源を修復する場合はエンターを押します。\n僕は、画面の指示に従い、エンターキー押す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2582スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"939CB915-0E98-4FCC-9A8C-553DFAFB0F6D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2582","telop":"自動電源修復を実行中…\n自動電源修復処理中は、接続機器を外さないでください。\n処理中に外すと二度と電源がつかなくなる可能性があります。\nすると、画面が切り替わりくるくる回る円が表示される。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2583スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"806F5A6A-8AEB-4106-9CE3-86FA8B7A8935","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2583","telop":"メンテナンスモードで起動中…\n自動電源修復に成功しました。メンテナンスモードを起動しています…\n電源は落とさないでください。\nすると、再度画面が切り替わり、くるくる回る円が表示される。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2584スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C7ABD9A2-95E0-479A-9876-CF29E853E2B6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2584","telop":"すると、灰色の画面に白いポップアップが出てくる。\nメンテナンスモード\n自動修復を実行中…\n破損データがないか確認中です…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2585スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"05A95FB9-FBD3-4815-9BF1-7C5EC7259A38","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2585","telop":"すると、「電源処理の異常を確認中です…」と表示される。\nメンテナンスモード\n自動修復を実行中…\n電源処理の異常を確認中です…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2586スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C2B6E618-2288-4781-9FBF-2D30059685B9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2586","telop":"すると、「電源処理の異常を修復中です…」と表示される。\nメンテナンスモード\n自動修復を実行中…\n電源処理の異常を修復中です…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2587スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C1A381DC-E2C6-454D-BE60-E10C7F2FEC72","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2587","telop":"僕は、Bキーを押す。\nメンテナンスモード\n自動修復を実行中…\n電源処理の修復は成功しました。\n以下の選択肢から\n選んでキーを押してください。\n他にも破損しているプログラムがないか確認する\nポケベルアプリをメンテナンスモードで開く\n再起動をする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2588スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BDFE0FBD-BD3B-4E4B-93D5-9FBFE2FB4208","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2588","telop":"僕は、次にAキーを押す。\nポケベルアプリ\nポケベルアプリ\n次のアクションを以下から選び、\n該当するキーを押します。\nインターネットに接続し、自動修復を続行する\nローカル環境での\n手動修復を続行する\n何もせずにアプリを閉じる","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2589スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D9B12FE5-094C-4015-BF9A-B7971344D16F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2589","telop":"すると、あの音がポケベルから流れ出す。\nポケベルアプリ\nポケベルアプリ\nインターネットに接続中です…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2590スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3C7168FB-D4ED-46A9-86AF-56670C1EF220","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2590","telop":"僕は、選択肢が出てくると、Aキーを押す。\nポケベルアプリ\nポケベルアプリ\n親機が見つかりました。\n次のアクションを以下から選び、\n該当するキーを押します。\n親機のプログラムを複製し、この子機に入れる\nインターネット上から修復処理を実行する\nローカル環境での\n修復を実行する","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2591スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EA0A4E6C-72CE-4746-BE96-05F31DA3C068","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2591","telop":"すると、親機からのプログラム複製と流し込みが始まる。\nポケベルアプリ\nポケベルアプリ\n親機からプログラムを複製し、このコンピューターに流し込んでます…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2592スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AC8E4511-191D-463A-BE51-A93188693FC3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2592","telop":"そして、プログラムの照らし合わせが始まる。\nポケベルアプリ\nポケベルアプリ\nインストールが完了しました。このコンピューター上のプログラムと親機のプログラムを照合しています…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2593スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9FCC39D0-2BED-4BE2-9B2C-22618E830945","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2593","telop":"最後に再起動処理が始まる。\nポケベルアプリ\nポケベルアプリ\n修復が完了しました…。\nこのコンピューターを再起動中です。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2594スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"回転","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1BC8BC2C-003C-4E4D-8956-9D39C620C275","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2594","telop":"すると、起動音が鳴り、くるくる回る円とリンゴマークが出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2595スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"72997C73-33CF-48B7-A689-A86FBE039998","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2595","telop":"再起動が終わると、デスクトップが出てきた。\nそして、僕はそこからネットサーフィンを始めた。\nFiles\nポケベル\nポケベル\nFiles\n編集\n表示\n移動\nウィンドウ\nヘルプ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2596スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"68289C0A-A0B1-4EEC-8067-924F4C844694","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2596","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2597スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夜・照明ON）.jpg","id":"937F0757-0FA1-4701-992E-C1F81A5617F1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（夜・照明ON）.jpg","title":"シーン 2597","telop":"僕は、ネットサーフィンを区切りよく終えるとちょうど、浴槽に入れていた布団などが乾ききり、ベッドに乗せて、眠りにつく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2598スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"6A93E0B2-F363-4F8C-BC4C-9259D19CC158","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2598","telop":"そして、目が覚めると、\nベッドから起き上がり共同スペースに向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2599スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"5290771D-DC15-42A4-A5FE-A1B40F91EB16","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2599","telop":"僕が、共同スペースに来ると、ちょうど朝ごはんが食卓に並べられていて、それを食べ始めると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"E270B24F-B169-41C7-B847-F1381EA6BDAF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2601スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E8D4FC30-3AF3-4483-B2DD-B95B6F3F6694","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2601","telop":"僕は、困っている二人に、ある提案をする。「それじゃあ、みんなで一つずつ馬券買って、どれが当たる賭けませんか？」\n迷シーン　その１","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2602スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"58212E0D-B0CA-43C7-A12A-9B916EAB489C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2602","telop":"「でも、私たち…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2603スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7B8AB3A8-BDF5-458F-B9BF-C730BECB6CDA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2603","telop":"「お金なら、ありますよ。もし、警察に何か言い寄られたら、僕が二人の保護者だと言い切るので、安心してください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2604スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"094BB23D-A92F-402A-93CD-51288AD2D097","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2604","telop":"僕はそういうと、先ほどATMで引き出してきた、栄一が乗ったお札を1枚ずつ、二人に手渡す。「ルールは分かりますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2605スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"88FAE3E1-94AB-41B1-9444-A97F277B2637","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2605","telop":"「知らないから、教えて。」\n私は、彼にそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2606スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1291F65B-578C-4DDB-8AE8-81FCEFA8E190","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2606","telop":"「私もわからない…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2607スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9E2EC187-1233-4461-BAEF-BB45CE6E056A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2607","telop":"僕は、二人が競馬のルールを知らないとわかると、簡潔にその場で説明し、実際のレースでそれぞれ馬券を購入した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2608スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"07F59B84-3438-46F9-B31D-51BB816F1803","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2608","telop":"「あんた、なんで私が働いている神社に来たのよ？」\n迷シーン　その２","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2609スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"1F660F4F-7A39-44C5-91C7-06FCC333C2F6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2609","telop":"「それより、今日のビックレースで、\n儲かったお金の余りはどこにありますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2610スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"33B39E9D-3CC7-4887-A608-141C56EEC25A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2610","telop":"「えっと…」\n私が、そのまま言い淀んでいると、後ろから彼女が来る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2611スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"東風谷早苗","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"95FDF6C3-70E3-4419-ABDA-D8E9BE31EA3F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2611","telop":"「あれ、どうしたんですか？」\n私は、その場の空気に関係なく、霊夢に聞く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2612スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7BB99B31-45F6-45D7-AB35-CC9889B7CECD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2612","telop":"「そういうことですか…霊夢さん…」僕は、黄緑色の髪をした彼女が奇跡を起こすことで有名な巫女さんがいることで納得する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2613スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"73BD5D90-CFC0-48BC-B16F-8E45C56CEB4B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2613","telop":"そして、近くで潜んでいたある人に視線を送る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2614スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"03608DFA-4D94-45B0-8595-22EE73AFF829","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2614","telop":"「まさか、神社の巫女さんであろうお方が、ギャンブルで荒稼ぎしているとは…、これは特大級のスクープですよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2615スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"1E727B49-56D7-4118-8E39-DF9EC2BC8290","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2615","telop":"僕は、その3人の絵面を一目で確認すると、「あとは、お任せします。」と一言残し、その場をさるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2616スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B46B11A4-2DC6-4B24-A16B-3AE848A656FF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2616","telop":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi ※前回の予告と一部内容が異なります。\n交換夫婦\n8人の女性と1人の男〜操夢は朝食を取ると、フランとこいしでお出かけして…〜","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2617スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"F69D57DC-5531-43C0-81B2-235FB6C0659E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2617","telop":"「んっ。」僕はふと目が覚めると、そこは、自分の部屋だった。\nそして、共同スペースに向かって降りていく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2618スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"20332B9D-2CD8-4012-A0D8-57A2078D6A63","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2618","telop":"僕が共同スペースに降りてくると、\nちょうど朝ごはんが食卓に並んでいた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2619スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"2A2225F4-BD24-49F3-A006-74FCFE23A5EE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 2619","telop":"「ちょうど今から朝ごはんですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2620スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"022525FE-CF7B-406D-9C92-5255789D9D2E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 2620","telop":"僕は食卓に座り、皆で挨拶を済ませてから、朝食を食べ始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2621スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（微笑）.png","id":"73CA174F-C787-4D11-BC3E-80BE126A2B7D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","title":"シーン 2621","telop":"それから、15分程度で食べ終わると、自分の食器を下げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2622スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"B3AE6FAB-18C0-4008-B9AF-60C0177804A5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2622","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢、私たちと一緒にお出かけしようよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2623スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"DCDC5ED8-AC9A-4AEC-B7F2-E48AA94BD733","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2623","telop":"「お出かけするのは、いいですけど、どこに向かいますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2624スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"0CD59188-689D-4246-B549-B37B39242CFC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2624","telop":"「それは、言ってからのお楽しみ、それでどうする？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2625スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"5EBC0299-3AF9-41C1-AF38-46322EC59568","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2625","telop":"「そうですね…」僕はそう言いながら、一瞬今日の予定を考える。だが、特段予定はなく、「そうしましょう。」と返した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2626スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4C9921CD-13B2-4524-81A5-279C9BED5182","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2626","telop":"それから3人は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2627スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9B1C6AB6-D412-41F3-8106-A6C8F3570589","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2627","telop":"それから僕は、2人に連れられて、東京湾を目前に眺める\nとある企業の工場に直結した駅に来た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2628スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CE771467-24E8-4590-A705-4BBEEC4635F7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2628","telop":"「なぜ、こんなところに…僕を連れてこうって考えたのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2629スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"92CB17C5-6C54-4C2E-AA5C-6CE8ADF3CCB3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2629","telop":"「これから、かくれんぼ、するの。今まで乗ってきた列車が止まった駅のどこかで隠れるから、見つけてね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2630スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1263E623-07F9-4820-B0CC-A0CFDE721D08","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2630","telop":"すると、彼女はさっきまで乗ってた列車に乗って、\nそのまま駅から去っていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2631スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6E553791-6D51-433F-A171-CF34FB2DD695","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2631","telop":"すると、ポケベルから音が鳴る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2632スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"E5E3C8AD-4B83-4A2E-B524-4E8EBA5DB428","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2632","telop":"どうやら、移動中に留守番電話が入ったみたいだった。\n僕は、オレンジのボタンを押し、耳に傾ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2633スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"24D914CA-B946-4657-8C63-A8C8A5F7A607","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2633","telop":"「操夢、聞こえる？私とフランは、フランの言った通り、どこかの駅に隠れているから、日暮れまでに見つけてね！」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2634スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A88BA9FA-AC96-4C8B-9459-5108875BB3F0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2634","telop":"「もし、二人とも見つけられたら、操夢が今いる駅で、一緒に夜景を見ようね。じゃあ、私とフランを探してね！」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2635スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5F37F44F-84CF-4D21-B7E3-158DC7AD4F9F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2635","telop":"そこで、通話は終了し、僕は再び、ポケベルを見て、日付と時刻を確認する。「日暮れまで…8時間ちょっとか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2636スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D36B656A-85EB-4FA2-9DF6-D2DB991C42CC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2636","telop":"僕は、ポケベルをポケットにしまう。\nすると、到着放送が流れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2637スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"959E5999-BE98-4C43-B2F0-231CB44E2EC5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2637","telop":"「まもなく、南首都圏線、区間快速、立川行きが参ります。危ないですから、黄色い線から離れてお待ちください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2638スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1728233A-52F2-4230-B605-13749520665E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2638","telop":"僕は、ホームに列車が止まり、ドアが開くと、それに乗り込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2639スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"5811D416-0565-403A-86CA-C2D642D3487C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2639","telop":"すると、列車は、数分程度でドアが閉まり、動き出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2640スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"ED0470D4-F20F-45D5-A435-920E0211CF81","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2640","telop":"「この列車は、南首都圏線、区間快速、立川行きです。尻手までは各駅に止まります。次は、新芝浦です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2641スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"ABCF644A-F921-4F05-AD16-392CBF7A1145","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2641","telop":"僕は、とりあえず、一駅ずつ探すことに決め、\nそのまま列車に揺れるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2642スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9F35C8E7-363E-4C52-85A2-6E17363FF079","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2642","telop":"時が進み…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2643スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"D01CD830-FCD6-4370-9912-A736C2FBB006","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2643","telop":"それから僕は、浅野で特別快速に乗り換える。\n残りの駅は、９駅だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2644スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"D8A833C6-9F44-419B-88DA-EC16371420B2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2644","telop":"「この列車は、特別快速、西浦和行きです。停車駅は、鶴見、府中本町、西国分寺、新秋津、北朝霞、西浦和です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2645スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"AEF2DFE0-6F0D-4619-976D-7849870B4217","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2645","telop":"「次は、鶴見です。東京本線、山手南ライン、山手東南ラインはお乗り換えです。鶴見の次は、府中本町に止まります。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2646スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"77453D50-19C6-4C8B-8377-8979FE2F3F63","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2646","telop":"僕は、そこで、ぼそっと思い出す。リニア新幹線網によって、従来の新幹線が全廃止になり、国鉄の在来線は大幅強化されたのだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2647スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"90D2160E-A0D9-4D22-B53A-C1C1E235B4D5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2647","telop":"確か、これは三セクの広まりや西九州騒動の結果、在来線強化を求める国民の声が高まり、リニアも広まったからだとか。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2648スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"95BAF862-C226-46F8-8853-38CBC64F139E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2648","telop":"あと、理由を挙げるなら、インフレによる運賃の高騰に国民の不満がピークになり、大騒動を巻き起こしたからだとか。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2649スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"4F926363-444C-4D25-AAEC-EAEDE372D618","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2649","telop":"その結果として、在来線の優等種別や急行が全国で次々に復活し、その利便性は国民に広まり、定着することができた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2650スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"A86FFB87-B64B-43ED-BBED-FCD69470BC0A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2650","telop":"そして、昭和のときに、バラバラになった国鉄は、再復活を成し遂げ、おかげで利益は年々上昇、借金もゼロだとか。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2651スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"55A241A6-E3F7-48AE-903B-3852076C4553","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2651","telop":"「まもなく、鶴見、鶴見、お出口は左側です。\n鶴見から先は東京環状本線に直通し、西浦和へと参ります。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2652スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"06E8DC40-6F20-4F6A-AE8E-7E90DDD2DEC0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2652","telop":"そんなことを考えていると、列車の速度がだんだんと減速し、\n僕は、降りる準備をする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2653スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"F6777C2B-CDBA-4B5B-85F1-F8144FD44303","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2653","telop":"そして、ボソッと考える、今や東アジアの地域なら、パスポートとビザなしで国内扱い、そしてリニアでの移動もできるのかと。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2654スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"BDB9DDF8-3A82-40E6-BC1C-57A2AED7F8EB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2654","telop":"僕は、列車が駅に着くと、そのまま改札口の方角に向かう。\nそして、隠れているフランとこいしの二人を再び探し始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2655スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FD94E706-1D9F-4005-B6D0-0ECCC69DF661","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2655","telop":"それから彼が、再び列車に戻り…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2656スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"8551DA2B-32B4-4F01-AAD4-A1F0299E6778","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2656","telop":"僕は、鶴見で二人の姿を探したが、結局見つからず、ホームに止まっていた、臨時の各駅停車の列車に乗り込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2657スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"D4AF8E59-555A-44EC-9F1A-9057B139F8D1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2657","telop":"「この列車は、各駅停車、西浦和駅行きです。\n次は、府中本町、府中本町です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2658スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"3F775BF5-D35E-4A4D-9DCE-8A7FF16D2A02","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2658","telop":"「お客様にお知らせします。本日、二大競馬場での特大レースの同時開催に伴う想定外の盛況で、遅延が発生しております。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2659スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"FD0EF99A-1256-478F-9D75-9D4C70585EFE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2659","telop":"「そのため、東京環状鉄道および東京鉄道全線においてダイヤの乱れが発生しております。あらかじめご了承ください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2660スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"588FE6CB-C6D0-4761-ACBB-374CBEFD1C06","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2660","telop":"「また、この影響により、この列車の運転が途中駅で急遽運転取りやめの可能性もございます。ご承知おきください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2661スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"58B3317C-5253-436D-A088-05F6082F63C0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2661","telop":"「次は、府中本町です。府中本町では、この列車の車内が非常に混み合う予測です。貴重品は必ずお手元でお持ちください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2662スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"BA31E835-BE5C-4DD3-8C90-0509EB6DDD0E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2662","telop":"僕は、ふと、今日が東京競馬場と中山競馬場での、競馬記念日レースが実施される日だということを思い出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2663スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"93DFF2D9-78B2-4325-BF59-1411D5ADC583","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2663","telop":"これは、以前の巨漢党政権が立てた新制度で、経済の好循環による、好景気の誘発作戦として、掲げた政策だ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2664スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"5BBBF8F5-09C5-4F67-A10D-5B497A6BBC5E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2664","telop":"その影響からか、それまではアラフォー以上のおっさんたちの遊びとかしていた競馬が全世代に広まっていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2665スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"0910729F-C9C2-4DA3-A921-73DAEC1437E8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2665","telop":"一時期には、国が率先して国民に賭け事を推奨するのはいかがなものかという批判的意見も目立っていた政策だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2666スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"D50BDFD1-711D-4A42-A6A7-5753426E85BC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2666","telop":"また、両親が付き添えば、子どもでも競馬ができるように法改正も行われ、こちらも批判が殺到していた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2667スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"EA4A08E7-6946-42B3-A05E-C40E5F969231","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2667","telop":"だが、そんな馬鹿げた政策により、景気はゆっくりと良くなり、経済も回り、だんだんと批判は少なくなっていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2668スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"CE6580DE-9178-4750-807D-2C00F559917A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2668","telop":"今の政権は確か、その政策に黙ったままで継続中だとか。また、同じ頃にできた包括的婚約も消えることはなく、継続中である。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2669スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"41D16F98-A66F-4AF7-86E6-A10CDB13CF5B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2669","telop":"だが、僕は、それより、こいしとフランが競馬場の人混みに紛れ込んでないようにと頭の中で願った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2670スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"2FDEDAC3-0EAA-4916-BDDC-2F4D833CA7B6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2670","telop":"「まもなく、府中本町、府中本町です。\n府中本町の次は、北府中となります。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2671スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"CBDF5049-70B0-4973-B8FD-6339A40FBF3E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2671","telop":"僕は、その放送を聞くと、人混みに備えた準備を始め、\n列車が着くと同時に、そそくさと競馬場の方に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2672スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8956E64B-2EFA-4BB2-BE1B-9EF383DBDE51","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2672","telop":"すると、人混みの中に見事、二人の姿を発見することができた。\n「それで、これからどうしますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2673スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"027C0C67-A24B-4DC3-9BB4-BBABB68B5088","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2673","telop":"「これからどうする、フラン？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2674スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F1F2A7D3-831B-4D95-A434-DA8B2B4F1621","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2674","telop":"「どうしよう、何も考えてないや…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2675スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BD817829-2C74-4D9E-B11B-13657FBD3D4C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2675","telop":"僕は、困っている二人に、ある提案をする。「それじゃあ、みんなで一つずつ馬券買って、どれが当たる賭けませんか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2676スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E2BBD49D-BD74-4DC7-B154-D80242FC2DF4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2676","telop":"「でも、私たち…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2677スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"07A05407-CCF7-4651-8638-2F5586D306CD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2677","telop":"「お金なら、ありますよ。もし、警察に何か言い寄られたら、僕が二人の保護者だと言い切るので、安心してください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2678スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"94EAFC58-00B3-469F-81A0-6EBC312C00B8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2678","telop":"僕はそういうと、先ほどATMで引き出してきた、栄一が乗ったお札を1枚ずつ、二人に手渡す。「ルールは分かりますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2679スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5AD0ECB2-F621-464B-9CBA-242A2E60BD90","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2679","telop":"「知らないから、教えて。」\n私は、彼にそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2680スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"18ABB069-2D41-499B-9297-DFBDFB8568D9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2680","telop":"「私もわからない…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2681スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BA9A7D49-0363-407F-9801-627951FC9474","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2681","telop":"僕は、二人が競馬のルールを知らないとわかると、簡潔にその場で説明し、実際のレースでそれぞれ馬券を購入した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2682スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"83E3B8A7-1E59-4D44-9F47-9AA6F36351EB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2682","telop":"結果を見た3人は家に帰り…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2683スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"F0D1C673-8F30-420C-93B3-21C18B0366BB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2683","telop":"僕たちが家に帰ると、僕が手にしている札束入り封筒を見て、\nレミリアが驚いた様子で、声を上げる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2684スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"86340298-6618-4402-B6A8-420E35FF448D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2684","telop":"「ねぇ、その札束、どうやって手に入れたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2685スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"071D9C7C-A7D2-43EA-8D8B-E26ECBEAA4F2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2685","telop":"「僕の名義の口座に入っていた、謎のお金を元本にして、今日の競馬のビックレースに賭けて、稼いだお金ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2686スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"A448A9AE-9B22-4791-AA1B-2C9957FCA78D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2686","telop":"「そう、それで、なんで現金で持ってきたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2687スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"5E6BC952-54CD-4FD3-BE70-94504A89DA62","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2687","telop":"「その元本が入るまでの口座の入出金が怪しくて、口座にお金を入れるのはリスキーだと判断したんですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2688スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"30BAEF51-000C-4CF8-9889-C2AE297BE7B1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2688","telop":"「入出金が怪しいって、何があったの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2689スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"E727520F-6940-4564-93DC-E16781DF1E6A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（弱る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2689","telop":"「この家の住人に、\nきっとその入出金履歴を残した人がいますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2690スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"08DFD0A5-DB65-43A6-8DFB-5915CBAC5E1A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2690","telop":"「えっ？あなたの口座に秘密裏にアクセスして\n口座の残高を動かせる人がいるっていうの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2691スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"DFCE7A92-84B2-428E-8410-E4C69A85E1BE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/レミリア（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2691","telop":"「そうですね、しかもその犯人は、今勤務中ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2692スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"74D03D51-0625-4C1C-A54D-4A7BF9DB58B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2692","telop":"「っていうことは、魔理沙か霊夢かのどちらか…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2693スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"ACB7B544-CD9F-41E2-B1B9-7E1F3944F3F3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2693","telop":"「それじゃ、この札束は、レミリアさんに一時的に預けるので、\n僕は、その犯人の特定するために出かけますね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2694スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"45F5CC65-C1C2-4916-A69C-80721F344321","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2694","telop":"僕はそういうと、家の最寄り駅に来る。\nすると、ちょうど良く、列車が入線し、それに乗り込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2695スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E9325D40-3E11-45DB-91F6-A27C8BE217F8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2695","telop":"僕はそこから大宮へ移動し、ある神社の方に、歩みを進める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2696スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"63C8CBE9-B715-4DA5-B9B0-C283BB297DBF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2696","telop":"そして、神社に着くと、そこにいる人に話しかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2697スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B3435B83-069A-483B-B049-F4EBA062F5CA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2697","telop":"「あんた、なんで私が働いている神社に来たのよ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2698スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"17B1674B-65E0-4C2F-8C89-FF2FC733B44C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2698","telop":"「それより、今日のビックレースで、\n儲かったお金の余りはどこにありますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2699スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B5A65CA1-CCEC-4482-8622-DEBD8815518D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2699","telop":"「えっと…」\n私が、そのまま言い淀んでいると、後ろから彼女が来る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2700スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"東風谷早苗","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CEBB0ECA-3E98-4324-8F05-3E035D1F8C93","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2700","telop":"「あれ、どうしたんですか？」\n私は、その場の空気に関係なく、霊夢に聞く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2701スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D5CC45DE-4CDC-4689-B913-3D91D8193E70","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2701","telop":"「そういうことですか…霊夢さん…」僕は、黄緑色の髪をした彼女が奇跡を起こすことで有名な巫女さんがいることで納得する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2702スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"FDD6A39A-E1D1-41E4-8E76-AFDCC420A0CC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2702","telop":"そして、近くで潜んでいたある人に視線を送る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2703スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3617E739-96F1-411E-A9E3-3CDDED1BD492","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2703","telop":"「まさか、神社の巫女さんであろうお方が、ギャンブルで荒稼ぎしているとは…、これは特大級のスクープですよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2704スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3B64D898-4BBC-4844-A69B-18D3AC4C2AFC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2704","telop":"僕は、その3人の絵面を一目で確認すると、「あとは、お任せします。」と一言残し、その場をさるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2705スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F05F267F-407E-480D-A7D9-2764748CE6AC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2705","telop":"それから、紫は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2706スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"B472E433-BFEF-4A01-970A-46508DF7A7DE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2706","telop":"「紫様、先ほど、橙が、このようなものを見たようで…」\n私はそう言い、号外の新聞を渡す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2707スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"83A5E21A-AAD7-46EF-953F-CEC036994535","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2707","telop":"私は、藍から渡された、新聞を読む。そこには、二人の巫女の写真と「神社の巫女が競馬で荒稼ぎ…」と見出しが載っていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2708スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"8285CD08-564A-421D-A481-13EBFDF27679","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2708","telop":"「私が確かめたところ、諏訪子たちはこの事実を真っ向から否定していて、霊夢だけがおいてかれ、批判されています。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2709スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"7A2864E5-E9AE-4821-8218-7A02D94FD952","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2709","telop":"「どうしましょうか、公式声明で、安全のために、\n霊夢と私たちのつながりを全否定しておきますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2710スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"74CD0A9B-426A-48A2-A0F9-F44D7A15A0E4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2710","telop":"私は、頭を働かせて考える。不祥事に発展させないためには、霊夢との関係を否定するのがいいが、それだと霊夢が孤立する…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2711スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"926D7F6C-2A79-455E-83DB-69ECC4DFA28C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2711","telop":"「どうしますか、霊夢を犠牲にするのか、私たちが犠牲になるのか、どちらがより適切だと思いますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2712スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"98466A4E-E4AA-4BF8-AAD0-132F8A4FB394","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2712","telop":"私はそこで、その新聞を再度よく読む。\nすると、ふとそこにある記載が小さく載っていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2713スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"5545C4DF-FC89-41B8-A49C-DABA640C194A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2713","telop":"「藍…もし…私が、彼を…闇に葬るのだとしたら、\n賛成するかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2714スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"B87FC911-6CF8-4A13-A085-3CEE8D8C1811","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2714","telop":"「闇に葬るとは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2715スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"FA745BF1-FC11-490C-AEF2-3E00582C0A08","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2715","telop":"「にとりが言ってた、MNDを公式声明で発表して、人ならざる者の嘘の証言による誤スクープだった…ということにするのよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2716スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"D201C471-10B2-4395-87F0-A96B2DA83EC5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2716","telop":"「それだと、霊夢たちと彼との仲を強制的に切って、彼を蚊帳の外に投げ出すことになる…と返って良くないのでは？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2717スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"ED709811-381B-4F78-8C42-3EA0908F0695","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2717","telop":"「さらに言えば、彼はあの円球を元に成り立って、私たちもそれを頼っているので、味方を裏切る行為になりますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2718スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"EB3C25BB-91F9-4156-9CD5-47726DCF39B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2718","telop":"「そうね…たしかに、人工知能人間相手に、戦いを挑むことになるわね…、でも霊夢や私たちの立ち位置を失いたくはないし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2719スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"48B3FC62-07A1-4FC3-87FA-876A205F659C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2719","telop":"「決断を先延ばしにするのは、非現実的ですから、今すぐに判断をくだしたほうがいいですよ、紫様。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2720スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"42A98864-12D9-4B07-9984-84FCE56D7D25","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2720","telop":"私はそこで、意を決し、その言葉を放つ。\n「じゃあ、人工知能相手に宣戦布告してきてちょうだい。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2721スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"3C8AF0E2-F537-4B9D-9CFB-2D9A6447034B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2721","telop":"「それでよろしいのですね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2722スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"C2E1A43A-C0B7-4486-B1B7-1750D5D51761","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2722","telop":"「ええ、早速、橙に記者会見するように言ってちょうだい。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2723スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲藍","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲藍","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"D3209F80-9387-4BDD-9605-73F5B68B926F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2723","telop":"「承知しました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2724スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"A09E241A-DDC5-437D-8D84-37396DA2C9C1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2724","telop":"私はそういうと、「ふぅ」と一息をつく。だが、この時の私は、彼らが、かつての吸血鬼異変のように攻め込むのだと考えた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2725スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","id":"F0E4BBA7-12F4-4BC5-9B35-461C9852A0B4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg","title":"シーン 2725","telop":"だが、彼らが私たちの予想を超える手法で戦い、霊夢でもその戦い、異変を止められないとは、知る由もなかった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2726スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"718825F5-E645-4211-A6CE-02B7F659AA13","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2726","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2727スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"131F05A9-5480-4FD0-9ADC-5835EE0FC03D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2727","telop":"僕は、家に戻ると、PCのロックを解除する。\nすると、政府の臨時記者会見の情報が入ってきた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2728スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"AFA134E4-AFFD-4908-8159-8FEC39113DD1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2728","telop":"僕はその会見を見ているうちに、だんだんと思考回路が入れ替わっていき、最後には、あの円球と会話し、ある作戦に出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2729スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3D669E21-37CE-4582-A290-5DAEE7C49252","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2729","telop":"そして、その円球があるみとりの研究センターに立ち寄ると、さっそく、具体的な作業…いや戦闘指示に入るのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"26021CFC-62F7-4345-974B-AB9569CA71D8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2731スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"8B9A214F-7030-4CF5-90A3-4DA5EFFBBB77","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2731","telop":"私が、記者会見中ふと、周りを見ると、橙が私に視線を向けていることに気がつき、彼女に小声で言う。「どうしたのよ、橙。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2732スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"橙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"橙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"498E7940-856F-4A31-8B09-E51753A1A70F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2732","telop":"「えっと…円球機械室を見回りしたものが、誰かが、円球の権限を乗っ取り、遠隔操作しているって…騒いでいて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2733スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"CA7A7B36-E2BB-4F52-BE32-43D5DFF1E3D0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2733","telop":"私は、その一言に嫌な予感し、\n橙に会見の続きを任せて、そのまま円球機械室に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2734スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"702C81C9-E8F8-4143-8C92-D04D63862AEF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2734","telop":"私は、ただ部屋に一人残され、何気なく、霊夢に話しかける。\n「なぁ、霊夢…お前が競馬で大儲けしたってのは本当なのか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2735スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"84FC6A65-7586-4FA9-BD6B-970039074F1E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2735","telop":"「確かに…共同口座のお金と早苗の奇跡の力で、がっぽり儲けたのは、本当なのよ…、でもちょっとして出来心で…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2736スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A4F96C4F-0DE7-4130-878F-12BA7BC05707","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2736","telop":"「そうか…、操夢が言ってた話だと、過去の口座の入出金を調べていたら、何回か不審な履歴があったと言ってたのだぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2737スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"B645ECA6-CA47-439F-9719-9FF199471DF1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2737","telop":"私は、その指摘を受け、ズキズキと心に何かが刺さる…。\n「えっと…、それは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2738スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"82BAAB95-E7D3-4309-A7D5-C07AB2A0D724","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2738","telop":"「なあ、一つ聞きたいんだけど、\n霊夢の収入が少ないと感じるのは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2739スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"15A70B0A-381C-4169-9D42-986F1AEFA7EE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2739","telop":"「ええ、あの問題の続報になるかもしれないですが、文さんにはあの記者会見の内容の否定と、協力のお願いをしたくて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2740スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"71E0257E-985A-4973-AE3E-006F2D9A9003","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2740","telop":"「お願い…もし、内密な話なのであれば、\nそちらにお伺いしましょうか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2741スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AB0ED058-25B2-4E3E-A318-A779588874E6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2741","telop":"「いえ、あの家は、しばらく手放す予定なので、文さんでお願いを話せればいいかと…」僕は、ボソボソと呟くように言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2742スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A12A441C-4293-47D4-8045-FD88B2991D78","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2742","telop":"「わかりました…それで、話し合いは、今夜にしますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2743スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A3FD832D-1072-4E48-A9B7-8D8686621840","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2743","telop":"「ええ、それでお願いします。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2744スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C073DBCD-B2CD-4A6C-9C31-711600239237","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2744","telop":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi ※前回の予告と一部内容が異なります。\n交換夫婦\n8人の女性と1人の男〜操夢は、記者会見を見ているうちに、居ても立っても居られないなり…〜","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2745スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"3C8BCA20-746D-40CB-A430-3E0CCD1F3FFB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2745","telop":"僕は、それから、家に戻ってくると、\nポケットからポケベルを取り出し、PCに繋げて起動する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2746スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4D7222EB-3643-47A5-B851-FE08B20294A4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2746","telop":"そして、何気なくポケベルのアプリを開く。\nFiles\nポケベル\nポケベル\nFiles\n編集\n表示\n移動\nウィンドウ\nヘルプ","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2747スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D01822A0-DA94-407A-8B6A-4A244AB77478","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2747","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nポケベルはさまざまな人々の\n「誰かと繋がりたい」という\n思いが沢山こもった製品として\n平成初期から中期にかけて\n流行した通話機能を有する機器\nであり、国会においてスマート\nフォンマナーの問題が挙げられ\n国民のスマートフォン利用を\n原則中止すると、我ら河童\nが生み出したこのポケベルが\n巨大な需要を生み出して…\npocketbell.kappa\/home\/top\n政府公認の安心国産ポケベル\nホーム\nポケベルって何？\n出来ること\n河童の技術力\nポケベル史\n政府公認とは？\nポケベルの魅力\n電話の歴史\nポケベルの性能\nポケベルの価格\n必要なもの\n固定電話は必須？\n通信機能について\nすると、右上に通知が表示され、\n僕は、その通知にカーソルを合わせてクリックする。\n操作\nWeb\nポケベル\n政府が臨時記者会見が始まる\n例の賭博問題に関する言及か…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2748スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D8421CA2-0EE5-445E-9D13-870955F91366","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/魔理沙（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2748","telop":"ポケベル\nポケベル初回設定\nポケベル\nFiles\nえ\npocketbell.kappa\/news\/live\/movie\/miko-tobaku-info\nすると、生放送の画面に切り替わり、読み込み表記が表示される。僕は、しばらく待った後、会見放送を眺めるのだった。\n操作\nWeb\nroading…\nコメント\nroading…\n大宮巫女賭博問題に関する政府臨時記者会見\n生放送配信　映像提供：文々。新聞社","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2749スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2ACE093A-0AA3-45BE-874D-F5593822ADAD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2749","telop":"それから時間がたち…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2750スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4AA7852A-7FF6-4C72-B21A-30E214DF4272","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2750","telop":"僕はそれから、会見を見ていたが、だんだんとそれどころではないと考え、そして、ひっそりとみとりの研究室に来た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2751スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B8769479-355E-4540-A880-13F0879758AE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2751","telop":"この場所は、僕があの島唄居酒屋で、連行されたあとに、睡眠中にこの場所のデータが、インポートされていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2752スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1901303B-9C13-4CF8-ACB2-4EFB3B5DFE05","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2752","telop":"そして僕は操作盤を触り、会見途中からあのPCで会話していた、この円球に直接、文章を…いや、プログラムを送る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2753スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CA096397-4D53-4204-9E96-A1DFB6E7A8BA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2753","telop":"「プログラムを読み込み中…、首相官邸の丸型システムの遠隔操作を実行中…、現在の動作システムコードを解析中…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2754スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"016F4696-CDB0-43B3-8185-4C39861DF3B0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2754","telop":"私が、記者会見中ふと、周りを見ると、橙が私に視線を向けていることに気がつき、彼女に小声で言う。「どうしたのよ、橙。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2755スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"橙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"橙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"4440C199-F187-4116-A48B-4F266E3852FC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2755","telop":"「えっと…円球機械室を見回りしたものが、誰かが、円球の権限を乗っ取り、遠隔操作しているって…騒いでいて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2756スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"74006381-F53F-4C9D-8ACD-0AD668565481","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2756","telop":"私は、その一言に嫌な予感し、\n橙に会見の続きを任せて、そのまま円球機械室に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2757スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"ECC8B5AC-0CE3-4EFD-849E-53B65CED45DB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2757","telop":"「解析が完了しました。プロンプト一つで、システムを操作できます。次は、どうしましょうか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2758スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"51992967-3D8E-4DCA-9CFD-0291883A7CEF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2758","telop":"「おっと…、遠隔操作先の円球の異変に、向こうの人が気付いたようです。できるだけ、早めの実行をお勧めします。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2759スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"27854FB2-EC7C-4152-8391-3E0FBE2EE69E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2759","telop":"「自動運転中の全列車の一斉停止と、\n大宮駅付近の最寄り電車を駅に入線する。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2760スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5C5F758A-9C8B-45B2-A4E1-FFF08915D3FE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2760","telop":"「承知しました、全列車に一斉停止コードを送信します…、通信中です…、コードを作成中です…、コードを送信しました…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2761スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CE01CB09-F20C-4FEA-9944-D98789F64DDC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2761","telop":"「現状を確認中です…大宮駅付近で止まっている最寄り列車を探しています…大宮公園で現在停止中の列車があります。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2762スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"33625DAA-2358-43A0-92F6-580462276B5E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2762","telop":"僕は、それを聞くと、操作盤を触り、\nある人物に電話をかける…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2763スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DE2078B4-1A42-4CB9-966A-DB37E7272E3F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2763","telop":"彼が発信先の人は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2764スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"116CCCFD-08F6-4726-9892-B2BFDA22584D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2764","telop":"私は、ただ一人、手持ちのノートPC上で臨時記者会見の様子を見ていると、ふとポケベルの着信に気づく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2765スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"27CCCF1C-F044-47C5-8645-09266879B523","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2765","telop":"「もしもし、操夢、どうしたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2766スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A813D72E-E67B-4B70-830E-9218CE0931D0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2766","telop":"「あんなことがあった後の電話で、こう言うのもなんですが、霊夢さんは、総理と僕だったら、どっちがいいですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2767スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"885DD046-18AA-4847-AC67-C7FACDB9C4CB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2767","telop":"「えっ、それってどういう？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2768スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6BBC5516-8955-4A31-BB71-58B695160C35","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2768","telop":"「今流れている記者会見を見ればわかりますが、総理は僕のことを前面に押し出して、問題の真相は闇に封印する気です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2769スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A14EAC27-D4DD-4BF6-B0EA-EC009E41D594","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2769","telop":"「それで…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2770スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DE9AEA85-1E97-43D2-8708-124F72DF3EE7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2770","telop":"「手短に言うと、政府の味方になれば、この問題を闇に葬る代わりに、総理直々の罰が霊夢さんに降るの明確です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2771スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"031C7E70-A9A5-4E89-8AE4-C68A6B7703B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2771","telop":"「ですが、僕につけば、文さんと交渉して、世間を誤魔化して、これまで通り、巫女として働き、お仕置きもしません。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2772スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"793A7396-E23C-475C-ABBB-C14F06E7109C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2772","telop":"「両者とも、この問題を闇に葬るのには変わりませんが、霊夢さんなら、きっと僕につけば、より利にかなってますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2773スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A7E5850D-2DE4-46F0-A524-6EB777D12C33","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2773","telop":"「ただ一つ難点を言うなら、この騒動が鎮静になるまで、霊夢さんと必要なら魔理沙さんたちも、家には帰れません。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2774スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0BEDCA6E-1CD5-4D65-A842-45340F96182C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2774","telop":"「ですが、今僕がプログラムを送りつけて、文さんの協力を確実に得られれば、沈静化までそう長くはかかりません。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2775スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9F9B78CC-3E00-479F-90F7-6E8C4CD875F7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2775","telop":"「この難点にさえ、目を瞑れば、何も不自由なく、これまでと近い形で生活を送り続けられます。さてどうしますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2776スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E139EF6C-8DFE-4657-9F81-CB2FC963F72A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2776","telop":"「そう…」私はそう返す…、今ここで彼について、少しの間だけ我慢すれば、これまで通りの生活を送れるが、迷いがある。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2777スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4FAEAB8A-D04B-4CC8-9935-710D66D1A447","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2777","telop":"「霊夢さん、何か、僕のプランに問題がありますか、\nそれとも何かしらの要望がありますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2778スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"04C6EC07-9C48-4F7C-98CD-25D18911F9D5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2778","telop":"私はそう言われ、考えると、ふとあの気配を感じ、\nポケベルをPCからとり耳に当てながら、飛んでいく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2779スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"9893964E-9A9F-4003-A881-E453FA427C9E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 2779","telop":"すると、彼が何かを言い始め、それに耳を傾ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2780スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"66396D7B-5E56-447E-B9C2-5F2F81441A32","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2780","telop":"「霊夢さん、今、空を飛んでますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2781スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"60E8579C-9E39-48A7-A4C5-3EBEAF735DC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 2781","telop":"「ええ、そうよ。それでどうすればいいの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2782スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"358E5310-DF3D-462D-8003-9F018E98C921","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2782","telop":"「今、大宮公園の列車を動かし始めたので、列車のカメラを見ながら、僕の合図で空いている扉から乗り込んでください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2783スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc456758_空A..jpg","id":"BE51BAC4-85D8-4CFB-97D9-BFD047C9B41C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc456758_空A..jpg","title":"シーン 2783","telop":"「それって、どういう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2784スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3C7BC34C-8E1E-40A0-9CA3-4A122CCFD16E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2784","telop":"「今、列車の映像を見てます…」僕はそう言いながら、その列車から空に向けられているカメラの映像を確認する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2785スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A91F0F23-6C61-418A-A645-3BB6A1C6D507","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2785","telop":"そして、しばらく経つと、彼女の姿が写り、\n「今です。」と言い、列車を減速させ、最寄りの扉を開く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2786スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"2D502B89-4B2B-4645-8DF7-EE575BC6D24E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2786","telop":"私は彼の言うタイミングで、列車に乗り込むと、即座に扉がしまる。ふと周りを見ると、空気輸送していたようだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2787スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"76CE5901-BB9D-40AC-B39E-70CCB169EDD7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2787","telop":"「この列車は、臨時特別快速、甲子線直通、八王子行きです。途中の停車駅は中浦和のみとなります。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2788スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6B0D40AF-857C-4D69-ACF3-8977C97AC31F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2788","telop":"僕は、列車の車内カメラで、彼女が乗り込みと同時に、扉閉め、最大限の加速を列車にさせる。「霊夢さん、聞こえますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2789スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"C00BF1DB-BDBE-4838-BF17-42D6169801D5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2789","telop":"「なんだか、とんでもない速度が出てる気がするんだけど…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2790スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CAB78136-C037-4580-882A-F51433686691","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2790","telop":"「今、列車は限界速度の時速150kmなので、\nここまでだったら、おそらく数十分でつきますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2791スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"F3E2B7A7-AF70-4121-A2CB-8A5AF530F19B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2791","telop":"「そっ、そう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2792スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"24B2B0C6-2A67-4490-BD53-9934674C1001","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2792","telop":"僕はそう言いながら、家にいるフランたちにメッセージを送る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2793スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E93487F0-61CA-4663-95E6-74037322D2A8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2793","telop":"その頃フランたちは…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2794スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"81C8209D-409F-4208-9C45-28F34C9E82EF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2794","telop":"私は、ふとポケベルから音がして、見ると、操夢からメッセージが来ていた。私は、その内容を他の皆に伝える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2795スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"C740F619-5758-4FCC-AF88-B046FF8E3BC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 2795","telop":"すると、この家に住む霊夢以外の全員に同じ文言が送られていることがわかり、私たちは、準備をすまして、家を出るのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2796スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0A6E92CA-7104-448C-9CB8-57BD87354AB4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2796","telop":"霊夢の列車が駅に止まると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2797スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"3E53A050-E21E-4B8C-9C54-3B9B7940AC7D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2797","telop":"それから、数分経つと、途中停車駅につき、ドアが開く。\nすると、そこからフランたちが乗ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2798スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"06E34E92-C655-40C3-B493-ECECC6F7F613","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2798","telop":"「もしかした、フランたちにも彼から何か来たの？」\n私は、再び猛加速をしだす、列車に腰掛けながら、尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2799スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"EEA52014-5A09-44E9-9A78-EBA19AD74DB7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2799","telop":"そして、魔理沙の姿がないことに気づく。\nすると、車内放送…ではなく彼の声が聞こえる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2800スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"5A625438-1FC8-4DF1-92FF-36B57CF1D5E8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2800","telop":"「魔理沙さんは、ちょうど近くにいたようなので、今こっちにいますよ。どうします、マイク機能があるので会話もできますが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2801スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"6768A5BC-718B-4BB4-8ADB-6182D6FF225C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2801","telop":"「…魔理沙の声…聞かせてちょうだい…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2802スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8556C4FF-AAD1-4D7D-B59D-48CC109D254A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2802","telop":"「どうやら、霊夢さんがあなたと話したいみたいです、僕は、ちょっと席を外すので、あとはお任せしますね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2803スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6C968589-9739-4076-8BFE-40B4E59E5FF5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2803","telop":"僕はそう言うと、その部屋から離れた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2804スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B0E5D8AA-7F06-494F-98D5-C577B860D87B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2804","telop":"私は、ただ部屋に一人残され、何気なく、霊夢に話しかける。\n「なぁ、霊夢…お前が競馬で大儲けしたってのは本当なのか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2805スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"C550BB05-CF6B-409D-ABC0-3EE08580995A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2805","telop":"「確かに…共同口座のお金と早苗の奇跡の力で、がっぽり儲けたのは、本当なのよ…、でもちょっとして出来心で…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2806スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EB3E363D-621C-491A-93BD-D287B2A195AD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2806","telop":"「そうか…、操夢が言ってた話だと、過去の口座の入出金を調べていたら、何回か不審な履歴があったと言ってたのだぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2807スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"126F1EE7-2EF2-4148-9B73-8775A26EBD6A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2807","telop":"私は、その指摘を受け、ズキズキと心に何かが刺さる…。\n「えっと…、それは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2808スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7BA9805D-ED00-487C-8753-E86CA8A4F0C9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2808","telop":"「なあ、一つ聞きたいんだけど、\n霊夢の収入が少ないと感じるのは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2809スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"ED9B0869-56D5-4851-9EF3-24AB97C7C60E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2809","telop":"「えっと…」私は、その空気と彼女の問いかけに、平常心を保とうとするが、保てず、どうすればいいか迷う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2810スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"55C4D2B2-1BA1-40AD-94E4-8BEE331003DD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2810","telop":"「まぁ、これを真に受けて、これからは、しっかり生きていくならいいと、操夢は、私がここに着いた時に言ってたぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2811スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"18A62F72-929C-49FB-ADF3-055006075876","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2811","telop":"「うぐ…」私は、魔理沙の発言にそう返すことしかできなかった。そして、彼の心意気に感謝をするのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2812スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"46541AA9-E4E4-4513-A0CE-58271BFBDFFB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2812","telop":"だが、それは同時に、ついこないだ、全員が思い知った、\n”彼”と皆との関係性にとって、大きな転換点だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2813スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1D1D5BB2-D066-4624-A4CC-CD4A2E2710D1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2813","telop":"その頃、操夢は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2814スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C63CE6B9-7D22-478F-A5CB-02D99DEFAACA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2814","telop":"僕は、部屋から出て壁に寄りかかると、ポケベルを取り出し、ある連絡先に、電話をかける。すると、相手がすぐに出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2815スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A34F2D61-8CB3-4573-8601-7F719EA072A4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2815","telop":"「もしもし、聞こえますか？」\n僕は声を抑えながら、そう言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2816スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DB09B00D-1D93-4EA3-B23E-9D083C0728CB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2816","telop":"「ええ、どうしました？何かスクープでもあるのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2817スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"50157207-5B05-4992-879F-5E3B558AEB14","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2817","telop":"「いえ、今回はスクープではありませんが、例のスクープ記事について、ちょっとお願いがあるのですが？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2818スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F47FBC97-C07B-4095-A363-14CC15995367","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2818","telop":"「何か、心配事でもあるのですが？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2819スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FC146064-4B8F-4CC2-A6C4-C93E954EEFFE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2819","telop":"「ええ、あの問題の続報になるかもしれないですが、文さんにはあの記者会見の内容の否定と、協力のお願いをしたくて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2820スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"35A5E440-773D-485C-8120-F35AEBB6E552","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2820","telop":"「お願い…もし、内密な話なのであれば、\nそちらにお伺いしましょうか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2821スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"025B64EE-A351-4332-B394-C00CA5AC7188","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2821","telop":"「いえ、あの家は、しばらく手放す予定なので、文さんでお願いを話せればいいかと…」僕は、ボソボソと呟くように言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2822スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D7D3F8D5-7E1E-42F9-874D-2612FE8E94E1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2822","telop":"「わかりました…それで、話し合いは、今夜にしますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2823スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"928109CB-1342-4A00-A5B5-FF4251A62548","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2823","telop":"「ええ、それでお願いします。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2824スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"73EF1793-56E9-4733-968B-30F981641FE4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2824","telop":"「承知しました。では、今晩、お待ちしてますね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2825スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"98931CAD-BDB4-483A-84CD-D1D878EDD439","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2825","telop":"「わかりました。では失礼します。」\n僕はそう言うと、通話を切る。そして、部屋に戻る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2826スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"42ADFC4D-D0C1-4991-8AE9-8B49DC1EAD79","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2826","telop":"そして、部屋に戻るとあることを思い出し、操作盤を触る。\nそして、列車が減速しているのを確認する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2827スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","id":"7CDE32FF-E571-4FBA-8740-855AF5887BF2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","title":"シーン 2827","telop":"すると、少しだけ列車が揺れたあと、スピードがだんだんと落ちていき、数十秒程度で、ドアが開いた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2828スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"5FD4421A-F19C-4587-BCBB-285F0477931B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2828","telop":"そして、それから10分程度で全員がこの部屋に出揃った。\n僕はそれから、これからの計画、プランを話し始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2829スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"07E5AE75-6C3D-45B2-B119-9B7F75062D4A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2829","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2830スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"D7778B02-2432-4EEB-9B90-4AACF5A113AA","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2830","telop":"僕はそれから、この場にいる全員に、これからの計画、プランを話していく。そうしていくうちに、夕方になる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2831スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"30F6E2FB-EFEC-40C4-8014-06BB39E91D07","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2831","telop":"そして僕は、不要になったシステムなどの権限を放棄すると、\nそのまま、文の家にやってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2832スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"202AF91F-B61A-436C-94C9-DD51FB3205D0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2832","telop":"そして、記者の姿の文に、あるお願い話し切ると、\n文が今晩は泊まってかないかと誘い、終電も無くなった僕は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"4BBCD9D8-52BF-4153-8BC0-885F7AD7EBE7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2834スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"DD111E3E-4F1C-4CA8-AE94-CD7F37144EE3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2834","telop":"「例の記者会見の内容の否定と…、\n少しばかし協力をお願いしたくて…」\n今回の迷シーン","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2835スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"86AD58D6-1DDB-4394-B260-3107B945EC7C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2835","telop":"「協力のお願いとは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2836スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"8FEBE4C6-C201-4296-8CDB-D67845962CDB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2836","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう聞かれ、そっと彼女に近づき、耳打ちする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2837スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F29088FC-3EDF-48D7-8E82-F55CE35AE281","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2837","telop":"すると、彼女は頬を赤らめて、大きな声を出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2838スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"5BEFD221-E7FD-421F-B3C3-A95FD6F60F20","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2838","telop":"「それ、正気ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2839スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8E18352F-8FE5-4572-8C2F-54157813D21E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2839","telop":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi\n交換夫婦\n8人の女性と1人の男〜操夢たちは、話し合いをしたのち、彼は文の家に向かい〜","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2840スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"B2182650-4F44-438E-9A6E-89E389FB5382","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2840","telop":"僕はそれから、これからのことを話し始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2841スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"A20DD582-7464-48CD-97F4-D3EFA77517D3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2841","telop":"「霊夢さんたちは、あの会見を見て、何を考えましたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2842スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"B571911E-8EA0-47EF-8CF3-30F579A10868","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2842","telop":"「えっと…」\n私は、彼の問いかけにどう答えるべきかわからず、そう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2843スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"6504B961-7849-40F5-BFCE-59FC92DA07B0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2843","telop":"「さっきまで、乗せてたお客さんから聞いたんだが、守谷神社は、この問題には関わってないと硬い態度…だそうだぜ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2844スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"FC4FB1F9-EDE5-4C3A-B5FC-782AA451F942","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2844","telop":"「あなただけに、その問題の責任を負わせるつもりかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2845スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"CD647BA7-54DC-4728-AC2A-FBE451CFE524","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2845","telop":"「確かに、レミリアと魔理沙の言う通りね。\nでも、その問題の責任を紫たちは、あなたに転嫁した。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2846スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"66D9C37D-BBB5-4337-BA21-22FD123478F2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2846","telop":"「彼女たちは、その責任をあなたに転嫁することで、政府とりわけ、紫や霊夢さんに不評が行かないように…してますね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2847スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"9F642315-0044-40BF-8243-43D2388CE2DB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2847","telop":"「今、彼女たちは自らの地位や立場の保全のために、世の不評や批判があなたに向かうように仕向けている…とも感じます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2848スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"7B2096EE-D69A-45AB-B062-8F02B60CDA78","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2848","telop":"「フランさんとこいしさんは、どう思いますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2849スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"93B173FF-B1FC-4A99-BD4B-6DCA2CEBBD8E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2849","telop":"「私は、お姉様たちが言っていることが、ピンとは来ないけど、ただなんとなく、責任が操夢に乗っかってるのは分かる。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2850スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地こいし","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"AADC6FAD-C085-4985-8D38-2B53E8247F57","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（不満）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2850","telop":"「私は…記者会見見てたけど、正直言って内容が入らなかった。\nそれで、操夢は、これからどうする予定なの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2851スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"C84A3D6A-99B4-499E-ABA9-F1BE1C386C36","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2851","telop":"「僕は、とりあえず、問題が発覚したスクープを掲載した記者に、記者会見の内容の否定と、協力をお願いする予定です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2852スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"33208587-FCF9-426C-84F6-CC9601B5185F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2852","telop":"「その記者って…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2853スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"4BB8DDD4-1A4B-49CF-9B2B-16DE4C1813E6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2853","telop":"「名前は…伏せときますが、今晩は、この施設で泊まるための許可をとってありますから、安心してください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2854スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"5D1E241E-1FDC-4ACA-BC87-861804BB0C8D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2854","telop":"「そう…」私は、一つの懸念が浮かぶが、\n強く問いただすこともなく、そう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2855スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"AEAE4346-CA45-414F-995F-4F61B0D7E2D3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2855","telop":"「レミリアさんたちが寝ている間に、戻りますから、それまで、このフロアマップを見て、部屋分けした後、休んでください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2856スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"9DE85137-7727-481C-8C03-C67D43FE59D1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2856","telop":"「それじゃあ、僕はその場所に行ってきますね。」\n僕はそう言うと、フロアマップを開き、部屋を出た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2857スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7360FFAF-79EB-44B4-9EEE-30747B62306A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2857","telop":"操夢が文の家に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2858スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3749F068-2F8A-4575-BC96-5CE5D83BF47B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2858","telop":"僕はそれから、家から持ってきたノートPCで不要になったシステム権限を移動中に放棄し、文の家にやってきた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2859スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"87733748-D90A-49E1-B179-682E860FB72E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2859","telop":"「それで、今日はどんな情報を、持ってきましたか？」\n私は、そう彼に尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2860スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B2A9C963-279B-48C2-AA00-0E6AF4CAD755","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2860","telop":"「例の記者会見の内容の否定と…、\n少しばかし協力をお願いしたくて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2861スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"22158BD3-315A-4BEA-A03C-E33A7B31A2B8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2861","telop":"「協力のお願いとは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2862スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"58822312-0BFF-40C0-A96A-FAA35E7937F7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2862","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう聞かれ、そっと彼女に近づき、耳打ちする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2863スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"1060148F-41DF-402D-A3A1-4C4005A010EB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2863","telop":"すると、彼女は頬を赤らめて、大きな声を出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2864スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"8AC942D6-C510-4D77-90AA-33B2EB414EB9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2864","telop":"「それ、正気ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2865スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"FF4F540C-7958-4F85-9032-52E11D62097E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2865","telop":"「ええ、本当です。それなら、互いの理に適ってますし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2866スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"5AE1B84F-D6EE-454A-9F6E-D33DEE639EBA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2866","telop":"「理に適っているとは？あの…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2867スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F1F763F6-4431-4409-ACFA-5E9408C50955","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2867","telop":"僕は、そう彼女がその発言をする前に、キスで塞ぎ込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2868スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"93E73E1C-B3C3-44E5-AD05-D28D0AF34E60","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2868","telop":"「んっ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2869スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"29D3E5C6-8694-492C-BBAD-690D6DA87C86","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2869","telop":"「どうします、今すぐ出てもいいですけど…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2870スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"55585A18-8500-4E52-A05B-A2C3001ACE07","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2870","telop":"僕はそう言われ、時間を確かめる。\nだが、終電の時刻は過ぎていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2871スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"13A66A31-247E-4E59-A4C6-EAD31742ABE4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2871","telop":"「私の家に泊まって行きますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2872スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"80F8B911-16E9-4240-9BF3-9DA4DEAF1776","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2872","telop":"僕は考える、タクシーを呼べば、すぐに戻れるが、タクシーを呼ぶのには、政府の網にはまるリスクも伴う…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2873スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"53CF197C-3475-48A3-B324-7858A48E3BD2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2873","telop":"「すでに終電は過ぎてるので、今晩は泊まって、\n明朝には向こうにつけるようにしようと思います。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2874スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"84EC68F3-D828-4528-87FF-18928AA18A32","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2874","telop":"「それで、文さんは、普段記者として活動する中で、\n周りの人々に対する愚痴や不満などはありますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2875スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3E4C7648-45C0-4FBA-AA15-F0836A137680","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2875","telop":"「どうしてそんなことを言うのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2876スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"CE521C77-8CD9-4B7D-98B2-5E03A042932C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2876","telop":"「明朝までには、向こうについてる必要があり、寝ていたら、きっと間に合わないので、今夜は、睡眠0ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2877スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"82596FD4-51E6-4083-A19F-8378C38FE12C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2877","telop":"「でも私は…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2878スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"E7F8F4E2-7CA4-402B-9275-13604D913B5B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2878","telop":"「睡眠が0時間になるのは、僕だけでいいですから、文さんは眠たかったら、寝て大丈夫ですよ。寝たら背負って移動するので。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2879スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"70F00E5A-5078-4A35-9C92-DC19FD9B9249","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2879","telop":"「そうですか…、ちょっと待っててください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2880スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6A6809C2-9CCC-4529-90C6-AC0078B00003","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2880","telop":"数十分後…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2881スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"8CB94523-9FED-477F-9397-1B804C50CA54","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2881","telop":"「お待たせしました…」\n私は、遠出の準備を済ませると、彼にそう言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2882スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0FF10FFC-7BBF-42A1-A40A-B73C68262E5A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2882","telop":"「これで、準備は万端ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2883スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A4644E64-03BC-431D-82E8-C15EFB367397","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2883","telop":"「ええ、万端です。」私はその言葉で啖呵が切れたように、\n記者としての活動で、溜まった不満や愚痴を彼に言うのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2884スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1003ECE9-6004-47EF-9DCE-D749C48F6C36","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2884","telop":"それから夜が更けていき…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2885スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7E903094-C624-48CC-858D-F84C251087FB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2885","telop":"彼女はそれから、愚痴や不満を出し続けていると、\nそのまますやすやと寝てしまった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2886スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"5CFAD3F2-6C26-4B19-95FB-FEE5AE835802","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2886","telop":"僕は、ふとポケベルを取り出す。日の出まであと数時間だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2887スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"459B1065-CDC0-4E4E-AE37-3441077150BD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2887","telop":"僕はポケベルをポケットにしまうと、そっと彼女を起こさないように近づき、彼女をゆっくりと背負う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2888スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5383374F-3515-41F4-B132-502EF4BB8E7A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2888","telop":"すると、彼女が寝言をつぶやく。僕は、そんな彼女の寝言に、小さく「そうですか…」と返すと、彼女の足に僕の腕を絡ませる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2889スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F4925953-74AC-480F-B634-D77EFBFD4EA2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2889","telop":"そして、二つのスーツケースを手に取りつかむと、\nゆっくりと歩き、駅のほうに向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2890スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc260102_田舎の駅前（夜）.jpg","id":"0FD57B49-5E0B-4A13-9283-D49DA6886A00","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2890","telop":"そして、駅に着くと、無人の改札を通り、彼女が寝静まった後に、密かに動かしていた列車に乗り込み、出発した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2891スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E1679BE4-B2DC-4798-AB18-0CB465A26196","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2891","telop":"一方その頃、霊夢たちは…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2892スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"80EF7F96-68B3-4C16-BFEE-E083F35CE683","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2892","telop":"私はふと目が覚めると、そこは西東京研究所の仮眠室だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2893スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"7525A098-72F5-4106-97F6-C8933ABDBAA5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2893","telop":"「まだ、暗い…」ふとそうつぶやく。私が、そう言いながら、目を瞑ろうとすると、誰かが戸を叩く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2894スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"BDE1DAD4-D7B3-4C2C-9313-A7C932519168","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2894","telop":"私は、おぼつかない足取りで、扉へと向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2895スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"16B062A4-BB21-4060-98A4-C452750EFF9F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2895","telop":"「こんな夜中にどうしたのよ…魔理沙。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2896スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"2312072D-48EF-4DF9-9371-8793741FD96C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2896","telop":"「なんだか…目が覚めちまって…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2897スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"56ADA5DD-5C3F-4C1C-ABCD-A592EBECDADF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2897","telop":"「そう…それで…私と一緒に寝たいの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2898スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"71874ADD-32AA-415E-A596-16C4E918F6DF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2898","telop":"「そうさせてもらえないか…なのだぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2899スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B7B2EAF1-9D91-411D-90D5-C44C8273CFA4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2899","telop":"「分かったわ…いいわよ…魔理沙…」\n私はそう言うと、そのままベッドに戻った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2900スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2EE8FC53-04F6-4A3E-B19E-34B7352C21F8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2900","telop":"彼が文とともに研究所に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2901スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"285579B2-A75C-462F-9A0D-3200FF3345CA","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 2901","telop":"僕が、文を背負った状態で、スーツケースを転がしながら、入ると、霊夢たちが驚いた様子でこちらを見る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2902スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"74F57687-23DA-44AF-BE12-758F601FB4A3","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2902","telop":"「あんた、なんで文を背負って戻ってきたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2903スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"BEAFD059-EA5B-4E89-AF2E-64067F1AD4A4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2903","telop":"僕は、彼女に小声でそう聞かれると、そっと文を起こさないように、床におろし、壁に寄りかからせてから答える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2904スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"3F14B190-D9C7-4786-BF8A-A46B99865494","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2904","telop":"「彼女がそばにいた方が、理に適っているからです。」\n僕はそう、小声で返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2905スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"EEA9DFA2-D9EE-4F7E-9B90-E6C8846C6F3D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2905","telop":"「んっ…ここは…」\n私は、ふと目が覚めると、そう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2906スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3C644F15-81B1-473A-BC0D-AAAA48B7D687","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2906","telop":"すると、脳が急に覚醒したかのように、思い出す。\n「私が操夢さんに愚痴こぼしてたら…寝落ちした…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2907スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1C8BA288-DB7E-4B0D-ADE1-0DCCC55BEB2F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2907","telop":"「なんだか…申し訳ないです…。」\n私は、羞恥心でそんな言葉を彼に言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2908スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"37C04C63-1D60-4BE5-B8C8-96FE6FBC9A56","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2908","telop":"「いえいえ、大丈夫ですよ。」\n僕はそう呟く彼女にそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2909スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"952C5B09-FEA2-43AA-986E-CA7A4A34EAF7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2909","telop":"「これで全員、揃いましたね…。\n霊夢さんたちは、準備は万端ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2910スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"A8EB900C-8622-455F-B9A7-5636033A3519","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2910","telop":"僕がそう問いかけると、僕のポケベルから着信音が鳴る。\n僕は、すぐさま操作盤に繋げ、スピーカーにして出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2911スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"0497EAA4-FEAC-47B4-AD43-ED33C4A30136","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2911","telop":"「もしもし、みとりさん、どうしましたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2912スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"BEE9A360-8CAC-48E8-8DBC-27EBE6040776","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2912","telop":"「操夢さん、今すぐにその研究所を出てください！\n紫からの追手が迫っています！」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2913スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"8759C637-FD23-443B-99D4-B77F493436F9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2913","telop":"「それで、移動手段は？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2914スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"AA14F46F-F470-4422-939B-4657C1DFBC48","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2914","telop":"「今、その研究所の屋上に専用機が待機しているので、\n今すぐに屋上から、施設を離れてください！」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2915スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"33C71E8D-7951-40D6-8BBD-4145D719E9EF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2915","telop":"すると、なぜか通話が強制終了になった。\n「急いで、屋上に向かいますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2916スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EE3E274D-2A15-4CB0-81A1-89F61E5444A5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2916","telop":"僕たちは、そこから屋上に上がると、止まっていたヘリコプターに乗り込み、僕は、運転席に座る。\n察しのいい人には乗り物が見えます…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2917スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C78C95BD-031E-46CC-8E5C-5DF4A415F4EB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2917","telop":"そして、頭の中でヘリコプターの運転マニュアルを読み込みながら、同時にヘリコプターを離陸させる。\n察しのいい人には乗り物が見えます…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2918スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"4CFF67A7-EB4F-41D3-8788-D7C2436F89EC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2918","telop":"そして、そのまま彼女の現在地…沖縄に向かうのだった。\n察しのいい人には乗り物が見えます…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2919スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"91D44300-07F9-4157-B691-989730CF7A0F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2919","telop":"次回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2920スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"28A4ABA0-A903-441A-8699-5540912AAD2C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2920","telop":"僕たちは、沖縄の某所につくと、みとりとそこで話す。\n僕たちが離陸して数十分後に、紫からの追手が来た様だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2921スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"FE1CFD52-460B-459C-8129-98F4271B4937","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2921","telop":"そこで、僕は、予定していた計画を前倒しにし、\nその場、今後を霊夢たちと話し合い、実行に移す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2922スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"DB901498-06EE-404E-ADCA-17A72AAB7192","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2922","telop":"そして、それを実行途中に、霊夢の姿が消える。\n僕は、その彼女の不可解な行動への対処も考えるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"5CE89E35-10F2-4869-A1C9-55524D792A84","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2924スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D509DA60-EAA3-447C-8B87-3D9C8ECD19AF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2924","telop":"「ねぇ、あんた、私の話、聞いてるの？」\n今回の迷シーン","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2925スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9A7CB50E-0331-4439-A5FB-ED9C26AEEFCA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2925","telop":"僕は、そういう彼女の背後にそっと周り、\n片手で彼女の頭を撫でながら、片手を彼女の体に回す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2926スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"26D6E3B1-ABE2-4A3D-9E45-D927C5D8C718","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2926","telop":"「あんた…それ…反則よ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2927スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D661F219-7EBA-42BE-AE05-A2402D5B09DB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2927","telop":"「でも…もっと…そうなでて…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2928スライド","transitionName":"カラーでフェード","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1D7A27BE-3746-4665-BD9E-6E73A9D9FF71","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2928","telop":"僕は、特に何かを言うこともなく、\nただ同じような体制で、彼女の頭をそっとなで続ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"7FBEF467-7993-467D-8E80-BF61DD3FF9D7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi　※前回の内容とは一部異なります。","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2930スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"2A0AA955-FBD0-47D1-B0D1-D4A17041C395","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2930","telop":"僕たちはそれから、沖縄の某所に来ていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2931スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"1BEC8BCA-63F0-415F-816C-4041C3C32C2F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2931","telop":"「まさか、紫たちが追っ手を実際に出すとは…考えられなかったわ…」私は、そう呟く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2932スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"AD1A482C-5E1D-4F05-8DAB-0CEA9B4EF280","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2932","telop":"「僕も、驚いてますよ…きっと、みとりさんからの電話が来なければ、あの研究所内で全員追っ手に捕まってました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2933スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"066BF3D8-DC23-4D8F-8848-C0B57195C9FA","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2933","telop":"「まぁ、とりあえず、全員が無事でよかった…、それで…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2934スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0F598C0F-FDD9-4B90-882B-348B4F716269","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2934","telop":"「今後の行動計画ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2935スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5BC349A2-1C08-47CB-A2B1-B2114D1AFE90","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2935","telop":"「ええ、そう。ここが紫にばれないとは限らないし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2936スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"30B34AEF-907B-4F16-AA17-FCA64970E225","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2936","telop":"「そうですね…、僕はそう言いながら、霊夢たちを見る。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2937スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"EB0A002D-1CE0-4105-9837-8293C4354352","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2937","telop":"すると、霊夢が口を開く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2938スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"AF501D7D-BA58-4FD1-B69E-F5A204C61987","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2938","telop":"「ねぇ、これから私たちは、紫に追われる立場になるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2939スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"10752EFA-F443-4239-8A01-1C914E82CF9F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2939","telop":"「霊夢さんのいう通りですね…。」\n僕はそういうと、一呼吸を置いてから、話し出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2940スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8D69A1F2-C104-4779-834C-D80FC4C8BCE7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2940","telop":"「みとりさん…」\n僕はそう彼女に、文が記事を書ける部屋があるか尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2941スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"35C1B06B-DD2E-485B-8F44-15F94BC94A72","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2941","telop":"「ええ、ありますが…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2942スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"2D6B4C28-1AA0-48FA-A6B5-85556774A650","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2942","telop":"そして僕は、文に記事の作成を依頼する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2943スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"5469B1E7-8859-4F86-BD95-011AB5F05A4C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2943","telop":"私は、彼の依頼を聞き、「わかりました」と返すと、その場を離れ、みとりと共にその部屋に向かっていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2944スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"AC28BBA2-80C8-40A0-9041-7104297B92A5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2944","telop":"僕は、二人がいなくなると、\n操作盤の前に立ち、ある画面を表示する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2945スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"88BCF429-163D-4BE9-BD86-D312FB62C77A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2945","telop":"私は、例の会見後に起きた、システムの乗っ取られ騒動で急遽設けられた、情報収集室で束の間の休憩をとっていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2946スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EF069EA7-DC32-4CC5-BC0B-9580493506ED","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2946","telop":"すると、誰が戸をノックする。\n「誰かしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2947スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"191CA8FE-71C9-413E-A733-CEC3C43BE6C9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2947","telop":"「にとりです。今、中に入っても大丈夫でしょうか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2948スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B14A42F3-F8D9-45D4-95AA-BDDC720D8D57","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2948","telop":"「ええ、どうぞ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2949スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"バウンス","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"60F7EBBB-07E0-40BE-9CCB-B7DB6A816BDA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2949","telop":"私がそういうと、彼女は戸を開け、入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2950スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"7F33FEA3-2AA1-470A-9097-F6C480DECCC8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2950","telop":"「紫様がおっしゃってた例の円球システムの乗っ取りは、一度解消され正常に戻りましたが、再び乗っ取られています。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2951スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"84DE0A9E-BE63-44B4-B60A-254DED3A4B5E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2951","telop":"「どこから不正アクセスされてるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2952スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"821BC847-4712-48F7-A688-F5FBEB678AC7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2952","telop":"「今現在も、アクセス元を調べていますが、\nなかなか特定できない状況です。そこで…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2953スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"9CBB0581-E994-44F0-B3AA-599F6ECC81CA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2953","telop":"私は、そこで唾を飲む。すると、彼女はヒソヒソとその内容を語った。それを聞いた私は、ある人物に電話をかけた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2954スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"C26530AB-A9CC-4584-86E4-9212C726362B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2954","telop":"僕たちが、その画面…東京の某所カメラ映像を見ていると、\nそのカメラに映っている人物が電話をかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2955スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"C23C0105-22BE-4539-A9B4-5D03069090B6","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2955","telop":"すると、霊夢のポケットから音が鳴る。\n僕は、霊夢に目で合図を送る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2956スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"92C149AD-B9B1-46C7-84EF-3E9B4FD07103","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2956","telop":"そして、霊夢が部屋から出ていくと、僕はあるニュース記事を映し出す。そして、同時進行でシステムのコードを書き換えていく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2957スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"23BEDDEE-75F4-4A79-A90F-78246D8A98AC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2957","telop":"すると、レミリアが話しかけてくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2958スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"0DC4C59D-9412-436E-9C40-414523C8A3D0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2958","telop":"「ねぇ、この記事に出てくる、幻想郷って何なの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2959スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"E4215BC7-5833-455F-A997-332931746CF0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2959","telop":"僕は、彼女の質問には、答えずに、\n彼女たちが見ている画面をスクロールしていく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2960スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"847D3B58-F381-4E60-BAF8-24473A61C580","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 2960","telop":"すると、彼女たちは、驚いた表情する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2961スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"5666568B-323C-4039-861E-5FE7EF860F4A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2961","telop":"「この記事は、幻想郷の地下深くを通るトンネルと、碓氷峠の地下を通るトンネルがつながったと記されています。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2962スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"E88F60BC-FA4B-493B-964A-636DB1A85509","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2962","telop":"「そして、この記事には、奥羽リニア新幹線のトンネルとつながり、自由に行き来できるとも記載されています。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2963スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"A077021C-1296-4060-976F-A593F9DECD43","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2963","telop":"「そして、この記事の公開日は3人の猛者が組んでできたゆかりん党が結束した日の1ヶ月後に公開されています。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2964スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"3EF38E9E-DEE9-422C-BD3E-FA2DC0337158","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2964","telop":"「実は、この記事の作者は、今僕が依頼した文さんで、おそらく、紫をはじめとしたゆかりん党と裏でつながってます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2965スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"F742D623-ECBA-4331-AC81-C23AEA6E0862","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2965","telop":"「その文さんが、その裏口を閉じて、紫さんたちを裏切ったと知れ渡れば、現内閣の崩壊は時間の問題でしょう。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2966スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"3E433DE9-B9D8-4E0E-85B6-EC96EC33D710","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2966","telop":"「もしかして、そこまであなたは考えて実行したの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2967スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"7CD85ED3-A20E-4772-B4F1-8922ABA80B23","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2967","telop":"「その文さんが、その裏口を閉じて、紫さんたちを裏切ったと知れ渡れば、現内閣の崩壊は時間の問題でしょう。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2968スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"5AE18329-2E85-459E-A955-F77DD6F03729","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2968","telop":"「じゃあ、紫たちは、このままだと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2969スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","id":"C10FD535-08A2-4A68-9E64-177D7B87379B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2969","telop":"すると、彼女たちの表情が変わる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2970スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","id":"B3547D67-B9F3-44C7-9D16-9EB5CD864D0C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2970","telop":"「僕は、政党を作ることはしません。だから内閣が崩壊しても、それは実質的なことで他者から見たら、変わりません。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2971スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","id":"9AE9FD39-8591-4260-AA0B-7A5A2E58D7B2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2971","telop":"「ですが、僕はこの国のシステムを直接操作、変更することで政党不要な新たな仕組みを築き上げます…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2972スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","id":"36332108-3799-4405-B8F2-CC0B70F751E4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2972","telop":"「おそらく、僕の同胞がいるので、その人たちで丸ごとシステムを操ることで、実権を直接握り締めます…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2973スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","id":"B24D24A8-8306-45C3-B48F-EF2F40F23C5A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2973","telop":"「ですので、紫さんたちを魔理沙さんたちから見たときは、これまで通りの状態なので、気にする必要なないですよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2974スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"B0989E7B-2CD5-4683-845C-EB0223E3D6FE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2974","telop":"「そう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2975スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"76D9E8D0-08D8-4340-BCC2-8480428B3CD1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2975","telop":"すると、霊夢が部屋に戻ってくる。「とりあえず一通りの作業は済んだので、魔理沙さんたちは自由に行動して大丈夫ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2976スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"494B459E-58AD-4BF7-901B-3564072FD869","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2976","telop":"「えっと…私は…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2977スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"0C9563C1-787E-49CF-B3DB-229DB871D420","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2977","telop":"「霊夢さんは過去の馬券の購入歴について、\n聞きたいことがありますから、僕とこの部屋に残りますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2978スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","id":"7FAFEA6F-0B5A-413E-A9F1-D8D9F23401BE","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2978","telop":"僕はそういうと、霊夢の手を握り、こちらに引き寄せる。\n「魔理沙さんたちは自由に動いて大丈夫ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2979スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D434C35D-9554-4B3A-A611-68439D715404","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2979","telop":"僕がそういうと、雰囲気で察したのか、魔理沙たちは、部屋から出ていき、部屋に残ったのは僕と霊夢の二人だけになった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2980スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"331DB602-D47D-4068-92BC-D77E213A4773","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2980","telop":"「さて、あなたがこれまで購入した馬券の内容と金額、購入日時について１から教えてもらいますか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2981スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D259B0F6-F0F7-4622-A1D8-DACBBC78A173","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2981","telop":"「あと、働いている時の愚痴や不満があれば、\nここで一緒に述べてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2982スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"5AA51EF6-97F1-4D67-A1D6-768CD173F17A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2982","telop":"それから、僕は彼女の馬券の購入履歴と内容、\n仕事に対する愚痴や不満と一つ一つ聞き取っていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2983スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A8622062-273F-4E61-88DD-EBB0F50CFC02","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2983","telop":"それからしばらく立ち二人は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2984スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"856239E4-0EBD-4EF1-A46C-BAC1742A320D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2984","telop":"「ねぇ、あんた、私の話、聞いてるの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2985スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1FF167D5-B256-45D1-9FB9-FAEE2D76643B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2985","telop":"僕は、そういう彼女の背後にそっと周り、\n片手で彼女の頭を撫でながら、片手を彼女の体に回す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2986スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C034B4F2-2330-4071-8583-1FFDDB75FD5A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2986","telop":"「あんた…それ…反則よ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2987スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FE91724D-63EB-4A5D-BFE4-1D4DF5DCDDC3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2987","telop":"「でも…もっと…そうなでて…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2988スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"54FBD1B3-126D-4E64-96ED-B39FB2F6E630","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2988","telop":"僕は、特に何かを言うこともなく、\nただ同じような体制で、彼女の頭をそっとなで続ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2989スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"093733F6-565E-4DBC-97A1-EFC37BA1BBDB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2989","telop":"すると、ふと霊夢が僕の腕にもたれかかる感覚を感じ、\nしっかりと支えながら、彼女の正面に回る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2990スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"DD5121C3-5956-43E3-8D11-5CE76945C0A5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2990","telop":"どうやら、彼女は頭を撫でられているうちに、寝落ちした様だった。僕はその彼女をそっと地面に横たわらせる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2991スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B37163C4-8AF8-44D0-9FFE-F62EC793BFC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2991","telop":"そして、僕は操作盤の前に立ち、先ほどのまでのコードの書き換えを進めていく。そして、数十分すると部屋の扉が開く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2992スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4746A8BE-9729-4FDA-9ECB-A373AD8FE5A3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2992","telop":"彼女は何かを言いかけるが、地面で気持ちよく眠る霊夢を見て、何かを思い出したのか、頬を赤らめる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2993スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"9EA2E277-41B4-401F-8627-D0A51408111A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2993","telop":"「依頼された記事は…、書き終わって投稿できました…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2994スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7A7BFA76-7504-45E0-AD73-17554C2B80C0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2994","telop":"「霊夢さんだけが、頭を撫でられて眠るなんて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2995スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"202389F8-BE8E-4791-BE85-A95F5C1FEF1A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2995","telop":"僕は、彼女の小言を聞き取ると、そっと背中に回り、霊夢と同じように、霊夢と同じ時間だけなでなでするのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2996スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"483B7755-CDE1-4DF4-AC25-9F1596191DF6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2996","telop":"そして、文も疲れたのか、眠りに落ち、僕はただ一人、操作盤の前に立つ、この国のシステムの大規模変更は始まったばかりだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2997スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D0A28354-45B3-4F4B-BD56-8446DB6BF6E6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2997","telop":"そして、同時にこれから、僕はある決断をしなければならず、\nその決断について考えを深めていくのであった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2998スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"03B05138-B53F-4DF9-B0CF-349F8D3F0C32","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2998","telop":"場面が変わり…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第2999スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"855244D8-828D-40B8-8E52-F1EC6EFBBC17","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 2999","telop":"私が、霊夢に電話をかけ、この問題は…異変だと言い、解決するように指示を出したが、一向に不正アクセスは実行され続ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3000スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C79C7799-3A0C-4299-8748-CEC1D5B9D63F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3000","telop":"すると、再び戸がノックされる。私は「どうぞ。」と返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3001スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"蘭","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"蘭","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E0211088-F25A-4A86-8E8F-45417EB6F52B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3001","telop":"「紫様…、あの射命丸文がこんな記事を先ほど投稿しまして…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3002スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"蘭","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"蘭","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"58BFB658-56B5-490D-86EE-B09097F0A5AA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3002","telop":"蘭は、印刷されたネットニュース記事をそう言いながら渡す。\nそのニュース記事には、あの記者会見は嘘つきだと書かれていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3003スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"蘭","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"蘭","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"04B96B95-EB46-465A-8A81-BC3E6D673724","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3003","telop":"「紫様…、これは文が紫様を裏切った…と言うことですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3004スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DF981D81-FC4B-4B72-BD08-8D1E1D31146E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3004","telop":"「ええ、そうなるわね。きっと私たちの見てない隙に、買収されたのよ…、巨漢党の置き土産である彼にね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3005スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"0D6617B1-D183-493A-84B5-9EFB6998655E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3005","telop":"「それと、彼のそばにいる霊夢の動きが見られない以上、彼女も彼に取られたことになるわ…、これは…私の失策よ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3006スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D278942C-72D3-4C1E-9B9F-243759A19BAA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3006","telop":"私たちがそんな話をしていると、\n誰かが部屋の戸を叩き入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3007スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"橙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"橙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"21741672-C554-46D3-8365-A72F90911243","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3007","telop":"「紫しゃま、さっき、沖縄からこんな文書が届いて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3008スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BBC469DF-2042-4BF9-BAA6-22370B7BCFD5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3008","telop":"橙はそう言うと、Faxで印刷された用紙を渡す。\nその用紙には、彼が提示したある内容が記されていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3009スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0CEB6061-8023-45A6-8512-2583AD3AFAEC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3009","telop":"「蘭、橙、覚悟はできているかしら…。」\n私は、そう二人、そして自らにも、問いかけた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"6EB165F9-5555-4E85-B3D2-FC2483A851BD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"次回予告","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3011スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4B5F0C53-0167-4AA7-A5C1-2A291E4C6D88","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3011","telop":"僕は、文と霊夢がすやすや寝ている横で、\nこの国、いや世の仕組みを１から作り替えていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3012スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"288AF2AE-F352-49F3-B501-E71A2503D91D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3012","telop":"すると、みとりがやってきて、僕に進捗を聞いてくる。\n僕は、彼女にある程度進んでいると答える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3013スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CA52F959-4748-4369-B4D2-1633A525EF00","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3013","telop":"僕は、さらに、システムの作り替えを進めていく。\nそして、先方からの連絡が入ると、沖縄を離れるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":20,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"CBCD2AAC-9033-43D2-9E23-9688B90A021B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3015スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"528381F1-1973-4615-AA9F-C3DB55AA0DB1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3015","telop":"私たちがこの部屋に戻ってくると、霊夢たちがなぜか、怒っていた。「私たちがいない間に、何があったんだ？」\n今回の迷シーン","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3016スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"AD9F6983-694A-455C-B5C1-8F9AE146F8DB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3016","telop":"「彼ったら、私たちが寝ている隙に、ささっと向こうに行ったのよ。私たちに、あんな体験させておいて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3017スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"54F93B1C-1C7F-4A85-83A3-1AAA073A808A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3017","telop":"「そうですよ。私たちに何も言わずに、東京に行ってしまった彼には、一言でもいいから、私たちを起こして欲しかったです…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3018スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"17C63BC4-F57E-4EB9-92F2-4241FF49BD6B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3018","telop":"私は、そんなことを言う二人に、ふっと笑いが漏れてしまう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3019スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B04FCFB0-37F6-4E49-B9B1-E8C143AD2E8D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3019","telop":"「なんで、あんたは笑ってるのよ、それに、みんなも…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3020スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"119D5450-2933-481E-83DE-8D631CBB7A62","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3020","telop":"「何だか、二人が駄々こねる子どもにそっくりだなって、\n感じたらふと、笑いが込み上げてくるぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3021スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7347CBC4-A2A5-4F29-A7FB-52A2B2ADA6C1","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3021","telop":"すると、二人は「あっ」と声を出して驚く。\n「どうしたんだ、急に声出して驚いて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3022スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"5ABE3D72-9427-4D12-83AA-B351DBB80564","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3022","telop":"「なんだか、恥ずかしいわ…、彼がいないと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"1C27EA22-3FBC-4824-A0D3-E6D913F0C831","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi　※前回の内容とは一部異なります。","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3024スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"06AD7081-0E3E-48C7-9711-216D3B2DC04D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3024","telop":"僕は、霊夢が寝静まった後、操作盤を触り続ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3025スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DF314D13-D626-4DD1-A533-3D017CA37BA4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3025","telop":"今、僕はこの国の、いや、\nこの世の中の仕組みを一から書き換えている。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3026スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6BA2B349-25FA-45B5-934F-6C9A740D2B34","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3026","telop":"僕は、文と霊夢の二人の寝顔を時折眺めながら、ふと考える。\nある種の覚悟を、僕は決めなければならない…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3027スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9DDBB09E-3C33-4EFE-BFDB-45FF5C059314","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3027","telop":"すると、誰かが部屋に入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3028スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BD974400-AFEB-4F5A-8504-C3C6DC900E22","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3028","telop":"「どこまで進んだのかしら、その作業は？」\n私は操作盤を触っている、彼に尋ねる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3029スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A1070C7F-50CC-43B2-B86E-3F388BE066E8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3029","telop":"「ある程度のペースで、進んでますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3030スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"34F8D344-1478-4CCF-A1B8-813C3E2E94EB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3030","telop":"「そう、それで、これからあなたはどうするの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3031スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D8D5C5C3-F4CD-4DD9-AB98-5A1236C79B1E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3031","telop":"「そうですね…」僕がそう呟いていると、円球から音が鳴る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3032スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C776D81E-0D86-47AE-9B4B-B167A4BBBA84","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3032","telop":"「東京の某所にいる人物からの着信です。応答しますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3033スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"619A7FAA-2B88-49BB-9D86-09C0DC6C52FC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3033","telop":"「応答してください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3034スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"410F54CC-212C-45F9-B628-96E3F559F22B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3034","telop":"僕がその着信に出ると、ある人物の声が流れる。\nするとその途端、彼女が驚きの表情を見せる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3035スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2852468F-2DAD-4B90-8CE0-C503A1B5659B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3035","telop":"僕は、その人物と、数分程度の電話を済ますと、\nそのままここを、離れる準備を始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3036スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3A4A3853-289D-45ED-8E6B-599D0C0EBB79","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3036","telop":"「これから、どこへ向かうのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3037スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7E1D3E01-338C-4DA0-90AF-9912F19D1F85","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3037","telop":"「敵地…とだけ言っておきましょうか、霊夢さんや、魔理沙さんたちには、元の生活に戻れたらいい…とだけ言ってください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3038スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7F41F2AC-A10E-4BCA-9CC0-0BF56A8F904E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3038","telop":"「分かりました…それと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3039スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9E660811-AADC-494B-B67F-558A692A7A5C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3039","telop":"「…出ていく前に一つお願いしてもいいですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3040スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"68ECB256-6B28-457F-A406-95453BC0A798","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3040","telop":"「それで、どんなお願いですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3041スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A4086C79-BB8E-4A3C-8378-261C4E50FAC7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3041","telop":"「私を島送りにしたことを絶対後悔しますよ…とだけ、\nあの青河童に言っておいてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3042スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A1D22AC4-B2EB-493D-B1FE-BD02262969AA","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3042","telop":"「分かりました、それじゃ、霊夢さんたちのことは任せます。」\n僕はそういうと、部屋から出ていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3043スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5F374E4C-0D92-474F-801D-D93C934C6B36","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3043","telop":"その頃、東京の某所では…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3044スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"B24CD44A-0F4C-42BF-AFD4-210D070FC3BB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3044","telop":"「紫様、例のFaxにある条件、本当に従うのですか？」\n私は、先ほどまでの電話を終えて、彼女にそう問いかける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3045スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"5822343B-5978-4B55-8214-578DF3ABABE1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3045","telop":"「ええ、そうよ。それが何か言いたいのかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3046スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"B3B2F9C5-5968-4B1B-84D7-AA48DDF89498","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3046","telop":"「その条件に従ったら、彼の支配下に入ることに許諾したことになりますよ。それで、よろしいのですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3047スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"FDA228F0-CCE4-4AF7-88CE-67E600D3A992","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3047","telop":"「それで、何かダメなことでもあるのかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3048スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"CC8CAC5C-679F-4958-B87A-CAA9C6090426","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3048","telop":"「確かにあの文書には、ゆかりん党の公約を実現すると、書いてありますが、彼がその公約を実現する保証はありませんよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3049スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"8EFD4F78-F9BE-40FD-AF84-F62CFF35C966","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3049","telop":"「私の立ち位置でこんなことを申し上げるのは失礼ですが、はっきり言って、条件に対する対価が良すぎる気がしますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3050スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"143D9976-9405-404D-926F-B46B9376699F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3050","telop":"「確かにそうね…でも、世論が傾いてしまった今、私たちにできることっていうのは、これくらいしかないわよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3051スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"0674295C-AA21-4FC3-B23D-BAB717906374","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3051","telop":"「確かに、そうですね…、でもはっきり言って、私は信用できませんよ、彼の条件は。十分な覚悟が入りますよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3052スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"AD7EE801-B7C3-4085-A0BA-6172D085905D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3052","telop":"「何てたって、私の押し売りで、パソコンを数週間前に送りつけた元顧客ですから…、その彼があんな条件を出すとは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3053スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"F0E653FA-9E9A-4EC1-8031-11CF195C8405","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3053","telop":"「何か、忘れていることはないかしら、にとり。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3054スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"37C28B04-B2F9-4209-9EC4-DB229FE4188A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3054","telop":"「それも承知の上ですよ。何より彼の存在には、島送りにした彼女も絡んでますから、理解した上で、ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3055スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"482865B9-E191-4CD7-BBF8-57D5E04B8C2E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3055","telop":"「そうね…」私がそういうと、戸がノックされる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3056スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"にとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"にとり","backgroundName":"nc212905_【背景】ビルの屋上.jpg","id":"7FE67143-A37C-4590-922E-217086D4D35F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3056","telop":"「私は、紫様が、どうなっても知りませんからね…」\n私はそう彼女に言い残すと、部屋から出ていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3057スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7BEDC8F4-629D-422B-99FF-3E126DC1AB80","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3057","telop":"すると、彼女と入れ替わるように、藍が入ってくる。\nそして、彼女のその言葉に、深呼吸をすると、部屋を出た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3058スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196984_書斎(夕).png","id":"236425D3-AB73-4BF2-A9B3-D79FDF79519A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3058","telop":"僕が、東京の某所に入ると、ある部屋に案内され、そこで、待たされる。そして、数分程度でその人物が入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3059スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc196984_書斎(夕).png","id":"EA6E8959-A937-407E-A7D3-B6469407A4D1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3059","telop":"「ようこそ…と言った方がいいかしら…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3060スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196984_書斎(夕).png","id":"BD6DE235-F9F8-4339-9FA8-6891B24B3626","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3060","telop":"「いえ、定型の挨拶は不要ですよ…総理。」\n僕は、そう彼女に返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3061スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc196984_書斎(夕).png","id":"C9261D0B-6FB4-416A-911B-94F4A6144BDE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3061","telop":"「そう、それじゃあ、早速本題を聞かせてくれるかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3062スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196984_書斎(夕).png","id":"DE530229-BDCD-4BAF-9B4D-C90990B259CB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3062","telop":"「ええ、いいでしょう。まず、手始めに…」\n僕はそう言い、小1時間程度のプレゼンを仕向けるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3063スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D42D3ABD-F2B5-4B80-AAEC-34AB80DA7312","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3063","telop":"一方魔理沙たちは…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3064スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0A1FB433-ED5A-4216-9240-68D28B66D876","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3064","telop":"私たちがこの部屋に戻ってくると、霊夢たちがなぜか、怒っていた。「私たちがいない間に、何があったんだ？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3065スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"8398F013-CEAC-4063-8D2E-FD2DF1BA4DDE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3065","telop":"「彼ったら、私たちが寝ている隙に、ささっと向こうに行ったのよ。私たちに、あんな体験させておいて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3066スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"175AB003-77F3-4DAE-963E-ADA0DEB999D9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3066","telop":"「そうですよ。私たちに何も言わずに、東京に行ってしまった彼には、一言でもいいから、私たちを起こして欲しかったです…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3067スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"563C1A7A-5434-4E25-AC2A-2192D7F15BF1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3067","telop":"私は、そんなことを言う二人に、ふっと笑いが漏れてしまう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3068スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"94E77645-D9BB-4809-A26B-77275038E372","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3068","telop":"「なんで、あんたは笑ってるのよ、それに、みんなも…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3069スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"DFE9EEF7-19E9-43A6-ADCC-641C515AF0A6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3069","telop":"「何だか、二人が駄々こねる子どもにそっくりだなって、\n感じたらふと、笑いが込み上げてくるぜ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3070スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C376331E-C901-4C38-8BE9-115A9AAD263B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3070","telop":"すると、二人は「あっ」と声を出して驚く。\n「どうしたんだ、急に声出して驚いて…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3071スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"6B15C088-7EE2-4515-A290-7BA17E250B49","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3071","telop":"「なんだか、恥ずかしいわ…、彼がいないと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3072スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CE623019-E3E7-42E5-A451-6707B94AE932","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3072","telop":"私は、彼女たちの会話を聞き、ふとある違和感を感じ、\n操作盤を触り、彼に関する情報を収集していた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3073スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"50D83268-566D-4067-8554-C478CD2C7CB7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3073","telop":"「霊夢さん、ちょっと、その話、詳しく聞かせてくれませんか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3074スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7D4D0891-048E-48EB-B5F3-D5F185438CD8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3074","telop":"「いいわよ。それで、どこから話せばいいのかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3075スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"29A02B67-98DD-4B1F-8921-CE75882E6F86","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3075","telop":"「彼が、そのような行動に出始めたきっかけや出来事です…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3076スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"0EAF1A2D-B87C-4EB5-BAEB-5072710E5231","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 3076","telop":"私がそう言うと、皆が驚いた表情をする。\nだが、一人一人がこうなったきっかけを語り始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3077スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CF476C0B-4192-413B-942A-CDD0F4596349","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3077","telop":"視点が戻り…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3078スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","id":"27FD5FA3-BA77-41A9-9C21-312EA24AFDB5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","title":"シーン 3078","telop":"僕と彼女はそれから、今後のことを話し合っていた。\nその話し合いをしているうちに、日は沈んでしまった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3079スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","id":"16BA00EF-0A1F-4B08-886D-EE6B5E534E31","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","title":"シーン 3079","telop":"気がつけば、時刻は夜の9時を超えていた。\n「こんな夜分にまで、ありがとうございました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3080スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","id":"DCF6FE1E-CD9F-4154-98B8-08206E89CE6C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","title":"シーン 3080","telop":"「いえいえ、貴方のご提案に、賛同させていただくことができ、ありがたいのこちらです。」私は、そう彼に返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3081スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","id":"8E0B26D7-57DF-4ACE-ADFB-32BCC2668245","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","title":"シーン 3081","telop":"「それで、すでに条件として掲示していた、\n居住要件は満たせているでしょうか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3082スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八雲紫","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","id":"7B2C80BE-597E-42F5-A443-507863B216A9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","title":"シーン 3082","telop":"「ええ、つい先ほど、小休憩中に連絡があり、私の手下たちは、皆撤退したとの、報告が上がってますので、ご安心ください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3083スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","id":"17ABE47B-C457-4291-951E-754529B7BBAF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","title":"シーン 3083","telop":"「そうですか…、ご対応ありがとうございます。\nそれで、これにて失礼させていただきます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3084スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","id":"9574BF06-8D8F-40C1-90F5-339D19B3DF4E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/nc196986_書斎(夜2).png","title":"シーン 3084","telop":"僕はそう言うと、あの家に戻るために部屋を出た。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3085スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"901EA225-F495-4096-864B-7A8FA88D03B4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3085","telop":"視点が再び変わり…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3086スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C0757315-B11E-4019-ACD2-3CB47C760776","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3086","telop":"私は、彼女たちに、部屋を割り振り、この部屋を去った後、しばし考え込んでいた。「彼が、あそこまで急成長するとは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3087スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2D37CA95-5107-4E06-B9F4-D9174FC930E6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3087","telop":"私は、彼女たちに、部屋を割り振り、この部屋を去った後、しばし考え込んでいた。「彼が、あそこまで急成長するとは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3088スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"489AEE9D-560C-40F5-AF93-9E145AC96387","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3088","telop":"そして、操作盤を触り、彼の情報を開く。いずれ彼は、彼女たちにとっても、この国にとっても欠かせない存在になる…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3089スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BCBF2A5F-8637-4064-9E66-B57CC5574925","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3089","telop":"そう感じさせるには、十分に値する情報量が、そこには表示されていた。すると、着信が入る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3090スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3C955D7D-2F08-4285-B268-4D9D74ADE65B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3090","telop":"「彼の番号から着信です、出ますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3091スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"88461104-A680-49D9-BAD4-276A3B958D17","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3091","telop":"「ええ、出て。」私がそう言い、着信に出ると、彼の声がする。\n「操夢さん、今どこにいますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3092スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7CF1C64D-35F8-4C42-BC0B-F4369BE38D40","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3092","telop":"「あの、交渉の後、無事に帰宅できたので、霊夢さんたちに、家に帰れるようになったと、伝えてほしくて。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3093スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EF9436DC-6B58-4101-B29B-8898871D7612","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3093","telop":"「そうですか、それで、何か疲労とかは感じますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3094スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EBF798CB-8226-436F-8F83-0C56A86F1449","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3094","telop":"「ええ、結構溜まってます。それと、こんな夜中に霊夢さんたちに電話かけるのは好ましくはないので…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3095スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F9C35355-5AF8-4C9A-BB6D-7DADB5A6519F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3095","telop":"「そうですか、それで、彼女たちにはどう伝えます？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3096スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CE75328B-6876-408F-AE37-573CF932C32D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3096","telop":"「彼女たちには、お昼の飛行機の予約とって、ポケベルにチケット送ったので、それを使って乗ってくれと言ってくれますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3097スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"763EA9F7-79C7-42E5-A5A5-715EF766D7A2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3097","telop":"「そうですか、承知しました。では、失礼します。」\n私はそう言うと、通話を切る。そして、操作盤を触る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3098スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B24ED683-AC83-48A1-A96A-B90E33F756B8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3098","telop":"確かに、彼の言っていた通り、彼女たちの名前で座席がとってあるようだった。「しかもこれ…トップシート…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3099スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"81DE161E-D618-4D0A-99F6-64555604B397","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3099","telop":"トップシートはYJAの中で最も運転室に近く、幅も広い、豪華で高価な席だ。「一体この出費はどこから…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3100スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"47A79B03-F1FD-4DD1-9570-F4DC483EA490","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3100","telop":"そして、あることを思い出す。そして、操作盤で調べると、霊夢さんが競馬で儲けたお金が充てがわれているようだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3101スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B0E53A03-B6A0-4F8C-B50C-1908405DFFCA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3101","telop":"私は、その始末を見て思わず、笑いをこぼす。\n「彼女の…自業自得ね…」っと。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3102スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D8404DE4-ADCC-4A40-8F62-771A2CF5D474","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3102","telop":"そして、私は、操作盤から離れると、自室に向かった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"91CD9554-6C58-4F70-BF4A-B0879D4CBCD9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"次回予告","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3104スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"C9BD3F2F-B223-44EA-88A3-98F81A0D1C51","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3104","telop":"僕は、その後よく眠り、一人目が覚めると、自室で朝食と身支度を済ませ、共同スペースに降りてくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3105スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"0F81CA85-DBB7-46B2-8212-5568B821948B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3105","telop":"そして、ぼーっとしているのも暇だと感じ、ふらっと外に出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3106スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7E83C96D-702B-4515-BA5E-5FF05A9808E9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3106","telop":"そして、その足取りのまま、着いたのは、空港だった。そして、空港を出歩いた後、到着ロビーで彼女たちを待つのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":20,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"C25A5D5F-3CA1-4EE8-B682-1A061AAA7650","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3108スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":6.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"84F11E4B-4D75-4A53-9466-0C793D17E508","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3108","telop":"「お姉様が言ってたんだけど、私たちは、その制度がなくなるなら、実家に戻るって…」私は、言いたいことを言えずにそう話す。\n今回の迷シーン","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3109スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"B1469E92-CAC0-4FCE-8D28-64DBF183B6FD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3109","telop":"「…、フランさんは、僕が誰かを選ぶなら…、いや、この質問は控えた方がいいですね…それで他には？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3110スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"7B5625A1-C3FE-4EE3-AF1D-FCABC200F4CA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3110","telop":"「私は…、それより、久々に血を飲ませてくれない？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3111スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"0010EFA5-C0A4-4796-B6A3-79C4CBAFB0DA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3111","telop":"「いいですよ。」僕はそう言うと、そっと彼女に背を向ける。\nすると、彼女がゆっくりと噛みつき、僕の血を吸い始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3112スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"6F8E2378-62C2-4217-BE6B-A8D73CBC4AC6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3112","telop":"そして、吸い終わると、僕は、ゆっくりと振り返り、彼女を見る。\n「それで、僕をここに呼んだ理由は…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3113スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"A403A6A9-BCA1-4979-A96C-77ED4D15CCBE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3113","telop":"「操夢…私と…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3114スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"2DB0859F-565D-4F18-9CFA-05A5F6461F5D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3114","telop":"「少しだけ、待っててもらえませんか、その返事…」\n僕は、予想通りの言葉に、そう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3115スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"BBF8726F-48C6-4690-91A7-2C5F4B538303","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3115","telop":"「分かった…。」私がそう返すと、彼はそのまま去ってった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"3836C4D3-66BF-46C1-9DCB-E1ADC20E9B96","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi　※前回の内容とは一部異なります。","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3117スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"F18D9883-7AC5-465C-92F9-B32310D3E7C7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3117","telop":"僕は、沖縄から帰ってくると、軽くシャワーだけ浴びて、そのままベッドに入り、眠った。そして、目が覚める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3118スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"151E826E-E7A0-448A-9CDB-B4A20F49D175","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3118","telop":"そして、廊下にくると、冷蔵庫を開け、ふと卵を手に取り、冷凍庫から冷凍ご飯を取り出し、レンチンする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3119スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F37C8E2B-8C94-42B2-932B-0644F3503D7D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3119","telop":"そして、棚から食器と醤油と箸を出すと、レンチンしたご飯を食器に入れ、さっき出した卵をわり、箸でかき混ぜて運ぶ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3120スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"1C3E8172-D60F-44A8-B74A-A3D650465863","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3120","telop":"そして、中央にあるテーブルの上で、卵かけご飯を食べる。\nそして、数分程度で食べ切り、後片付けを済ます。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3121スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","id":"C390A1A3-BF38-4957-9431-1CDBDB9D4284","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3121","telop":"そして、身の回りの確認を済ますと、共同スペースに降りる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3122スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"FF5C1104-FF6D-43D8-90D1-ECEC1178CC09","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3122","telop":"そして、共同スペースに降りると、冷蔵庫の中身をチェックする、どうやら、食材が入ったまま放置されていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3123スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"5E746F44-93F8-45CF-A07D-80852364AB86","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3123","telop":"念の為に、消費期限と賞味期限を見ると、何個か切れているものがあり、僕は、それらを順々に自室の冷蔵庫に運び込む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3124スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"BFFE6D71-FF9D-4A10-AF98-ACAE33F7A8C4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3124","telop":"そして、それが終わると、ふと窓の外を見る。\nそして、今の時間を見ると、朝の9時だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3125スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"767631FA-D790-4C8A-A370-29B0828A8FB7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3125","telop":"僕は、暇な時間に何しようか、そう考えながら、\n何気ない足取りで、家を出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3126スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B00BC2F7-4FCE-4D17-A9C9-5B212BE1FE48","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3126","telop":"そして、ふと最寄駅に来ると、到着放送が流れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3127スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"55F2EB63-28D7-437E-9910-1B7285F1DBAE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3127","telop":"「まもなく、埼玉本線、普通、高崎行きが参ります。危ないですから、黄色い線の内側までお下がりください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3128スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1A8847FB-CE7F-4D84-AE86-D844D7CA3FA4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3128","telop":"僕は、その列車に、そのまま乗り込んだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3129スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"272B1B1C-1AF4-4667-9C22-784E79278C86","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3129","telop":"そして、大宮駅の地上ホームに来て、\nしばらく経つと、到着放送が流れる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3130スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FBD3F7F3-F671-4B3A-B9B2-E7BC6C59AF03","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3130","telop":"「まもなく、さいポートエクスプレス、羽田空港行きが参ります。危ないですから、黄色い線の内側までお下がりください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3131スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C8E1651F-99CC-4FDA-8364-DF2042775816","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3131","telop":"「この列車は、全車普通車グリーン席です。\n乗車には普通乗車券の他に、グリーン券が必要です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3132スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6FE83D02-0F63-47C0-8604-BD1AA8339879","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3132","telop":"「グリーン車には、指定席はありません。ポケベルチケットもご利用いただけます。紙のチケットは車内で販売中です。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3133スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8EAC5AD9-9BEF-411F-8D78-318879E280BE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3133","telop":"「途中の停車駅は、新宿のみです。上野、東京方面には参りませんので、ご注意ください。まもなく到着します。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3134スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"903A72BF-3AE5-42F8-83DF-501E7A0579F1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3134","telop":"僕は、その列車が来ると、さっそく乗り込み、\nポケベルにチケットを追加してから、席についた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"270622AE-1E3C-4319-AE40-FC153F4CBAE3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"その頃、霊夢たちは…","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3136スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F1E7063F-96A8-4AD5-8D1B-4A7585A2713C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3136","telop":"私たちは、目が覚めると、この部屋に集まっていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3137スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"965BC06D-0872-471E-8F81-B40A983C3E3A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3137","telop":"「霊夢さんたちが寝静まった後、彼から連絡が来て、無事に帰宅でき、霊夢さんたちのポケベルにチケットも入れたようです。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3138スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"72D9FA2E-EB91-4A8D-9130-53BBE40CC0DB","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3138","telop":"「えっ？」私は、彼女の言葉に驚かされる。\n「そんな簡単に、帰宅できたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3139スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6A734806-FD15-4D6D-9870-DC333D8C6C5D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3139","telop":"「ええ、あと文さんに関しては、元の家に戻るか、既存の空き部屋に住むか、選んで欲しいと、今朝メッセージで来ました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3140スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EE939671-6F9B-47DE-975B-B79F66325C57","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3140","telop":"「ねぇ、ところで、その飛行機の時間は？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3141スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3ED7598F-73CD-46F7-AAD1-E9AF0EC1AE3E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3141","telop":"「えっと…」私はそう言い、昨晩見ていた彼女たちのチケットを確認する。「12時ちょうどに那覇から出るYJA便ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3142スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AD54EC86-A04D-4037-9D26-69DADB44F2EC","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3142","telop":"私はそれを聞き、ハッとしポケベルを確認する。\nそこには、10時30分とあった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3143スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"古明地さとり","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"FE944BEF-28CE-4731-A52F-59711FC786B9","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3143","telop":"「そんなに慌てなくても、大丈夫ですよ。\nこの施設は、空港に直結してますから、案内しますね。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3144スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"90EF181E-B640-4F7F-9C79-7D8993AC1A57","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3144","telop":"私たちは、少し不安になりながら、\n彼女の案内に沿って、空港へと移動するのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3145スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8528C363-80A2-4AAF-A4D8-8177F7FE0474","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3145","telop":"彼に視点が戻り…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3146スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E7507F3F-9FEF-43C9-B022-8F20F47BCA59","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3146","telop":"僕は、空港に着くと、空港内のショッピングモールに来ていた。\n僕は、そのままさまざまなお店を見ながら歩く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3147スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3BEAD1BB-6581-471D-B367-1DAB1E31346F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3147","telop":"そして、ふと見かけたゲームセンターに入る。そして、ふと小銭がないことを思い出し、ATMに向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3148スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B00C9CFC-678E-4213-8A86-C611BDBE4A9C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3148","telop":"そして、ATMで残高を確認し、0が4つ入った、お札を5枚出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3149スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A86F4757-C609-451A-92E0-4117235182D2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3149","telop":"そして、数千円分の小銭を出すと、その小銭が尽きるまでの小1時間ほど、過ごすと、ゲームセンターを出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3150スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"025A16F0-0B24-4320-91C4-62014E72A308","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3150","telop":"そして、僕は、スーパーを探す。そして、スーパーで共同スペースの冷蔵庫の中身を思い出しながら、食材を買い、発送する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3151スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6468C4D2-9DF8-4999-9E7D-F9ABD4C2A274","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3151","telop":"そして、そのまま僕は到着ロビーに向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3152スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"73C6AD79-C580-47EB-86E7-1EB9590A4EF8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3152","telop":"そして、到着ロビーに来ると、彼女たちを待つ。\nそれから、数十分程度で彼女たちが現れた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3153スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"449DABB5-B352-4E86-94D7-857EDE122844","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3153","telop":"「あんた、私たちを迎えに来たの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3154スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"41520C0A-BFB7-4725-8BC2-933A15273C2F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3154","telop":"「そうですよ、それでトップクラスの居心地はどうでしたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3155スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"4DB150C5-F07E-4267-8999-FFD46716EE45","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3155","telop":"「すごかったわよ…、\nそれよりそのお金…、どうやって出したの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3156スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3545D61E-3C26-43D7-8660-2440DC695EF7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3156","telop":"僕は、彼女がそういうと、\nさっと彼女のそばにより、耳打ちする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3157スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"54E4073D-74CF-45DA-B7CE-FA043E822DA6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3157","telop":"「それ、むやみに口外するんじゃないわよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3158スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"2EEB433A-3D60-467B-9E69-76C699F226E4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3158","telop":"「そういうってことは、認めるってことですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3159スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F2837CA2-0CF6-4141-8F17-2C78C5C11F01","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3159","telop":"「ええ…」私はそう言いかけ、ハッとする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3160スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"881566F8-798A-4267-B456-62EE80D53DBF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3160","telop":"「言わなくても、あんたなら分かるわよね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3161スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"D5F4197E-0FE6-4472-9B36-618EE3BAE828","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3161","telop":"「ええ、そうです…とでも言っておきましょうか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3162スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F13E2B2E-2283-4830-9552-75BD184FF464","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3162","telop":"それから皆で家に戻り…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3163スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"C0644E3D-C417-4F0B-A1EE-DBE99C8104FD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3163","telop":"僕たちが文と別れ、家に帰ってくると、共同スペースには、夕陽が差し込んでいた。そして、各々が自分の部屋に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3164スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"6CE1BBB3-59F7-4F50-8FC3-968AEB844DC0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3164","telop":"僕は、自分の部屋に戻ってくると、ふとこれからのことを考える。もし、彼女たちから一人だけ選ぶなら誰にしようか…と。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3165スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"3047C32B-B0B0-45BF-A9A6-9A34679AE751","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3165","telop":"今は、まだ包括的婚約の制度があるから、問題は起きないが、紫と結んだ条件には包括的婚約は廃止と記載した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3166スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"EBCC57EC-3801-4CF0-A29A-04127DD02AD7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3166","telop":"そして、これまで、数多の優遇措置も無くなる。\nそして、僕は、彼女たちの中から、一人だけ選ぶことになる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3167スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"FCADB0D1-6796-4ED7-8163-8C919C0CF84E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3167","telop":"そんなことを考えていると、ポケベルが光る。\nそこには、フランからのメッセージだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3168スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"65AC29E8-F3F5-4175-ABF4-5CE27D8A8EEF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3168","telop":"「わざわざ、メッセージを送らずに、直接来ればいいのに…」\n僕は、そう呟きながら、部屋を出て、玄関に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3169スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc254861_マンションの外廊下（夕方）.jpg","id":"BCF71E88-CEF8-4783-A5C4-EFAE88D41028","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3169","telop":"そして、フランの部屋の入り口に来ると、インターホンを鳴らす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3170スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc254861_マンションの外廊下（夕方）.jpg","id":"AF08121D-00D2-4387-A0CB-66D86B55CB3A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3170","telop":"「一緒に、部屋の中に入ろうよ、操夢。」\n私は、そう言いながら、彼を部屋に招く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3171スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"00969957-D242-4F66-AF42-0C14E0CAB7F4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3171","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢…、飛行機の中で、包括的婚約が廃止されるってニュース見たんだけど…、それって本当なの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3172スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"E721E523-C1A7-4CF4-A999-DA6DC7FB2B91","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3172","telop":"「ええ、そうですよ。僕が、提示した条件に、含まれていたし、彼女も、いずれ廃止する予定だったと言ってましたから。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3173スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"B1E548CE-B3F2-45C9-8FA6-BA32C66A0AC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3173","telop":"「そう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3174スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"BB2C2440-E8F4-46DE-8517-412CE1CBEE6E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3174","telop":"「それで、それがどうかしたんですか…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3175スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"85A32F76-3201-4D8B-BB19-C498041FA831","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3175","telop":"「お姉様が言ってたんだけど、私たちは、その制度がなくなるなら、実家に戻るって…」私は、言いたいことを言えずにそう話す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3176スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"258546F4-C7A9-44D5-ABBD-7E9CB5BCE881","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3176","telop":"「…、フランさんは、僕が誰かを選ぶなら…、いや、この質問は控えた方がいいですね…それで他には？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3177スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"C70D0C0F-4930-4309-B1F4-937018D0639E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3177","telop":"「私は…、それより、久々に血を飲ませてくれない？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3178スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"160679B0-D2D4-4AA0-9ED0-3B4B6BBAEE21","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3178","telop":"「いいですよ。」僕はそう言うと、そっと彼女に背を向ける。\nすると、彼女がゆっくりと噛みつき、僕の血を吸い始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3179スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"D0F3D425-7E0F-4E2E-9FE2-014C71FB55AC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3179","telop":"そして、吸い終わると、僕は、ゆっくりと振り返り、彼女を見る。\n「それで、僕をここに呼んだ理由は…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3180スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"13BDCA4F-968F-40C0-BC23-2EAFEB979C0C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3180","telop":"「操夢…私と…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3181スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"6C1EE7A2-D343-4610-B140-1D48CA3DBC0D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3181","telop":"「少しだけ、待っててもらえませんか、その返事…」\n僕は、予想通りの言葉に、そう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3182スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"EDED262E-A5C8-43E9-A481-5DA6679EC16F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3182","telop":"「分かった…。」私がそう返すと、彼はそのまま去ってった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3183スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc254861_マンションの外廊下（夕方）.jpg","id":"A2713E51-B151-4656-9DEE-17546E201913","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3183","telop":"僕は、彼女の部屋から出ると、\n1度深呼吸をして、そのまま共同スペースに降りていく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3184スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"70FCC7CE-DA52-4026-A58E-F1CADB991A2A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3184","telop":"「どうしたんですか…そんな表情をして。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3185スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"7C0D17B4-8333-4BBA-80D1-2086BF90C08B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3185","telop":"「…何でもないです。」僕は、そう言い、大きく伸びをすると、そのまま窓から外に視線を向ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3186スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"5159A2F0-4EF7-458C-8773-A5E046D6C1A8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3186","telop":"そして、ある言葉を呟く。\n「今日は、夕陽がいつもより、強く感じますね…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3187スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A554229D-E3F3-40EC-B128-AC3AE390ADD5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3187","telop":"私は、彼の言葉にふと、作業の手が止まってしまう。\n「確かに…、そうですね…」私はもどかしくなり、そう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3188スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"6FD8FC7B-3405-40D7-B19B-E66AA629CB4D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3188","telop":"「咲夜さん…、あとは僕が作りますから、部屋で休んでて大丈夫ですよ。こっち帰ってきてばっかで疲れるだろうし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3189スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"3E4235FC-313E-4CCE-BB98-A3D9DD7DE73E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3189","telop":"「分かりました…、じゃあ、自室で休ませてもらいます。」\n私はそう言うと、作業を切り上げて、階段を上がっていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3190スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"2489D6B3-B4ED-4651-B4CC-4F96F3C2D0B1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3190","telop":"僕は、一人、共同キッチンで彼女が進めていた料理の続きを進めていく。すると、上から誰かが降りてくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3191スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"2906E584-CDFC-44D7-AAB7-7A6182508995","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3191","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢、さっき咲夜と階段ですれ違ったら、気まずそうにしてたけど…、私の決断が影響してるのかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3192スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"16097890-9835-4497-8F6B-D60DE2E8EC98","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3192","telop":"「それは…きっと疲れてるからだと思いますよ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3193スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"FCB19B35-6F6B-48E1-82A5-A9E76E7F4891","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3193","telop":"「そうかしら…」私がそう言っていると、ふと空腹感が湧く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3194スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"6A1275F3-7751-4D8B-867E-3C7E1431FC05","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3194","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢、あなたの血、飲ませてくれないかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3195スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"1B26BCCB-0C7A-4EAD-9465-E1F6BDFD1916","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3195","telop":"「いいですよ。」僕はそう言うと、作業を止め、彼女のそばに移動し、彼女に背を向ける。すると、彼女が噛み付く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3196スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"63A3CE86-3051-47C4-979E-284235C6585F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3196","telop":"「ありがとう、操夢…。私は…、部屋に戻るわ…」\n私はそう言うと、上に上がっていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3197スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"9A5339BA-6D8A-4A0F-B320-3FE64460B52C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3197","telop":"僕は、彼女がいなくなると、少しふらつく足取りを、何とか平常に戻しながら、中断した作業の続きをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3198スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"26A46DEA-93B8-4AB2-9FDC-E23B4830DFEB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3198","telop":"そして、ふと階段から誰かが降りてくる音がし、\n手を止めて、階段の方を見る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3199スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"CB8D8C50-A662-4219-A2F5-CD1813582EFF","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3199","telop":"僕は、さとりの姿を一目見ると、その場で崩れるように倒れた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"B1D62164-B25C-4CB0-8072-2D5AAC297EA8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"次回予告","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3201スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"C0468566-F069-4202-98C7-08708BE9370F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3201","telop":"僕は、目が覚めると、そこは、病室だった。\nそして、僕は、共同スペースで倒れたことを思い出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3202スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"FF881887-DB96-4FAA-85C7-9E33301FD184","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3202","telop":"すると、誰かが病室に入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3203スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"4F194E75-5CDC-4C2C-8152-E2774E01CC94","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3203","telop":"そして、その人は、僕が目覚めたことを誰かに伝えにいった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":20,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"0EE318CE-7E71-471A-8895-EEE8C9C1FF49","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3205スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"53D1F5FB-9D70-401A-AEEE-8490EF0646A3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3205","telop":"僕はそれから、自室で荷物の整理をした後、帰りの道中で買ってきた、小さな箱をポケットに入れ、その部屋のフランの部屋のインターホンを鳴らす。\n今回の迷シーン","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3206スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1BACF611-F437-4F40-8AD6-30BBC3719BB8","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3206","telop":"「操夢、もう帰ってきたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3207スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7DC751C3-1F6C-403D-8AE2-61B9C719EB45","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3207","telop":"僕はその質問には、答えずに、\nポケットからそれを取り出し、開ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3208スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"96137E3D-8545-4622-9299-F153EAC9AB17","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3208","telop":"すると、彼女の頬がみるみるうちに頬照っていく。\n「…フランさん、いやフランドールさん。僕と…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3209スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5C18FDA7-58E7-427F-B496-3AD7E66FF7DF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3209","telop":"「私こそ…よろしくお願いします…」\n私は彼のプロポーズに、そう改まった口調で返すのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3210スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9C955548-32DB-4D14-B497-E0878CD16473","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3210","telop":"私は、ふと玄関を開けると、向こうでは、彼が指輪をフランに渡しているところだった。「うっ…」私はすぐに玄関を閉じる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"07C580E2-59F3-409C-BE7B-3F27B460BBDA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3212スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"A7EC2748-002D-46D7-8445-E4FDD2D36010","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3212","telop":"「んっ…」僕はふと目が覚めると、そこは病室だった。\nそして、レミリアの吸血の後、倒れたことを思い出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3213スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"453F2A21-5AD0-4AEC-A54B-8952543231EA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3213","telop":"すると、誰かが病室の扉をノックする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3214スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"53CFBBAE-15D4-470C-BB38-82734450F55A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3214","telop":"僕は「入ってどうぞ」と返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3215スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"42F2930F-FF8B-4D23-A7BC-86F5E2351F23","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3215","telop":"すると、入ってきたのは以前に、検査の担当だった人だった。\n「たしか、妹紅さんでしたっけ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3216スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"藤原妹紅","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"藤原妹紅","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"07B12B04-9259-4BCF-B3E9-A52E8C0BD1EA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3216","telop":"「ああ、そうだ。なぜ君は、またここにきたんだい？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3217スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"C727339F-8771-4A10-838D-867F3EBA6C58","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3217","telop":"「ちょっとした事情で貧血で倒れてしまって…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3218スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"藤原妹紅","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"藤原妹紅","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"C1663DD0-EB0F-4A59-8660-2617B17CB037","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3218","telop":"「そうか…、とりあえず、永琳に、起きたっていうから、そのままベッドの上で大人しく、待っててくれ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3219スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"5A15C33C-40F1-463F-9351-006C46A6AE91","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3219","telop":"「分かりました…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3220スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"874D4670-F231-482E-A011-8B08EF664485","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3220","telop":"僕がそういうと、その人は去っていった。\n僕は、ふと窓から外見る。「今日は、月がよく見えるな…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3221スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"8A3EDC16-2FCA-4FC3-8FEC-5DE6B3139B7A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3221","telop":"そんなことを僕は、そう呟く。\nすると、病室の扉が再びノックされ、誰かが入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3222スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八意永琳","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八意永琳","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"BE8E388A-FE49-4ED5-A22E-16E20D8FF397","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3222","telop":"「こんばんは、操夢さん。体調は大丈夫ですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3223スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"35AE6EB2-F338-4EB6-A602-02050705CF85","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3223","telop":"「ええ、倒れた時に比べたら、良くなりました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3224スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八意永琳","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八意永琳","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"3222CAC4-5AC5-463E-B252-BC51C82FA8B1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3224","telop":"「そう、ならよかったです。とりあえず、今晩は安静にしてください。日が昇り出したら、再び声をかけますから。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3225スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"9686ED8F-637B-498B-858F-82227722AB37","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3225","telop":"彼女はそういうと、部屋は静まり返る。\nそして、僕はふと夕方のフランとの会話を思い出す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3226スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"01B817E1-2BA0-444A-9C8E-DF8F1F5EF16D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3226","telop":"「お姉様が言ってたんだけど、私たちは、その制度がなくなるなら、実家に戻るって…」私は、言いたいことを言えずにそう話す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3227スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"00858427-32C7-44DC-9FA1-AFC0897E5FBA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3227","telop":"「…、フランさんは、僕が誰かを選ぶなら…、いや、この質問は控えた方がいいですね…それで他には？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3228スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"D8E7D5E8-DF54-45E8-BB4F-D85EAAC69E05","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3228","telop":"「私は…、それより、久々に血を飲ませてくれない？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3229スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"BE0850BA-72AF-4AA5-B9B4-589251256564","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3229","telop":"「いいですよ。」僕はそう言うと、そっと彼女に背を向ける。\nすると、彼女がゆっくりと噛みつき、僕の血を吸い始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3230スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"3A5F19B7-D908-44D8-8C74-ECB92A4F6EDB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3230","telop":"そして、吸い終わると、僕は、ゆっくりと振り返り、彼女を見る。\n「それで、僕をここに呼んだ理由は…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3231スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"39571563-F4F0-4A0C-A4DA-75E4975CA096","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3231","telop":"「操夢…私と…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3232スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg","id":"05ED82E1-A8BC-4FEF-A8F2-B6CD96087A02","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3232","telop":"「少しだけ、待っててもらえませんか、その返事…」\n僕は、予想通りの言葉に、そう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3233スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"7AD12AD6-0922-441F-A4AC-7A3DFF74DE95","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3233","telop":"あのときは、ああ返した。そして、再び考える。もし、彼女たちの中から1人選ぶのならば…もっと考慮すべきことはあるが…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3234スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"542EF735-8344-4B61-A315-6DF16067DC54","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3234","telop":"「やっぱり、僕の初めてだったフランかな…」\n僕はそう呟く。僕の意見は決まりかけていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3235スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"970473B2-6BAD-4A17-A435-FBBA8616FD88","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3235","telop":"そして、その意見を後押しするための理由を考える。「霊夢さんは、魔理沙さんにお願いして、あの癖を直せば大丈夫…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3236スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"961EB904-8977-48B3-BD46-BC94A1C69D67","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3236","telop":"「こいしさんとさとりさんは、特に問題はない…」\nそこまで考えて、フランたちのことを考える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3237スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"9AC8C715-E41C-411F-BD7B-DD4583FE5A78","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3237","telop":"「フランさんたちは、定期的に血液の供給が必要…、そして尚且つ、フランさんは夕方に…、僕に告白をした…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3238スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"A410B676-BE67-456B-A65A-B121ABA1488C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3238","telop":"僕は、そこまで考えると、フランの告白を拒絶する必要はなかった、「レミリアさんたちは…まぁ、何とかなるか…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3239スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"8095E275-5188-4EC5-828E-CEA5B137A996","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3239","telop":"僕は、そう独り言を呟き、そして、決心する。\n「退院したら、フランさんに返事を返さないと…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3240スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","id":"A6378EDD-CDBD-4C67-AE14-086922145564","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3240","telop":"僕はそう呟くと、ゆっくりと枕に頭を預け、そのまま目を閉じる。すると、疲れが取れてなかったのか、そのまま寝落ちした。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3241スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3172BA87-60B1-40B4-BDC0-7AE1B0178C21","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3241","telop":"翌朝になり…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3242スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"82B83E92-FFDA-4919-BA1E-2487E2770272","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3242","telop":"僕は、ふと目が覚めると、窓から朝日が差し込んでいた。\nそして、大きく伸びをすると、あくびをする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3243スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"D24ABB81-5C4D-41C6-B85A-044FF7ECC142","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3243","telop":"すると、誰かが部屋をノックして、入ってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3244スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八意永琳","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八意永琳","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"B8BF8BC9-25F5-4C80-8BC4-3A883B2ACF01","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3244","telop":"「おはようございます、昨晩はよく眠れましたか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3245スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八意永琳","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八意永琳","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"D266F818-F294-4BA9-818C-2476599514EA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3245","telop":"「ええ、よく眠りました。体調もかなり良くなりました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3246スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"八意永琳","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"八意永琳","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"51951747-1DAB-4EEF-8F44-459BE11C4002","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3246","telop":"「そうですか…、これから検査のために、廊下に担当者を待機させてますから、その人から検査を受けてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3247スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","id":"94F4D64A-F53C-40D7-84B5-70700FF23DB6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3247","telop":"彼女はそういうと、挨拶を済まし、去っていった。僕は、ゆっくりとベッドから降り、病室を出ると、検査を受けるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3248スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"14B47744-4DC1-4A86-821A-FACA66E74918","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3248","telop":"検査が終わると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3249スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8D238953-50BA-44EF-A517-A0C4E5074D9E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3249","telop":"僕はあれから、検査を終えると、退院の許可がおり、そのまま家に帰ってきた。そして、共同スペースに入る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3250スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"4D2C782C-5EF8-4FEC-835A-1B34170A09DB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 3250","telop":"「もう帰ってきたのですか、操夢さん？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3251スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","id":"833AAAA1-5EE9-4830-8FB8-D045FC0C5EA9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","title":"シーン 3251","telop":"「ええ、今朝病院で検査を受けたら、\n退院許可が出たので、そのまま帰ってきました。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3252スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"16A24004-5667-4658-AF51-A92AA3687AA0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 3252","telop":"「そうですか…、それで昼食は…？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3253スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"58ADBE5F-E4FB-493D-A077-841FD257BA0B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 3253","telop":"「帰りの道中に駅そば食べてきたので、大丈夫ですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3254スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","id":"D30725A5-8B81-4035-8DA4-2F0B6296241E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","title":"シーン 3254","telop":"「そうですか。わかりました。」\n私はそういうと、作業に戻るのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3255スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":6.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2F7AB36A-2D0F-4442-B042-48598DB0D1FD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3255","telop":"僕はそれから、自室で荷物の整理をした後、帰りの道中で買ってきた、小さな箱をポケットに入れ、その部屋のフランの部屋のインターホンを鳴らす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3256スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"C6F4625B-4241-4C0F-B5DA-896557D2FD4C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3256","telop":"「操夢、もう帰ってきたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3257スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B8CF311F-95B2-44D4-A4C2-3215D33F00E4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3257","telop":"僕はその質問には、答えずに、\nポケットからそれを取り出し、開ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3258スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"051C79EC-A727-41C4-81FA-77C4E20FB10D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3258","telop":"すると、彼女の頬がみるみるうちに頬照っていく。\n「…フランさん、いやフランドールさん。僕と…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3259スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"753FBF10-9174-4F10-A235-D2805AC8967D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3259","telop":"「私こそ…よろしくお願いします…」\n私は彼のプロポーズに、そう改まった口調で返すのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3260スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5DE4180F-8992-402C-B5C0-CBB7C9051ECA","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3260","telop":"私は、ふと玄関を開けると、向こうでは、彼が指輪をフランに渡しているところだった。「うっ…」私はすぐに玄関を閉じる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3261スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"801D29AF-33CB-412A-BF1E-525F32AAA3BD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3261","telop":"今までの生活の中でうっすらと感じていた、その感覚が現実となってしまった今、私は閉じた玄関扉を叩きながら考える。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3262スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":6.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F4F4377D-59F3-4B2B-AFE8-8ED9463C579C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3262","telop":"この共同生活が始まるまでは、自室にこもっていた彼女が、私の目の前で、あんな表情している…、私は、そんな現実に、喘ぎ声が出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3263スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"5898484F-1001-4EF8-A69D-C8F72084164B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3263","telop":"それまでは、私は、屋敷の中でトップの立ち位置で、彼女はいつも私の下だった。「なのに…、なのに…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3264スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2CB084B1-47BC-4360-BC42-CE3B49D1D645","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3264","telop":"私は気がつけば、目から涙が溢れ、止まらなくなっていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3265スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6C8D72AB-DF9C-41FF-B207-24C7E36E1D7D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3265","telop":"その頃咲夜は…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3266スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"521C856C-5883-4AAC-9CB4-BAAECF065943","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3266","telop":"私は、彼が上に上がっていくその様子を見て、決心がついたのだとわかる。そして、その後から上からの物音が響く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3267スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"1CF674B3-27B8-4BBD-B790-396705D9BF77","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3267","telop":"「この音から聞こえるとして…お嬢様の部屋…」私はそう呟くと、この生活では使ってなかった能力で、時間を止める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3268スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpeg","id":"D4E64ED5-6707-4EC5-B1D8-D2FFA855E09A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3268","telop":"そして、時間を止めると、そのまま彼女の部屋に直行する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3269スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0D321C47-8109-4454-903E-DDD2F292A9CD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3269","telop":"すると、案の定、お嬢様が、泣き喚いていた。\n私は、そんな彼女の後ろにたち、そっと頭を撫でる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3270スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"7DC3A577-F9D2-4EDB-9831-F1F9250321C7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3270","telop":"そして、私は時間停止を解除した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3271スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B65CBC15-8691-4594-8CC1-B6B747E64BC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3271","telop":"そのころ、パチュリーは…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3272スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"CA1C359B-2F71-4F3C-BE25-74AC53230FFF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3272","telop":"私は、泣き喚いているであろうレミリアの部屋と、比較的静かだかが、笑い声が漏れるフランの部屋にはまれたこの部屋にいた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3273スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"FEA85E85-D929-4621-B78F-80F3259DF2B3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3273","telop":"「だれか、もし彼にいなくなってほしくないなら、積極的に行動しなさいと、飛行機で告げたのに…」私はそう愚痴をこぼす。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3274スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":6.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8C067AC0-A553-44E6-BE60-D262A4CD0DA9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3274","telop":"それは、沖縄からの帰りの飛行機での話だった。ちょうど那覇を離陸して10分程度経つと通路を跨いで反対側にいた彼女が聞いてきた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3275スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3E32809D-5D80-446B-91E6-D4CA31972EF7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3275","telop":"「ねぇ、パチェ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3276スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F1D519D9-3A14-40D6-9E21-4B22F0C464B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3276","telop":"「どうしたの、レミリア？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3277スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1ACCA28C-D0C3-4B6F-ABB1-22A03137A913","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3277","telop":"「もし、包括的婚約がなくなるなら、彼はどうするのかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3278スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"313314F6-7BCB-4FD1-923F-6F007A923194","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3278","telop":"「彼が、誰か一人を選ぶじゃないかしら、何か不安なの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3279スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7FD3FC22-17DF-4A84-876A-8EB954933178","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3279","telop":"「もし、フランと彼が結ばれたら…って考えて不安で…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3280スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D9650F8B-CBEE-46C7-B392-A69769A729EA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3280","telop":"「それなら、あなたが彼に告白すればいいじゃない。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3281スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"43602208-D9E0-4012-AA8D-81F723170913","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3281","telop":"「そう…、でもどうすればいいのかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3282スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"43996924-E0CC-47DC-AE32-6B3C8D2FF700","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3282","telop":"「そうね…、彼と離れたくないなら、積極的に動くべきよ。」\n私がそういうと、後ろで寝てたフランの目が覚めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3283スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"4288BAA8-6B7E-4558-BC0F-CF7578E9ADEF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3283","telop":"「まぁ、きっと、咲夜が慰めに行っているでしょう…」\n私はそういうと、読みかけの本を読む。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3284スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"3033C43B-8CD5-4BB1-9384-9AE996F0B749","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3284","telop":"だが、彼女の親友としてその態度はどうなのだ、と心の中のもう一人の私が、問いかけてくる。「確かに、動くべきかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3285スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"7E853E20-BFF8-44F4-8CF0-538C75A2164F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3285","telop":"だが、そう考えていると、レミリアの部屋から嫌な音が聞こえ、\n私は、いてもたってもいられずに、彼女の部屋に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3286スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BACA0F5B-7C91-4A95-B3AC-64C0F817D1B1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3286","telop":"そこには、光のない目で笑う彼女と、その後ろで目を瞑り、倒れ込んでいる咲夜の姿があった。「あんた…何をしてるの…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3287スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"875EAF40-8E06-4F62-9F55-9475F0F0B65A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3287","telop":"だが、彼女は私の問いかけには反応せず、血が飛び散っているその玄関で、私に襲いかかってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3288スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"60E366D4-0983-4DAE-B40F-67B280D1C30C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3288","telop":"私が、考える隙もなく、彼女は私に牙を向けるのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3289スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CE247FFB-CF19-417A-BF7E-0FFA0789089E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3289","telop":"その頃、フランの部屋では…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3290スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"3035FC38-9681-4B5F-B71F-00C003CA869F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3290","telop":"僕は、フランにプロポーズをした後、彼女と僕は、これまでの出来事を振り返りながら、楽しく喋っていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3291スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"2B8C3FE6-9B38-44BB-800A-68D2727CA130","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3291","telop":"だが、僕の頭には、何か悪い予感めいたものが半分あり、\n彼女との話に集中できているわけではなかった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3292スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"4086EB6A-C119-4829-892A-AF2A3095727D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（怒る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3292","telop":"「ねぇ、私の話聞いてるの、さっきからソワソワしてるけど…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3293スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","id":"4D91E457-5183-4C6A-8E1F-0F14C76C044C","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（怒る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc301377_一人部屋２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 3293","telop":"「フラン…ちょっと待ってて。」僕は、それだけ言い残し、\n彼女部屋を出て、その悪寒が走る部屋に向かう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3294スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B60A5327-04F9-4E5F-811C-5B5EA2F9BDEC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3294","telop":"そして、僕は、その悪寒が走る部屋…フランの２部屋隣のレミリアの部屋のインターホンを押す。だが、反応がない。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3295スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6F0BA05D-894C-4BEE-9937-225FCFB0BBB9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3295","telop":"「レミリアさん、開けますね。」僕はそう言い、ドアノブを捻る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3296スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"BF93D1FD-8F6C-45BA-99B6-61167A39FA3A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3296","telop":"僕が、その部屋の玄関ドアを開け、中に入ると、そこには、見たことのない様子で笑うレミリアの姿があった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3297スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"AB4648DC-F364-400A-A9AF-33509191111C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3297","telop":"そして、彼女の後ろではパチュリーと咲夜が倒れ込んでおり、血飛沫が玄関ホールに飛び散っていた。「レミリアさん…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3298スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"97B805BC-CCB6-4FB7-8663-A138DE3C328A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3298","telop":"「どうしたのよ、操夢。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3299スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A07E85C6-1391-479E-99FB-E5615162C4E5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3299","telop":"「なぜ、あの二人を襲ったのですか、所々壁やドアに傷や凹みを見られますし、もしかして…」僕はそこまで言い、思いつく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3300スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0B8E3253-16C8-450C-A575-9EAF68673540","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3300","telop":"「僕は、人を平気で傷つけて、部屋を傷つける、野蛮な女性は好みませんよ…」僕は、彼女が冷静になれるようにそう悟す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3301スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.6,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8C590608-D80D-4F9A-835D-6AA383CB8282","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3301","telop":"私は、彼にそう言われ、ふとハッとする。\nそして、あるものが込み上げてくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3302スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"36945E82-130A-49BF-8D15-81F30C2FA3DA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3302","telop":"「私は、私は、ただあなたに…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3303スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"66575532-1478-4E64-BD57-30370556744A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3303","telop":"僕は、そっと彼女を抱きしめると、泣きながら、\nそう呟く彼女の頭を、何も言わずにただ撫でる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3304スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"98BB9811-9631-488E-B1E6-4248D33E5EB0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3304","telop":"「私は…バカね…こんなことしたっていいことはないのに…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3305スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"48A527E6-17AC-4A24-B04D-DFBAADE702C2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3305","telop":"「そんなことはないですよ、この共同生活で、心のうちに密めていたものが溢れただけですよ、それに僕はここにいるし…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3306スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"9CCA41B0-6206-449E-9F06-629AAD83D27C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3306","telop":"「そうね…そうよね…、でも…ありがとう、操夢。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3307スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"6971D9FD-FDE3-442B-96BE-1D48DDA03EDB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3307","telop":"「どういたしまして。」\nそれから、僕は彼女が泣き止むまで頭を撫で続けた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3308スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"095B5DD2-860E-498B-9CAC-1C217F45F1C5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3308","telop":"最終回予告","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3309スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"8A22245F-12ED-4E62-93F3-2823B440ACC6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3309","telop":"それから僕は、自室に戻り、この家を出るための準備を進めていた。そして短期間だが、世話になった家に感謝して部屋を出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3310スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"53992A72-311E-4B75-83C4-17A39953C47C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3310","telop":"そして、夕日が照らす共同スペースで、僕たちは、それぞれ一言ずつ述べる。そして、この家に残る人と去る人で分かれる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3311スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg","id":"E3B4B305-F75C-48AA-90EB-7976B50B9157","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd","title":"シーン 3311","telop":"そして、その家を去った僕とフラン、レミリア、パチュリー、咲夜の5人は、彼女たちの実家で新しい生活が始まろうとしていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":20,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"C69E4002-DBDC-4D0D-B849-A818555D096A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"ED499B37-9C6D-40FF-809F-B603A92BA049","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi","telop":"交換夫婦","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3314スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"D6D98D9D-DBAF-415D-A98E-1353DC9DCBB9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3314","telop":"僕は、それから、自室に戻ってくると、感慨の気持ちに触れる。\n「短期間だったけど、色々とあったな…」っと。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3315スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg","id":"45C91240-C180-46FC-965F-EC07F783F1BF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3315","telop":"そして、そんな回想を終わらせると、荷物整理を始める。といっても、事前に大きなものは配送済みなので、ポケベルだけ持つ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3316スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","id":"F11BA5C4-F165-4F57-BFA9-81AFBF4DE65E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg","title":"シーン 3316","telop":"そして、共同スペースに降りてくると、それぞれが準備を済ませたようだった。そして、早く帰宅した霊夢が話し始める。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3317スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F38E40A7-73FD-48F4-AA36-7CB794BE1CD9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3317","telop":"「あんたたち、そろそろ、家を出るんでしょ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3318スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"A1F45635-C294-467B-9BF7-4ECD7E5339D6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3318","telop":"「ええ、そうですよ。けど、魔理沙さんは、電話で聞けば、家に残るといって、さとりとこいしさんも残るみたいですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3319スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"6E591AF2-1466-4CFF-B3D1-665CBAC2BD4D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3319","telop":"「でも…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3320スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C4AFA7C7-DB52-4021-A938-6073CFD0E710","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3320","telop":"「僕が時折こっちに来ますから、寂しい思いはさせませんよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3321スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"C7FADD12-19EF-4AC8-8A89-18B43F3DC6B9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3321","telop":"「そう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3322スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"B15BCCDC-F7AB-4249-84AA-BBAD2863F789","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3322","telop":"僕は、それでも不安そうな彼女の背中に回り、そっと頭を撫でる。「これで、安心できますか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3323スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"718E61AD-1312-4DD1-97C9-BB5FA8E2EE42","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3323","telop":"「ええ、ありがとう、操夢。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3324スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"F154E9A7-BA42-4DB5-9383-5990FC0F5297","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3324","telop":"「操夢、車が来たみたいだよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3325スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"0E23C02F-CD1C-4E58-84DF-52361C08253A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3325","telop":"「それじゃあ、行ってきますね。あと、魔理沙さんに、こないだの件、頼んでありますから、耳立てて聞いてください。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3326スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜（怒る）.png","id":"5E4EF5B0-438B-430B-B3D2-D5837B863190","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3326","telop":"「えっ…」私は彼の一言に、そう呟いているうちに、彼は、そのまま、フランたちの元に向かって言った。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3327スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A20D210C-7AE7-4811-9598-94E656BB4302","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3327","telop":"彼がフランたちの実家に着くと…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3328スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg","id":"BBC1A164-E363-487B-B043-A94EF43A5B73","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd","title":"シーン 3328","telop":"「想定よりも、大きいですね…、この屋敷…」\n僕は、フランたちと共にこの屋敷に入って最初の一言を言う。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3329スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg","id":"B4F2DEB3-A7F2-47B6-A966-2A9CEE5A5108","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd","title":"シーン 3329","telop":"「でも、慣れて仕舞えば、こんなもんですよ。」\n私は、彼の一言にそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3330スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg","id":"608DC74A-7BE4-4DFA-A93F-F83970F1B9B0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd","title":"シーン 3330","telop":"「そうですか…、それで、僕の部屋は？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3331スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg","id":"406E792D-F607-482C-B18B-AD4D2113A448","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd","title":"シーン 3331","telop":"「今から、案内しますね。」\n私はそう言うと、彼に割り当てた部屋の場所に彼を案内する。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3332スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BA052C78-4A2C-412A-8F97-349586BE7F59","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3332","telop":"「ここが、今日から、あなたの部屋です。\n何かありましたら、お気軽にお申し付けください…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3333スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AD670194-ACB9-45A8-A3BF-9EB8D653FAB7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3333","telop":"彼女はそう何かに言い淀むような言い方をして、部屋を出ていった。すると、誰かが部屋の扉をノックする。「どうぞ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3334スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"美鈴","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B3CFD1B2-3C7B-4A78-AEA5-D50FE8403D95","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3334","telop":"「おや、今日から新たな住人になった、操夢さんですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3335スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4E9089C8-F403-4189-9708-7BF1C813992E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3335","telop":"「それで、あなたは…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3336スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"美鈴","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7B854F3B-C105-41D4-86EB-315AB67077F6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3336","telop":"「私の名前は、本美鈴です。夕食ができたので、操夢さんを食堂に案内せよと、レミリアが言ってまして…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3337スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"CEE9DD20-8DBC-4B7D-8F95-C341E09B37BB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3337","telop":"「そうですか…、ちょっと待ってください。」\n僕はそう言い、辺りを一瞬見渡す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3338スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"239D12CE-31A3-424E-B749-CB764F57BE30","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3338","telop":"「今から、動いて大丈夫ですよ。」僕はそう返す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3339スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"美鈴","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"540989E8-569C-47CE-A466-852BE480258A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3339","telop":"「そうですか、それなら案内しましょう。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3340スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","id":"F88719D9-34B9-4805-92BE-D9F84F3089B5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 3340","telop":"そして、僕が食堂に入ると、すでに夕食が配膳されていた。\nそして挨拶を済ますと、皆が食べ始めた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3341スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"413D7041-45E0-4B8A-B0B0-D03321062A0D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3341","telop":"それからしばらくたち…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3342スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"25697A0D-9215-403C-A081-18CB6EAA3D0C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3342","telop":"僕が食事を終えて、歯を磨いた後、部屋でくつろいでると、\n再び、部屋の扉がノックされる。「どうぞ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3343スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7651CBFC-4D41-4A0F-B317-AAE0E2DF8726","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3343","telop":"すると、入ってきたのはフランだった。\n「どうしたんですか、そんな表情をして？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3344スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"042C1B69-CAEB-46A2-9F2A-8F88AA2B8D26","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3344","telop":"「操夢…一緒に、お風呂入ろう…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3345スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"48BBE2C3-4289-477B-BDAD-19EEC0337D10","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3345","telop":"僕は、少し考え込む。そして、彼女が何を言わんとしているかを把握する。「いいですよ。一緒に入っても。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3346スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E671542F-7D12-40F2-A378-9527E982F7D0","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3346","telop":"「それじゃあ、先に言って待ってるね！」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3347スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BA6224F0-A171-4DBB-B562-91D0D0206B25","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3347","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、部屋をさっていった。僕は、なぜあんなことを聞いたのか気になったが、とりあえず着替えを持っていった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3348スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"638160B9-6A0A-4565-A7F1-04BA39ABA0D8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3348","telop":"二人が入浴を終えると…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3349スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"49CAC823-D830-4B56-BCBE-74B3267A8682","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3349","telop":"僕たちは、風呂から上がると、僕の部屋で、しばし談笑をしていた。それで、共同生活よりも前の話を色々と聞く。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3350スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2F15487C-A525-480C-85CA-46A3A1033B7E","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3350","telop":"「それで、操夢は共同生活が始まるまではどうしてたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3351スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8DF1D645-ECD2-4106-A8CD-2F916AEEA4A2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3351","telop":"僕は、ふと彼女にそう聞かれ、どう返答するべきか迷う。\nそして、それとなく組み立てた文章を話す。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3352スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DD124D47-1A9B-499D-B30B-7455E38D7A88","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3352","telop":"「まぁ、僕は今が、良ければそれでいいと思ってます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3353スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"DEBBBF13-BD20-469C-B94A-4D8BEA33BA91","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3353","telop":"「私も、操夢と同じかな、今が良ければ、それでいいって思う。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3354スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"1A7DC3B6-31FD-4694-A926-330E76815D4D","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3354","telop":"「それより、レミリアさんの様子はどうですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3355スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"E20DDA92-DAED-4A6D-8B45-21C2C57AA90B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3355","telop":"「さぁ、知らない…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3356スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"90401832-F3FB-4859-9E05-E87CFFC7FB30","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（困り）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3356","telop":"「なら…ちょっと、席を外しますね…」\n僕はそう言うと、部屋から出ていく。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3357スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"719B84B3-D369-4108-AF4A-D2BA38F120E3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3357","telop":"僕が、レミリアの部屋に来ると、彼女は驚いていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3358スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"7AA4F8F9-D956-4431-BABD-CACF86212F21","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3358","telop":"「どうしたのよ…、私のとこに来て？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3359スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BC6ECDDB-1CD5-4925-9D5E-723776366727","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3359","telop":"「レミリアさんに、謝りたいことがあってきたんですよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3360スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9435A83B-D527-4E66-918E-B3FE8165D00C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3360","telop":"「謝りたいこと？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3361スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2F1F84EF-0280-4550-A4C7-1AD0AC7D3220","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3361","telop":"「僕が、フランに指輪を渡す瞬間を見せてしまったことを謝りたくて…、フランの部屋で渡せば良かったなって反省してます。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3362スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B6AC9137-63CE-4AB3-9DFB-6F82F2B2D874","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3362","telop":"「それは、もういいわよ。暴れたのは私で、過ぎたことだし。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3363スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EB6815D7-53B5-4296-BD58-217C6A949FAB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3363","telop":"「そうですか…でももし今度、何かあったら言ってください…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3364スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BC804690-3264-4462-8120-2060CC05F6A5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3364","telop":"「それなら、一つだけ、いいかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3365スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AC2A96C2-A460-46B8-AAF7-CDBA94F0E8E4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3365","telop":"「はい、いいですよ。それで何でしょう？」\n僕がそう尋ねると、彼女が僕の背中に回る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3366スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"6CDDAF8E-BCAF-4F83-AAAB-E452D1E3D661","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3366","telop":"すると、僕に彼女は背後から抱きつき、\n顔を背中に埋めているが、感覚で伝わってくる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3367スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"F9936A0A-A72D-460C-A320-07A0C38A7CB3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3367","telop":"「私がたまに、あなたを呼んだらこうやってくれないかしら？こうしてくれると、心が温まるし、2度とはああならないから…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3368スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"72156DEF-BD5E-450E-BFD5-B57667484EDE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3368","telop":"「ええ、お安い御用ですよ。」僕は、そう言いながら、\n彼女の背後に回り、そっと頭を撫でる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3369スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"B5AD1A8E-108B-4326-9E95-14ED6BC163CE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3369","telop":"「ありがとう、操夢。これから、私たちの一員として、\nよろしくね…、フランの…、旦那さん…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3370スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"D623ADE6-BE26-47B0-B697-D207A371E69B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3370","telop":"「ええ、もちろん。」\n僕たちは、そう言って、新生活が始まった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3371スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","animationName":"なし","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"60A37C13-49ED-43D4-95CB-2D7811641BAB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3371","telop":"時代が進み…\n※詳細は、彷徨う二人の5話目を参照してください。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3372スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"FA76D845-B008-4183-B305-D00DEA084E1A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3372","telop":"私は、久々にフランと対面したが、どうやらフレラとの違いは、この記録を見る限り見た目だけだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3373スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"7C15DABF-8FC6-4294-82CF-40FF91FED25A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3373","telop":"「でも、あれから少なくとも１世紀以上経ってるのよね…」\n私は、幻想郷にいた頃が遠い昔のように感じられる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3374スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"12B00C72-CF50-430A-B244-607A4E64192F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3374","telop":"21世紀半ばに、幻想郷から外の世界へ大移動、そして21世紀の後半には、彼の先祖が誕生、そして、さらに、時がたち今…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3375スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"A16A1147-34A1-4C75-9B27-F12EBE73CA6C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3375","telop":"彼の先祖は、代々とその記憶を受け継ぎ、彼の種族は、世界のシステムと覇権を握り締め、その一端が彼になっている。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3376スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"FE84FDD8-4DD7-41EF-8FB8-8E6CFBDC7AF4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3376","telop":"そして、「その記憶のバックアップ本」がこの図書館に眠っていると…、「誰が予想してたのかしら、こんな未来…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3377スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"366E23C3-4BD1-4F18-ABD5-713650D55241","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3377","telop":"すると、フレラが、私のもとにやってくる。\n「フレラ、この本の山、片付けてくれるかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3378スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"87E4C977-101E-4996-B898-FBF6C93AE802","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3378","telop":"「分かった。」私はそう言うと、その本の山を片付ける。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3379スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"811E4F6F-7218-47C8-90F6-F1F0D000F044","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3379","telop":"「それで、あのバックアップ本で何を調べていたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3380スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"CB446FF4-1981-4D1B-8E6C-5036A6491037","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3380","telop":"「ちょっと、昔を思い出したくてね…、\nそれで、フランからどんな話を聞いていたの？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3381スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"95A8D094-B6E1-4136-943B-1DC6043F83EE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3381","telop":"「例えばね…」\n私はそう、私の先祖であるフランから聞いた話をする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3382スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"A8D51BA7-71BC-414E-A07E-C882BF55A8FC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3382","telop":"私は、彼女の話を聞き、ふとさっきまで読んでいた本当の違いに気づく。幻想郷と外の世界では時間軸がずれているようだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3383スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"5F4B7DE2-5BFA-4452-8DD5-D06C8AB00FAF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3383","telop":"「だとしても、おかしいわね…、\nフランは、何か日付に関することを言ってたかしら？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3384スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"DBEE5A88-7454-4BC4-AB0F-B7AD2FF3F663","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3384","telop":"「いや、特に言ってなかった。\nただ、レミリアに追い出されたって。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3385スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"4DF085C5-F841-4474-BB79-1F47EE4C3A34","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3385","telop":"「悪いけど、さっき片付けた本の収納棚から、\n2070年前後の記録を撮ってきてくれるかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3386スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"1AFA3B67-B15D-4654-A07C-45EE9B5FCF5B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3386","telop":"「分かった。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3387スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"15ABF14E-F07E-4270-8E00-A4459F839531","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3387","telop":"私は、彼がここに立ち寄った際に、もらった紅茶を嗜みながら、先ほどの矛盾点を考える…「時代錯誤かしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3388スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"3914C616-2037-42E4-BC4D-CE757878A9FB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3388","telop":"「持ってきたよ。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3389スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"2975DA88-72D5-4C42-A49A-8CC1819B3C26","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3389","telop":"「どれどれ…」私は先ほど、読んだ本をもう一度、読み直す。\nそこには、彼の先祖とフランの結婚生活が描かれていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3390スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"4ED3CE90-E6BB-49C3-A5A5-40CD8D6626C6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3390","telop":"だが、ある日の記載に疑問を抱く。\nその日の記録にはこう書いてあった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3391スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"36DFA362-FA94-4F72-A3A2-95FAAAD21FE9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3391","telop":"207×年、4月⚪︎日。僕は、新生活の始まりから×年目のある日、僕は、2年前に手がけたシステムからある情報を入手した。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3392スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BE370F43-371D-4A7C-87AA-50DF33AD656F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3392","telop":"僕は、その日、フランとの予定に断りを入れて、急ぎ東京の某所にある円球機械室に入り、操作盤を触る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3393スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4D6992A1-5A6E-441C-9A92-73260B10580E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3393","telop":"そして、そこで見た情報は、年表に関する事柄だった。\nどうやら、フランたちが元々いた幻想郷からの伝達だった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3394スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"59D0DE8F-8D22-430A-8BC8-839E87028A60","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3394","telop":"前々から総理には、幻想郷の今を調べてほしいと依頼されていたので、僕はその情報の通知が自分のPCに出てすぐにきた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3395スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8BF819D8-E354-4B37-B3B2-FC69B33526E7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3395","telop":"そして、幻想郷の某所から送られた情報を調べると…、不可解な事実が浮かび上がる…。僕はさらに、深掘りする。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3396スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"380D1AAF-990B-4186-A502-79424E2CB83E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3396","telop":"そして、ある事実が判明する。それは、2000年代初頭に閉鎖されたとある発電所の残骸が、幻想郷に存在すると言うことだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3397スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"3F87A4C7-852D-49A9-B68B-6F17DF5BBF76","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3397","telop":"その施設から、送られてきた内容は、ある日、施設が爆発を起こし、その影響で、あるものが歪んでしまっていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3398スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2C60F1B3-B360-4FDB-963B-B76BC512A20B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3398","telop":"僕はそこから、ある仮説を立てる。実は、総理たちがこっちにきたと言う事実が、その爆発で消えているのではないかと…。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3399スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"14FD7FC3-AA76-4518-81CC-64095C3E7FA7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3399","telop":"そして、彼女たちがこちらにきた後、ふと彼女が確認を試みようとした時には確認できなかったため、その間に爆発が起きる。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3400スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4DE22858-A6B6-4E72-9269-09E4CBBC4A5A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3400","telop":"僕は、その仮説にさらにこう付け足す。その爆発によって、一度消えたものが再び現れていると。爆発から生を生み出したのだ。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3401スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"EF654FE1-5079-466E-8349-9DF13BE25798","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 3401","telop":"これは、何かのいたずらだ…僕はそう決定づけ、その事後報告を総理に伝えてから、フランのとこに戻るのだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3402スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"89A69146-0D2D-402F-B14B-2DADD1A7B1D8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3402","telop":"「これって、もしかしたら…、幻想郷で再び芽生えた彼女が、\nこの世界に来たと言うことになるのかしら…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3403スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"9EC044F1-8C19-41AB-8CAD-27F4015BA66D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3403","telop":"私は機械音痴だから、詳細は解りかねたが、そう言う言葉を述べた。「破壊と生は常に一つなり…、どこかにありそうだわ…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3404スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"D0E2EBCE-AE56-411A-B7F7-C14D1E3368EB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3404","telop":"「ありがとう、フレラ、本を戻してきてちょうだい。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3405スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"F4332099-2203-4E36-BB5F-073E15AAE484","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3405","telop":"「分かった。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"第3406スライド","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","id":"9F928C89-EE02-41EB-BDD2-F1A6CB53C5F2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","title":"シーン 3406","telop":"私は、それから彼にもらった紅茶を嗜みながら、「ふぅ…」と吐く。私では、この世界を把握するには足りないようだった。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1},{"slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"","animationName":"なし","duration":20,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"","backgroundName":"単色背景","id":"C9EA2152-2239-4B86-9CAF-8FDBA821F066","seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました","telop":"","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1}]